 de <strong data-start=3D"1140" data-end=3D"1151">32 bits</strong>, divis=
=C3=A9s en <strong data-start=3D"1164" data-end=3D"1192">4 octets (8 bits c=
hacun)</strong>, s=C3=A9par=C3=A9s par des points.<br data-start=3D"1217" d=
ata-end=3D"1220">
=F0=9F=91=89 <strong data-start=3D"1223" data-end=3D"1251">Exemple d=E2=80=
=99adresse IPv4 :</strong> <code data-start=3D"1252" data-end=3D"1266">192.=
168.1.10</code></p>
