<hr data-start=3D"4401" data-end=3D"4404" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"4406" data-end=3D"4464" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4410" data-end=3D"4464">3.2. Configurer un Serveur DNS avec Windows Server<=
/strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4466" data-end=3D"4589" class=3D"">Sur un serveur Windows,=
 vous pouvez configurer le r=C3=B4le <strong data-start=3D"4521" data-end=
=3D"4535">DNS Server</strong> pour g=C3=A9rer les r=C3=A9solutions de noms =
dans votre r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4591" data-end=3D"4623" class=3D"">1. Installation du R=
=C3=B4le DNS</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4624" data-end=3D"4812">
<li data-start=3D"4624" data-end=3D"4697" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4626" data-end=3D"4697" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"4633" data-end=3D"4651">Server Manager</strong>, puis cliquez sur <st=
rong data-start=3D"4670" data-end=3D"4696">Add roles and features</strong>.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4698" data-end=3D"4762" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4700" data-end=3D"4762" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4713" data-end=3D"4727">DNS Server</strong> dans la liste =
des r=C3=B4les =C3=A0 ajouter.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4763" data-end=3D"4812" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4765" data-end=3D"4812" class=3D"">Suivez les instructions=
 pour installer le r=C3=B4le.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"4814" data-end=3D"4845" class=3D"">2. Configurer une Zone=
 DNS</h4>
<p data-start=3D"4846" data-end=3D"4942" class=3D"">Une zone DNS est une ba=
se de donn=C3=A9es qui contient des informations sur les domaines d'un r=C3=
=A9seau.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4944" data-end=3D"5141">
<li data-start=3D"4944" data-end=3D"4998" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4946" data-end=3D"4998" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"4953" data-end=3D"4968">DNS Manager</strong> depuis le <strong data-s=
tart=3D"4979" data-end=3D"4997">Server Manager</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4999" data-end=3D"5068" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5001" data-end=3D"5068" class=3D"">Clic droit sur <strong =
data-start=3D"5016" data-end=3D"5040">Forward Lookup Zones</strong> et choi=
sissez <strong data-start=3D"5055" data-end=3D"5067">New Zone</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5069" data-end=3D"5141" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5071" data-end=3D"5141" class=3D"">Suivez l=E2=80=99assist=
ant pour cr=C3=A9er une <strong data-start=3D"5105" data-end=3D"5122">zone =
primaire</strong> (zone principale).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5143" data-end=3D"5182" class=3D"">3. Ajouter des Enregis=
trements DNS</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5183" data-end=3D"5471">
<li data-start=3D"5183" data-end=3D"5274" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5185" data-end=3D"5274" class=3D"">Une fois la zone cr=C3=
=A9=C3=A9e, vous pouvez ajouter des enregistrements DNS (A, CNAME, MX, etc.=
).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5275" data-end=3D"5471" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5277" data-end=3D"5471" class=3D"">Par exemple, pour ajout=
er un enregistrement pour un serveur web dans le domaine, s=C3=A9lectionnez=
 <strong data-start=3D"5371" data-end=3D"5395">New Host (A or AAAA)</strong=
> et entrez le nom d=E2=80=99h=C3=B4te (par exemple, <strong data-start=3D"=
5434" data-end=3D"5441">www</strong>), et l=E2=80=99adresse IP du serveur.<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5473" data-end=3D"5476" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5478" data-end=3D"5519" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
