<li data-start=3D"2947" data-end=3D"3153" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2950" data-end=3D"2982" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
950" data-end=3D"2982">Ouvrir les Param=C3=A8tres R=C3=A9seau</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2986" data-end=3D"3153">
<li data-start=3D"2986" data-end=3D"3061" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2988" data-end=3D"3061" class=3D"">Appuyez sur <code data-=
start=3D"3000" data-end=3D"3013">Windows + R</code>, tapez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"3021" data-end=3D"3033">ncpa.cpl</strong>, puis appuyez sur <code dat=
a-start=3D"3052" data-end=3D"3060">Entr=C3=A9e</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3065" data-end=3D"3150" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3067" data-end=3D"3150" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez la co=
nnexion r=C3=A9seau que vous souhaitez configurer (Ethernet ou Wi-Fi).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3154" data-end=3D"3281" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3157" data-end=3D"3199" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
157" data-end=3D"3199">Acc=C3=A9der aux Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de la Connexio=
n</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3203" data-end=3D"3281">
<li data-start=3D"3203" data-end=3D"3281" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3205" data-end=3D"3281" class=3D"">Faites un <strong data-=
start=3D"3215" data-end=3D"3229">clic droit</strong> sur la connexion, puis=
 s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"3266" data-end=3D"3280">Propri=C3=
=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3283" data-end=3D"3960" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3286" data-end=3D"3322" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
286" data-end=3D"3322">Modifier les Param=C3=A8tres TCP/IPv4</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3326" data-end=3D"3960">
<li data-start=3D"3326" data-end=3D"3439" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3328" data-end=3D"3439" class=3D"">Dans les <strong data-s=
tart=3D"3337" data-end=3D"3351">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong> de la connexi=
on r=C3=A9seau, double-cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"3395" data-end=3D"=
3438">Protocole Internet Version 4 (TCP/IPv4)</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3443" data-end=3D"3960" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3445" data-end=3D"3540" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez l'opt=
ion <strong data-start=3D"3467" data-end=3D"3501">Utiliser l'adresse IP sui=
vante</strong> et entrez les informations suivantes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3546" data-end=3D"3960">
<li data-start=3D"3546" data-end=3D"3651" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3548" data-end=3D"3651" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
548" data-end=3D"3562">Adresse IP</strong> : Choisissez une adresse dans vo=
tre plage d'adresses r=C3=A9seau, par exemple <code data-start=3D"3636" dat=
a-end=3D"3650">192.168.1.10</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3657" data-end=3D"3745" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3659" data-end=3D"3745" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
659" data-end=3D"3684">Masque de sous-r=C3=A9seau</strong> : <code data-sta=
rt=3D"3687" data-end=3D"3702">255.255.255.0</code> (standard pour un r=C3=
=A9seau local classique).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3751" data-end=3D"3850" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3753" data-end=3D"3850" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
753" data-end=3D"3778">Passerelle par d=C3=A9faut</strong> : Adresse IP du =
routeur ou de la passerelle, par exemple <code data-start=3D"3836" data-end=
=3D"3849">192.168.1.1</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3856" data-end=3D"3960" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3858" data-end=3D"3960" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
858" data-end=3D"3883">Serveurs DNS pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9r=C3=A9s</strong> : Par =
exemple, utilisez <code data-start=3D"3908" data-end=3D"3917">8.8.8.8</code=
> pour Google DNS ou l'adresse du DNS local.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3962" data-end=3D"4035" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3965" data-end=3D"3979" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
965" data-end=3D"3979">Validation</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3983" data-end=3D"4035">
<li data-start=3D"3983" data-end=3D"4035" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3985" data-end=3D"4035" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3997" data-end=3D"4003">OK</strong> pour appliquer les param=C3=
=A8tres.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4037" data-end=3D"4176" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4040" data-end=3D"4056" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
040" data-end=3D"4056">V=C3=A9rification</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4060" data-end=3D"4176">
<li data-start=3D"4060" data-end=3D"4176" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4062" data-end=3D"4176" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"4069" data-end=3D"4076">cmd</strong> (Invite de commandes) et tapez <=
code data-start=3D"4108" data-end=3D"4123">ipconfig /all</code> pour v=C3=
=A9rifier que l'adresse IP a bien =C3=A9t=C3=A9 attribu=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4178" data-end=3D"4181" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4183" data-end=3D"4226" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4186" data-end=3D"4226">3. Configuration IP Dynamique (DHCP)</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4228" data-end=3D"4468" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"4232" data-end=3D"4256">adresse IP dynamique</strong> est attribu=C3=A9=
e automatiquement =C3=A0 un appareil par un serveur <strong data-start=3D"4=
316" data-end=3D"4324">DHCP</strong> (Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol).=
 Le serveur DHCP attribue des adresses IP =C3=A0 la demande et les lib=C3=
=A8re lorsqu=E2=80=99elles ne sont plus utilis=C3=A9es.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4470" data-end=3D"4510" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4474" data-end=3D"4510">3.1. Avantages de l=E2=80=99IP Dynamique</strong></=
h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4511" data-end=3D"4866">
<li data-start=3D"4511" data-end=3D"4652" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4513" data-end=3D"4652" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
513" data-end=3D"4527">Simplicit=C3=A9</strong> : Id=C3=A9al pour les r=C3=
=A9seaux o=C3=B9 il est n=C3=A9cessaire de connecter de nombreux appareils =
(ordinateurs, t=C3=A9l=C3=A9phones, tablettes, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4653" data-end=3D"4770" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4655" data-end=3D"4770" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
655" data-end=3D"4678">Gestion automatis=C3=A9e</strong> : Le serveur DHCP =
g=C3=A8re automatiquement les adresses IP, =C3=A9vitant ainsi les erreurs h=
umaines.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4771" data-end=3D"4866" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4773" data-end=3D"4866" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
773" data-end=3D"4788">Scalabilit=C3=A9</strong> : Facile =C3=A0 =C3=A9tend=
re sans avoir =C3=A0 g=C3=A9rer manuellement chaque appareil du r=C3=A9seau=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4868" data-end=3D"4912" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4872" data-end=3D"4912">3.2. Inconv=C3=A9nients de l=E2=80=99IP Dynamique</=
strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4913" data-end=3D"5125">
<li data-start=3D"4913" data-end=3D"5046" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4915" data-end=3D"5046" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
915" data-end=3D"4940">Adresse IP changeante</strong> : Les appareils peuve=
nt avoir des adresses IP diff=C3=A9rentes =C3=A0 chaque red=C3=A9marrage ou=
 renouvellement de bail.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5047" data-end=3D"5125" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5049" data-end=3D"5125" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
049" data-end=3D"5124">Moins adapt=C3=A9 pour les serveurs ou services n=C3=
=A9cessitant une adresse fixe</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5127" data-end=3D"5188" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5131" data-end=3D"5188">3.3. Comment Configurer une IP Dynamique sous Windo=
ws</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5190" data-end=3D"5977">
<li data-start=3D"5190" data-end=3D"5345" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5193" data-end=3D"5225" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
193" data-end=3D"5225">Ouvrir les Param=C3=A8tres R=C3=A9seau</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"5229" data-end=3D"5345">
<li data-start=3D"5229" data-end=3D"5345" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5231" data-end=3D"5345" class=3D"">Comme pour la configura=
tion IP statique, appuyez sur <code data-start=3D"5284" data-end=3D"5297">W=
indows + R</code>, tapez <strong data-start=3D"5305" data-end=3D"5317">ncpa=
.cpl</strong>, puis appuyez sur <code data-start=3D"5336" data-end=3D"5344"=
>Entr=C3=A9e</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5347" data-end=3D"5491" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5350" data-end=3D"5392" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
350" data-end=3D"5392">Acc=C3=A9der aux Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de la Connexio=
n</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"5396" data-end=3D"5491">
<li data-start=3D"5396" data-end=3D"5491" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5398" data-end=3D"5491" class=3D"">Faites un <strong data-=
start=3D"5408" data-end=3D"5422">clic droit</strong> sur la connexion (Ethe=
rnet ou Wi-Fi) et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"5476" data-end=3D=
"5490">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5493" data-end=3D"5755" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5496" data-end=3D"5515" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
496" data-end=3D"5515">Activer le DHCP</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"5519" data-end=3D"5755">
<li data-start=3D"5519" data-end=3D"5632" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5521" data-end=3D"5632" class=3D"">Dans les <strong data-s=
tart=3D"5530" data-end=3D"5544">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong> de la connexi=
on r=C3=A9seau, double-cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"5588" data-end=3D"=
5631">Protocole Internet Version 4 (TCP/IPv4)</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5636" data-end=3D"5755" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5638" data-end=3D"5755" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"5651" data-end=3D"5693">Obtenir une adresse IP automatique=
ment</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"5697" data-end=3D"5754">Obtenir les =
adresses des serveurs DNS automatiquement</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5757" data-end=3D"5829" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5760" data-end=3D"5774" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
760" data-end=3D"5774">Validation</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"5778" data-end=3D"5829">
<li data-start=3D"5778" data-end=3D"5829" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5780" data-end=3D"5829" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5792" data-end=3D"5798">OK</strong> pour appliquer les param=C3=
=A8tres.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5831" data-end=3D"5977" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5834" data-end=3D"5850" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
834" data-end=3D"5850">V=C3=A9rification</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"5854" data-end=3D"5977">
<li data-start=3D"5854" data-end=3D"5977" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5856" data-end=3D"5977" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5863" data-end=3D"5870">cmd</strong> et tapez <code data-start=3D"588=
0" data-end=3D"5895">ipconfig /all</code> pour v=C3=A9rifier que l'adresse =
IP a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 attribu=C3=A9e dynamiquement par le serveur DHCP.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
