<ul data-start=3D"3868" data-end=3D"4075">
<li data-start=3D"3868" data-end=3D"3909" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3870" data-end=3D"3909" class=3D"">Cochez la case <strong =
data-start=3D"3885" data-end=3D"3908">Partager ce dossier</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3913" data-end=3D"4075" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3915" data-end=3D"4075" class=3D"">Vous pouvez =C3=A9galem=
ent sp=C3=A9cifier un nom de partage, qui sera utilis=C3=A9 pour identifier=
 le dossier sur le r=C3=A9seau. Par d=C3=A9faut, il prendra le m=C3=AAme no=
m que le dossier.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4077" data-end=3D"4503" class=3D"">
