<ul data-start=3D"4547" data-end=3D"4621">
<li data-start=3D"4547" data-end=3D"4621" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4621" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4561" data-end=3D"4567">OK</strong> pour enregistrer les param=
=C3=A8tres et fermer la fen=C3=AAtre.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4623" data-end=3D"4666" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4627" data-end=3D"4666">3.2. Partager un fichier sp=C3=A9cifique</strong></=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"4668" data-end=3D"4784" class=3D"">La m=C3=A9thode pour pa=
rtager un fichier individuel est similaire =C3=A0 celle du partage de dossi=
er. Voici comment proc=C3=A9der :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4786" data-end=3D"5533">
<li data-start=3D"4786" data-end=3D"4898" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4789" data-end=3D"4829" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
789" data-end=3D"4827">S=C3=A9lectionner le fichier =C3=A0 partager</strong=
> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4833" data-end=3D"4898">
<li data-start=3D"4833" data-end=3D"4898" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4835" data-end=3D"4898" class=3D"">Localisez le fichier =
=C3=A0 partager dans l'Explorateur de fichiers.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4900" data-end=3D"5014" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4903" data-end=3D"4934" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
903" data-end=3D"4932">Clic droit sur le fichier</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4938" data-end=3D"5014">
<li data-start=3D"4938" data-end=3D"5014" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4940" data-end=3D"5014" class=3D"">Faites un <strong data-=
start=3D"4950" data-end=3D"4964">clic droit</strong> sur le fichier, puis s=
=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"4999" data-end=3D"5013">Propri=C3=A9=
t=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5016" data-end=3D"5124" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5019" data-end=3D"5054" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
019" data-end=3D"5052">Acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99onglet de partage</str=
ong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5058" data-end=3D"5124">
<li data-start=3D"5058" data-end=3D"5124" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5060" data-end=3D"5124" class=3D"">Cliquez sur l'onglet <s=
trong data-start=3D"5081" data-end=3D"5092">Partage</strong> dans la fen=C3=
=AAtre des propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5126" data-end=3D"5235" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5129" data-end=3D"5164" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
129" data-end=3D"5162">Activer le partage du fichier</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5168" data-end=3D"5235">
<li data-start=3D"5168" data-end=3D"5235" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5170" data-end=3D"5235" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5182" data-end=3D"5200">Partage avanc=C3=A9</strong> et cochez <=
strong data-start=3D"5211" data-end=3D"5234">Partager ce fichier</strong>.<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5237" data-end=3D"5440" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5240" data-end=3D"5269" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
240" data-end=3D"5267">D=C3=A9finir les permissions</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5273" data-end=3D"5440">
<li data-start=3D"5273" data-end=3D"5440" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5275" data-end=3D"5440" class=3D"">D=C3=A9finissez les per=
missions en s=C3=A9lectionnant les utilisateurs ou groupes qui auront acc=
=C3=A8s au fichier. Choisissez les niveaux d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s appropri=C3=
=A9s (lecture ou =C3=A9criture).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5442" data-end=3D"5533" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5445" data-end=3D"5471" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
