<li data-start=3D"6763" data-end=3D"6926" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6766" data-end=3D"6791" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
766" data-end=3D"6789">Partager le dossier</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6795" data-end=3D"6926">
<li data-start=3D"6795" data-end=3D"6926" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6797" data-end=3D"6926" class=3D"">Vous avez d=C3=A9j=C3=
=A0 partag=C3=A9 le dossier via les options classiques (clic droit sur le d=
ossier &gt; Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s &gt; Partage &gt; Partage avanc=C3=A9).</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6928" data-end=3D"7209" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6931" data-end=3D"6973" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
