<h3 data-start=3D"3208" data-end=3D"3243" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3212" data-end=3D"3241">Explication des r=C3=A9sultats</strong> :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3244" data-end=3D"4029">
<li data-start=3D"3244" data-end=3D"3317" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3246" data-end=3D"3317" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
246" data-end=3D"3266">Adresse IP cible</strong> : <code data-start=3D"3269=
" data-end=3D"3285">142.250.190.78</code> est l'adresse IP de google.com.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3318" data-end=3D"3404" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3320" data-end=3D"3404" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
320" data-end=3D"3330">Octets</strong> : La taille du paquet de donn=C3=A9e=
s envoy=C3=A9 en octets (32 octets par d=C3=A9faut).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3405" data-end=3D"3581" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3407" data-end=3D"3581" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
407" data-end=3D"3426">Temps (latence)</strong> : Le temps en millisecondes=
 (ms) qu=E2=80=99il faut pour que le paquet voyage jusqu'=C3=A0 l=E2=80=99h=
=C3=B4te et revienne. Un temps faible indique une bonne performance du r=C3=
=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3582" data-end=3D"3800" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3584" data-end=3D"3800" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
584" data-end=3D"3606">TTL (Time to Live)</strong> : Le nombre de "sauts" (=
hops) que le paquet a fait avant d'atteindre la cible. Un TTL de 56 signifi=
e que le paquet a travers=C3=A9 56 routeurs ou dispositifs r=C3=A9seau avan=
t d'arriver =C3=A0 sa destination.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3801" data-end=3D"4029" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3803" data-end=3D"4029" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
803" data-end=3D"3819">Statistiques</strong> : Une r=C3=A9capitulation indi=
quant le nombre de paquets envoy=C3=A9s, re=C3=A7us, et perdus (en cas de p=
robl=C3=A8me de connectivit=C3=A9). Le <strong data-start=3D"3939" data-end=
=3D"3974">pourcentage de perte de paquets</strong> donne une indication sur=
 la stabilit=C3=A9 de la connexion.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4031" data-end=3D"4034" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"4036" data-end=3D"4090" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4040" data-end=3D"4090">3.1. R=C3=A9sultats possibles et leur signification=
</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4092" data-end=3D"5103">
<li data-start=3D"4092" data-end=3D"4332" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4095" data-end=3D"4117" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
095" data-end=3D"4114">R=C3=A9ponse normale</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4121" data-end=3D"4332">
<li data-start=3D"4121" data-end=3D"4195" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4123" data-end=3D"4195" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
123" data-end=3D"4134">Exemple</strong> : <code data-start=3D"4137" data-en=
d=3D"4195">R=C3=A9ponse de 142.250.190.78 : octets=3D32 temps=3D14 ms TTL=
=3D56</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4199" data-end=3D"4332" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4201" data-end=3D"4332" class=3D"">Cela signifie que l'h=
=C3=B4te cible est joignable, et les paquets de donn=C3=A9es ont =C3=A9t=C3=
=A9 envoy=C3=A9s et re=C3=A7us avec un temps de latence de 14 ms.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4334" data-end=3D"4641" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4337" data-end=3D"4379" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
337" data-end=3D"4377">Demande de d=C3=A9lai d'attente (Timeout)</strong> :=
</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4383" data-end=3D"4641">
<li data-start=3D"4383" data-end=3D"4443" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4385" data-end=3D"4443" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
385" data-end=3D"4396">Exemple</strong> : <code data-start=3D"4399" data-en=
d=3D"4443">Demande de d=C3=A9lai d'attente pour la demande</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4447" data-end=3D"4641" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4449" data-end=3D"4641" class=3D"">Cela indique que l'h=C3=
=B4te n'a pas r=C3=A9pondu dans le d=C3=A9lai imparti (g=C3=A9n=C3=A9raleme=
nt 4 secondes). Cela peut =C3=AAtre d=C3=BB =C3=A0 un probl=C3=A8me de r=C3=
=A9seau, =C3=A0 un pare-feu bloquant le ping ou =C3=A0 l'h=C3=B4te =C3=A9ta=
nt hors ligne.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4643" data-end=3D"4867" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4646" data-end=3D"4676" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
646" data-end=3D"4674">Destination inaccessible</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4680" data-end=3D"4867">
<li data-start=3D"4680" data-end=3D"4741" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4682" data-end=3D"4741" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
682" data-end=3D"4693">Exemple</strong> : <code data-start=3D"4696" data-en=
d=3D"4741">Impossible de joindre l'h=C3=B4te de destination</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4745" data-end=3D"4867" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4747" data-end=3D"4867" class=3D"">Cela signifie que le r=
=C3=A9seau ne peut pas atteindre l'h=C3=B4te cible. Cela peut =C3=AAtre d=
=C3=BB =C3=A0 un probl=C3=A8me de routage ou de r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4869" data-end=3D"5103" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4872" data-end=3D"4894" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
872" data-end=3D"4892">Perte de paquets</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4898" data-end=3D"5103">
<li data-start=3D"4898" data-end=3D"4972" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4900" data-end=3D"4972" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
900" data-end=3D"4911">Exemple</strong> : <code data-start=3D"4914" data-en=
d=3D"4972">Paquets : envoy=C3=A9s =3D 4, re=C3=A7us =3D 2, perdus =3D 2 (pe=
rte 50%)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4976" data-end=3D"5103" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4978" data-end=3D"5103" class=3D"">Une perte de paquets es=
t g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement un signe de congestion r=C3=A9seau, de probl=C3=A8=
mes de configuration ou de mat=C3=A9riel d=C3=A9fectueux.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5105" data-end=3D"5108" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5110" data-end=3D"5172" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5113" data-end=3D"5172">4. Utilisation avanc=C3=A9e de la commande ping sou=
s Windows</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5174" data-end=3D"5220" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5178" data-end=3D"5220">4.1. Ping avec options suppl=C3=A9mentaires</strong=
></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5222" data-end=3D"5396" class=3D"">Il existe plusieurs opt=
ions suppl=C3=A9mentaires que vous pouvez utiliser pour personnaliser la co=
mmande <strong data-start=3D"5322" data-end=3D"5330">ping</strong> et en ti=
rer plus d=E2=80=99informations utiles. Voici quelques exemples :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5398" data-end=3D"6705">
