c ping</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7282" data-end=3D"7326" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7286" data-end=3D"7326">5.1. Aucune r=C3=A9ponse du serveur cible</strong><=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"7328" data-end=3D"7407" class=3D"">Si vous ne recevez pas =
de r=C3=A9ponse =C3=A0 un ping, il peut y avoir plusieurs causes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7408" data-end=3D"7613">
<li data-start=3D"7408" data-end=3D"7459" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7410" data-end=3D"7459" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
410" data-end=3D"7458">Probl=C3=A8me de c=C3=A2blage ou de connexion physiq=
ue</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7460" data-end=3D"7532" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7462" data-end=3D"7532" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
462" data-end=3D"7494">Probl=C3=A8me de configuration IP</strong> (mauvaise=
 adresse IP ou sous-r=C3=A9seau).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7533" data-end=3D"7575" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7535" data-end=3D"7575" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
535" data-end=3D"7547">Pare-feu</strong> bloquant les requ=C3=AAtes ICMP.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7576" data-end=3D"7613" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7578" data-end=3D"7613" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
578" data-end=3D"7612">H=C3=B4te hors ligne ou hors r=C3=A9seau</strong>.</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7615" data-end=3D"7662" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7619" data-end=3D"7662">5.2. Latence =C3=A9lev=C3=A9e ou perte de paquets</=
strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7664" data-end=3D"7741" class=3D"">Des temps de latence =
=C3=A9lev=C3=A9s ou une perte de paquets peuvent =C3=AAtre caus=C3=A9s par =
:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7742" data-end=3D"7949">
<li data-start=3D"7742" data-end=3D"7815" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7744" data-end=3D"7815" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
744" data-end=3D"7768">Saturation du r=C3=A9seau</strong> (trop de trafic s=
ur le r=C3=A9seau local ou large).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7816" data-end=3D"7883" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7818" data-end=3D"7883" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
818" data-end=3D"7845">Probl=C3=A8mes de congestion</strong> sur le routeur=
 ou l'interface r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7884" data-end=3D"7949" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7886" data-end=3D"7949" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
886" data-end=3D"7909">Probl=C3=A8mes mat=C3=A9riels</strong> (disque dur, =
carte r=C3=A9seau d=C3=A9fectueuse).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7951" data-end=3D"8001" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7955" data-end=3D"8001">5.3. V=C3=A9rification de la connexion Internet</st=
rong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8003" data-end=3D"8311" class=3D"">Si vous n'arrivez pas =
=C3=A0 pinger une adresse IP externe (par exemple, google.com), mais que vo=
us pouvez pinger une adresse IP locale, cela indique que votre <strong data=
-start=3D"8158" data-end=3D"8182">connexion =C3=A0 Internet</strong> pourra=
it =C3=AAtre coup=C3=A9e. Dans ce cas, v=C3=A9rifiez votre <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"8233" data-end=3D"8254">configuration DNS</strong> ou contactez votre=
 fournisseur d'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 Internet (FAI).</p>
