voir les param=C3=A8tres r=C3=A9seau attribu=C3=A9s =C3=A0 votre machine.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1368" data-end=3D"1553" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1370" data-end=3D"1553" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
370" data-end=3D"1412">D=C3=A9tecter des probl=C3=A8mes de connectivit=C3=
=A9</strong> : si vous avez des difficult=C3=A9s =C3=A0 acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0=
 Internet ou au r=C3=A9seau local, <strong data-start=3D"1485" data-end=3D"=
1497">ipconfig</strong> peut aider =C3=A0 identifier des probl=C3=A8mes de =
configuration.</p>
