<p data-start=3D"2569" data-end=3D"2643" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
569" data-end=3D"2585">Adresse IPv4</strong> : L'adresse IP de votre appare=
il dans votre r=C3=A9seau local.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2644" data-end=3D"2720" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2647" data-end=3D"2720" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
647" data-end=3D"2672">Masque de sous-r=C3=A9seau</strong> : Il d=C3=A9fini=
t les limites de votre r=C3=A9seau local.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2721" data-end=3D"2833" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2724" data-end=3D"2833" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
