n ou de configuration du routeur).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2775" data-end=3D"2962" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2778" data-end=3D"2815" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
778" data-end=3D"2813">V=C3=A9rification de la connectivit=C3=A9</strong> :=
