<li data-start=3D"3161" data-end=3D"3192" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3164" data-end=3D"3192" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"3177" data-end=3D"3191">D=C3=A9sactiver</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"3194" data-end=3D"3302" class=3D"">Cela d=C3=A9sactivera l=
a connexion, et vous ne pourrez plus acc=C3=A9der au r=C3=A9seau tant qu=E2=
=80=99elle ne sera pas r=C3=A9activ=C3=A9e.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3304" data-end=3D"3340" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3308" data-end=3D"3340">Activer une connexion r=C3=A9seau</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3342" data-end=3D"3469">
<li data-start=3D"3342" data-end=3D"3393" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3345" data-end=3D"3393" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
345" data-end=3D"3392">Ouvrir le Gestionnaire de connexions r=C3=A9seau</st=
rong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3394" data-end=3D"3440" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3397" data-end=3D"3440" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
397" data-end=3D"3411">Clic droit</strong> sur la connexion d=C3=A9sactiv=
=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3441" data-end=3D"3469" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3444" data-end=3D"3469" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"3457" data-end=3D"3468">Activer</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"3471" data-end=3D"3568" class=3D"">La connexion sera imm=
=C3=A9diatement r=C3=A9tablie et votre ordinateur tentera de se reconnecter=
 au r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3570" data-end=3D"3573" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3575" data-end=3D"3633" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3578" data-end=3D"3633">4. Configurer les propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s d=E2=80=99un=
e connexion r=C3=A9seau</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3635" data-end=3D"3824" class=3D"">Vous pouvez personnalis=
er chaque connexion r=C3=A9seau (Wi-Fi, Ethernet) en ajustant ses param=C3=
=A8tres. Cela inclut la configuration de l=E2=80=99adresse IP, le DNS, le p=
rotocole IPv4/IPv6, et plus encore.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3826" data-end=3D"3879" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3830" data-end=3D"3879">Acc=C3=A9der aux propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s d=E2=80=99une=
 connexion r=C3=A9seau</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3881" data-end=3D"4116">
<li data-start=3D"3881" data-end=3D"3932" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3884" data-end=3D"3932" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
884" data-end=3D"3931">Ouvrir le Gestionnaire de connexions r=C3=A9seau</st=
rong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3933" data-end=3D"4012" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3936" data-end=3D"4012" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
936" data-end=3D"3950">Clic droit</strong> sur la connexion dont vous souha=
itez modifier les param=C3=A8tres.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4013" data-end=3D"4116" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4016" data-end=3D"4116" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4029" data-end=3D"4043">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>. Cel=
a ouvrira une fen=C3=AAtre avec une liste des propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de la co=
nnexion.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4118" data-end=3D"4158" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4122" data-end=3D"4158">Param=C3=A9trer l'adresse IP manuelle</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4160" data-end=3D"4541">
<li data-start=3D"4160" data-end=3D"4345" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4163" data-end=3D"4345" class=3D"">Dans la fen=C3=AAtre de=
s propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de la connexion, s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-star=
t=3D"4224" data-end=3D"4267">Protocole Internet version 4 (TCP/IPv4)</stron=
g> ou <strong data-start=3D"4271" data-end=3D"4314">Protocole Internet vers=
ion 6 (TCP/IPv6)</strong> et cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"4330" data-e=
nd=3D"4344">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4346" data-end=3D"4397" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4349" data-end=3D"4397" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4362" data-end=3D"4396">Utiliser l'adresse IP suivante</st=
rong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4398" data-end=3D"4486" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4401" data-end=3D"4486" class=3D"">Entrez votre adresse IP=
, votre masque de sous-r=C3=A9seau, et votre passerelle par d=C3=A9faut.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4487" data-end=3D"4541" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4490" data-end=3D"4541" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4502" data-end=3D"4508">OK</strong> pour enregistrer les param=
=C3=A8tres.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4543" data-end=3D"4576" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4547" data-end=3D"4576">Configurer le serveur DNS</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4578" data-end=3D"4923">
<li data-start=3D"4578" data-end=3D"4704" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4581" data-end=3D"4704" class=3D"">Dans les propri=C3=A9t=
=C3=A9s du <strong data-start=3D"4604" data-end=3D"4647">Protocole Internet=
 version 4 (TCP/IPv4)</strong>, cochez l'option <strong data-start=3D"4665"=
 data-end=3D"4703">Utiliser les serveurs DNS suivants</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4705" data-end=3D"4869" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4708" data-end=3D"4756" class=3D"">Entrez l'adresse des se=
rveurs DNS, par exemple :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4760" data-end=3D"4869">
<li data-start=3D"4760" data-end=3D"4811" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4762" data-end=3D"4811" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
762" data-end=3D"4785">Serveur DNS pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9r=C3=A9</strong> : <code =
data-start=3D"4788" data-end=3D"4797">8.8.8.8</code> (Google DNS).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4815" data-end=3D"4869" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4817" data-end=3D"4869" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
817" data-end=3D"4843">Serveur DNS auxiliaire</strong> : <code data-start=
=3D"4846" data-end=3D"4855">8.8.4.4</code> (Google DNS).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4870" data-end=3D"4923" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4873" data-end=3D"4923" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4885" data-end=3D"4891">OK</strong> pour appliquer les changemen=
ts.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4925" data-end=3D"4928" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4930" data-end=3D"4974" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4933" data-end=3D"4974">5. Diagnostiquer une connexion r=C3=A9seau</strong>=
</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4976" data-end=3D"5108" class=3D"">Si une connexion ne fon=
ctionne pas correctement, Windows offre un outil int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9 pour dia=
gnostiquer et r=C3=A9soudre les probl=C3=A8mes r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5110" data-end=3D"5147" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5114" data-end=3D"5147">Utiliser l'outil de d=C3=A9pannage</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5149" data-end=3D"5292">
<li data-start=3D"5149" data-end=3D"5200" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5152" data-end=3D"5200" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
152" data-end=3D"5199">Ouvrir le Gestionnaire de connexions r=C3=A9seau</st=
rong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5201" data-end=3D"5257" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5204" data-end=3D"5257" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
204" data-end=3D"5218">Clic droit</strong> sur la connexion r=C3=A9seau pro=
bl=C3=A9matique.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5258" data-end=3D"5292" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5261" data-end=3D"5292" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"5274" data-end=3D"5291">Diagnostiquer</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"5294" data-end=3D"5477" class=3D"">Windows analysera la co=
nnexion et proposera des solutions possibles. Cela peut inclure la r=C3=A9s=
olution de probl=C3=A8mes d'adresse IP, de connectivit=C3=A9 au r=C3=A9seau=
, ou des conflits de mat=C3=A9riel.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5479" data-end=3D"5543" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5483" data-end=3D"5543">Utiliser l=E2=80=99Invite de commandes pour un diag=
nostic avanc=C3=A9</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5545" data-end=3D"5713" class=3D"">Si vous souhaitez effec=
tuer un diagnostic plus d=C3=A9taill=C3=A9, vous pouvez utiliser des outils=
 en ligne de commande comme <strong data-start=3D"5661" data-end=3D"5669">p=
ing</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"5671" data-end=3D"5682">tracert</strong=
>, <strong data-start=3D"5684" data-end=3D"5695">netstat</strong>, et <stro=
ng data-start=3D"5700" data-end=3D"5712">ipconfig</strong>.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5715" data-end=3D"6191">
<li data-start=3D"5715" data-end=3D"5840" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5717" data-end=3D"5809" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
717" data-end=3D"5725">Ping</strong> : Teste la connectivit=C3=A9 entre vot=
re ordinateur et un autre p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9rique ou serveur.</p>
