<h2 data-start=3D"916" data-end=3D"958" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"91=
9" data-end=3D"958">1. Introduction au VPN sous Windows</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"960" data-end=3D"1270" class=3D"">Un VPN sous Windows perm=
et =C3=A0 un utilisateur de se connecter de mani=C3=A8re s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9=
e =C3=A0 un r=C3=A9seau priv=C3=A9, comme un r=C3=A9seau d=E2=80=99entrepri=
se, ou d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 Internet en toute confidentialit=C3=A9=
. Windows offre une interface int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9e permettant de configurer e=
t de g=C3=A9rer des connexions VPN sans avoir besoin de logiciels tiers.</p=
>
<h3 data-start=3D"1272" data-end=3D"1319" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1276" data-end=3D"1319">Types de VPN pris en charge par Windows</strong></h=
3>
<p data-start=3D"1320" data-end=3D"1384" class=3D"">Windows prend en charge=
 plusieurs types de VPN, parmi lesquels :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1385" data-end=3D"2081">
<li data-start=3D"1385" data-end=3D"1503" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1387" data-end=3D"1503" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
387" data-end=3D"1431">PPTP (Point-to-Point Tunneling Protocol)</strong> : =
Un ancien protocole, souvent d=C3=A9sactiv=C3=A9 =C3=A0 cause de sa faible =
s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1504" data-end=3D"1630" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1506" data-end=3D"1630" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
506" data-end=3D"1549">L2TP/IPsec (Layer 2 Tunneling Protocol)</strong> : U=
ne solution plus s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e que PPTP, souvent utilis=C3=A9e avec u=
n cryptage IPsec.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1631" data-end=3D"1795" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1633" data-end=3D"1795" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
633" data-end=3D"1676">SSTP (Secure Socket Tunneling Protocol)</strong> : U=
tilise SSL pour cr=C3=A9er une connexion s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e et fonctionne =
bien dans des environnements avec des pare-feu stricts.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1796" data-end=3D"1949" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1798" data-end=3D"1949" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
798" data-end=3D"1847">IKEv2/IPsec (Internet Key Exchange version 2)</stron=
g> : Un des protocoles les plus s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9s, rapide et fiable, souv=
ent utilis=C3=A9 pour les appareils mobiles.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1950" data-end=3D"2081" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1952" data-end=3D"2081" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
952" data-end=3D"1963">OpenVPN</strong> : Bien qu=E2=80=99il ne soit pas in=
t=C3=A9gr=C3=A9 par d=C3=A9faut =C3=A0 Windows, il peut =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=
=A9 avec des logiciels tiers (comme OpenVPN).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2083" data-end=3D"2086" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2088" data-end=3D"2137" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2091" data-end=3D"2137">2. Acc=C3=A9der aux param=C3=A8tres VPN sous Window=
s</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2139" data-end=3D"2268" class=3D"">Il existe plusieurs m=
=C3=A9thodes pour acc=C3=A9der aux param=C3=A8tres de configuration des VPN=
 sous Windows. Voici deux m=C3=A9thodes principales :</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2270" data-end=3D"2308" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2274" data-end=3D"2308">M=C3=A9thode 1 : Via les Param=C3=A8tres</strong></=
h3>
<ol data-start=3D"2309" data-end=3D"2595">
<li data-start=3D"2309" data-end=3D"2340" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2312" data-end=3D"2340" class=3D"">Ouvrez le <strong data-=
start=3D"2322" data-end=3D"2339">menu D=C3=A9marrer</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2341" data-end=3D"2386" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2344" data-end=3D"2386" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"2355" data-end=3D"2369">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> (<code data-star=
t=3D"2371" data-end=3D"2384">Windows + I</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2387" data-end=3D"2425" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2390" data-end=3D"2425" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"2402" data-end=3D"2424">R=C3=A9seau et Internet</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2426" data-end=3D"2472" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2429" data-end=3D"2472" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"2442" data-end=3D"2449">VPN</strong> dans le menu =C3=A0 g=
auche.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2473" data-end=3D"2595" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2476" data-end=3D"2595" class=3D"">Vous y trouverez la lis=
te des connexions VPN existantes, ainsi que des options pour ajouter une no=
uvelle connexion VPN.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"2597" data-end=3D"2648" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2601" data-end=3D"2648">M=C3=A9thode 2 : Via le Panneau de configuration</s=
trong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"2649" data-end=3D"2904">
<li data-start=3D"2649" data-end=3D"2691" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2652" data-end=3D"2691" class=3D"">Ouvrez le <strong data-=
start=3D"2662" data-end=3D"2690">Panneau de configuration</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2692" data-end=3D"2728" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2695" data-end=3D"2728" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"2706" data-end=3D"2727">R=C3=A9seau et partage</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2729" data-end=3D"2804" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2732" data-end=3D"2804" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"2745" data-end=3D"2803">Configurer une nouvelle connexion =
ou un nouveau r=C3=A9seau</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2805" data-end=3D"2904" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2808" data-end=3D"2904" class=3D"">Choisissez <strong data=
-start=3D"2819" data-end=3D"2858">Se connecter =C3=A0 un espace de travail<=
/strong> et suivez l=E2=80=99assistant pour configurer un VPN.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"2906" data-end=3D"2909" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2911" data-end=3D"2962" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2914" data-end=3D"2962">3. Configurer une connexion VPN sous Windows</stron=
g></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2964" data-end=3D"3029" class=3D"">Voici les =C3=A9tapes p=
our configurer une connexion VPN sous Windows :</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3031" data-end=3D"3081" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3035" data-end=3D"3081">=C3=89tape 1 : Cr=C3=A9er une nouvelle connexion VP=
N</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3083" data-end=3D"3998">
<li data-start=3D"3083" data-end=3D"3147" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3086" data-end=3D"3147" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"3097" data-end=3D"3111">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> &gt; <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3114" data-end=3D"3136">R=C3=A9seau et Internet</strong> &gt; <s=
trong data-start=3D"3139" data-end=3D"3146">VPN</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3148" data-end=3D"3193" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3151" data-end=3D"3193" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3163" data-end=3D"3192">Ajouter une connexion VPN</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3194" data-end=3D"3927" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3197" data-end=3D"3256" class=3D"">Compl=C3=A9tez les info=
rmations n=C3=A9cessaires dans le formulaire :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3260" data-end=3D"3927">
<li data-start=3D"3260" data-end=3D"3338" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3262" data-end=3D"3338" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
262" data-end=3D"3281">Fournisseur VPN</strong> : S=C3=A9lectionnez <code d=
ata-start=3D"3297" data-end=3D"3316">Windows (int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9)</code> pou=
r un VPN standard.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3342" data-end=3D"3444" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3344" data-end=3D"3444" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
344" data-end=3D"3367">Nom de la connexion</strong> : Donnez un nom descrip=
tif =C3=A0 la connexion (par exemple, <code data-start=3D"3424" data-end=3D=
"3442">VPN d=E2=80=99entreprise</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3448" data-end=3D"3569" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3450" data-end=3D"3569" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
450" data-end=3D"3465">Serveur VPN</strong> : Entrez l=E2=80=99adresse du s=
erveur VPN auquel vous souhaitez vous connecter (ex. : <code data-start=3D"=
3544" data-end=3D"3567">vpn.monentreprise.com</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3573" data-end=3D"3669" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3575" data-end=3D"3669" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
575" data-end=3D"3590">Type de VPN</strong> : S=C3=A9lectionnez le protocol=
e VPN utilis=C3=A9 (PPTP, L2TP/IPsec, SSTP, IKEv2, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3673" data-end=3D"3804" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3675" data-end=3D"3804" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
675" data-end=3D"3711">Type d=E2=80=99informations de connexion</strong> : =
Choisissez entre <strong data-start=3D"3731" data-end=3D"3768">Nom d=E2=80=
=99utilisateur et mot de passe</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"3770" data-e=
nd=3D"3784">Certificat</strong>, ou <strong data-start=3D"3789" data-end=3D=
"3803">Cl=C3=A9 priv=C3=A9e</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3808" data-end=3D"3927" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3810" data-end=3D"3927" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
810" data-end=3D"3847">Nom d=E2=80=99utilisateur et mot de passe</strong> :=
 Entrez les informations n=C3=A9cessaires fournies par votre administrateur=
 r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3929" data-end=3D"3998" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3932" data-end=3D"3998" class=3D"">Une fois ces informatio=
ns compl=C3=A9t=C3=A9es, cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"3982" data-end=
=3D"3997">Enregistrer</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4000" data-end=3D"4037" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4004" data-end=3D"4037">=C3=89tape 2 : Se connecter au VPN</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4039" data-end=3D"4410">
<li data-start=3D"4039" data-end=3D"4107" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4042" data-end=3D"4107" class=3D"">Retournez dans <strong =
data-start=3D"4057" data-end=3D"4071">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> &gt; <strong=
 data-start=3D"4074" data-end=3D"4096">R=C3=A9seau et Internet</strong> &gt=
; <strong data-start=3D"4099" data-end=3D"4106">VPN</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4108" data-end=3D"4175" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4111" data-end=3D"4175" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez la co=
nnexion VPN que vous avez cr=C3=A9=C3=A9e dans la liste.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4176" data-end=3D"4208" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4179" data-end=3D"4208" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4191" data-end=3D"4207">Se connecter</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4209" data-end=3D"4309" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4212" data-end=3D"4309" class=3D"">Entrez vos informations=
 d=E2=80=99identification si cela est demand=C3=A9 (nom d=E2=80=99utilisate=
ur et mot de passe).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4310" data-end=3D"4410" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4313" data-end=3D"4410" class=3D"">Vous =C3=AAtes maintena=
nt connect=C3=A9 au VPN et vous pouvez acc=C3=A9der aux ressources de votre=
 r=C3=A9seau priv=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4412" data-end=3D"4415" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4417" data-end=3D"4464" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4420" data-end=3D"4464">4. G=C3=A9rer les connexions VPN sous Windows</stro=
ng></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4466" data-end=3D"4564" class=3D"">Une fois la connexion V=
PN =C3=A9tablie, vous pouvez g=C3=A9rer les diff=C3=A9rentes options associ=
=C3=A9es =C3=A0 celle-ci.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4566" data-end=3D"4614" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4570" data-end=3D"4614">Modifier les param=C3=A8tres de connexion VPN</stro=
ng></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4615" data-end=3D"4667" class=3D"">Pour ajuster les param=
=C3=A8tres de votre connexion VPN :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4668" data-end=3D"4942">
<li data-start=3D"4668" data-end=3D"4732" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4671" data-end=3D"4732" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"4682" data-end=3D"4696">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> &gt; <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4699" data-end=3D"4721">R=C3=A9seau et Internet</strong> &gt; <s=
trong data-start=3D"4724" data-end=3D"4731">VPN</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4733" data-end=3D"4777" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4736" data-end=3D"4777" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez la co=
nnexion VPN =C3=A0 modifier.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4778" data-end=3D"4806" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4781" data-end=3D"4806" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4793" data-end=3D"4805">Modifier</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4807" data-end=3D"4942" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4810" data-end=3D"4942" class=3D"">Vous pourrez alors modi=
fier les informations du serveur, le type de VPN, les informations de conne=
xion, et bien d=E2=80=99autres param=C3=A8tres.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4944" data-end=3D"4979" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4948" data-end=3D"4979">Supprimer une connexion VPN</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4980" data-end=3D"5065" class=3D"">Si vous n'avez plus bes=
oin d'une connexion VPN, vous pouvez la supprimer facilement :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5066" data-end=3D"5223">
<li data-start=3D"5066" data-end=3D"5130" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5069" data-end=3D"5130" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"5080" data-end=3D"5094">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> &gt; <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5097" data-end=3D"5119">R=C3=A9seau et Internet</strong> &gt; <s=
trong data-start=3D"5122" data-end=3D"5129">VPN</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5131" data-end=3D"5193" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5134" data-end=3D"5193" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez la co=
nnexion VPN que vous souhaitez supprimer.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5194" data-end=3D"5223" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5197" data-end=3D"5223" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5209" data-end=3D"5222">Supprimer</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5225" data-end=3D"5228" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5230" data-end=3D"5288" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5233" data-end=3D"5288">5. Utilisation de l=E2=80=99outil de d=C3=A9pannage=
 pour les VPN</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"5290" data-end=3D"5523" class=3D"">Windows offre un outil =
de d=C3=A9pannage pour r=C3=A9soudre les probl=C3=A8mes courants des connex=
ions VPN. Si vous avez des probl=C3=A8mes pour vous connecter =C3=A0 un VPN=
 ou si la connexion est lente ou instable, vous pouvez utiliser l'outil de =
d=C3=A9pannage.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5525" data-end=3D"5559" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5529" data-end=3D"5559">D=C3=A9panner une connexion VPN</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5560" data-end=3D"5852">
<li data-start=3D"5560" data-end=3D"5624" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5563" data-end=3D"5624" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"5574" data-end=3D"5588">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> &gt; <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5591" data-end=3D"5613">R=C3=A9seau et Internet</strong> &gt; <s=
trong data-start=3D"5616" data-end=3D"5623">VPN</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5625" data-end=3D"5672" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5628" data-end=3D"5672" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez la co=
nnexion VPN probl=C3=A9matique.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5673" data-end=3D"5706" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5676" data-end=3D"5706" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5688" data-end=3D"5705">Diagnostiquer</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5707" data-end=3D"5852" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5710" data-end=3D"5852" class=3D"">Windows analysera la co=
nnexion et essaiera de r=C3=A9soudre les probl=C3=A8mes (par exemple, v=C3=
=A9rifier les param=C3=A8tres de connexion, le certificat, etc.).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5854" data-end=3D"5857" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5859" data-end=3D"5912" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5862" data-end=3D"5912">6. Configurer des options avanc=C3=A9es pour le VPN=
</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5914" data-end=3D"5974" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5918" data-end=3D"5974">Configurer le routage et le partage de connexion VP=
N</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5976" data-end=3D"6127" class=3D"">Dans certains cas, vous=
 pouvez vouloir configurer le routage ou partager une connexion VPN avec d'=
autres p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9riques via une connexion r=C3=A9seau locale.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6129" data-end=3D"6504">
<li data-start=3D"6129" data-end=3D"6180" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6132" data-end=3D"6180" class=3D"">Ouvrez le <strong data-=
start=3D"6142" data-end=3D"6179">Gestionnaire de connexions r=C3=A9seau</st=
rong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6181" data-end=3D"6257" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6184" data-end=3D"6257" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r la connexion VPN et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"6242" data-en=
d=3D"6256">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6258" data-end=3D"6293" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6261" data-end=3D"6293" class=3D"">Allez dans l'onglet <st=
rong data-start=3D"6281" data-end=3D"6292">Partage</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6294" data-end=3D"6411" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6297" data-end=3D"6411" class=3D"">Cochez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"6304" data-end=3D"6410">Autoriser les autres utilisateurs du r=C3=A9s=
eau =C3=A0 se connecter via la connexion Internet de cet ordinateur</strong=
>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6412" data-end=3D"6504" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6415" data-end=3D"6504" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez le p=
=C3=A9riph=C3=A9rique =C3=A0 partager (par exemple, Ethernet ou un autre r=
=C3=A9seau local).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"6506" data-end=3D"6570" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6510" data-end=3D"6570">Configurer des scripts pour automatiser la connexio=
n VPN</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6572" data-end=3D"6806" class=3D"">Les administrateurs r=
=C3=A9seau avanc=C3=A9s peuvent cr=C3=A9er des scripts pour automatiser la =
connexion au VPN =C3=A0 chaque d=C3=A9marrage ou lors de certaines actions.=
 Cela peut =C3=AAtre utile pour les employ=C3=A9s qui doivent se connecter =
=C3=A0 un VPN r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8rement.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6808" data-end=3D"7055">
<li data-start=3D"6808" data-end=3D"6938" class=3D"">
