<li data-start=3D"1775" data-end=3D"1833" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1777" data-end=3D"1833" class=3D"">Sp=C3=A9cifier les <str=
ong data-start=3D"1791" data-end=3D"1805">protocoles</strong> et les <stron=
g data-start=3D"1813" data-end=3D"1822">ports</strong> autoris=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1834" data-end=3D"1901" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1836" data-end=3D"1901" class=3D"">Permettre ou interdire =
des connexions <strong data-start=3D"1874" data-end=3D"1900">entrantes ou s=
