<li data-start=3D"3844" data-end=3D"3910" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3847" data-end=3D"3910" class=3D"">Appuyez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3859" data-end=3D"3874">Windows + R</strong> pour ouvrir la fen=
=C3=AAtre d'ex=C3=A9cution.</p>
