<p data-start=3D"3914" data-end=3D"3963" class=3D"">Tapez <strong data-star=
t=3D"3920" data-end=3D"3936">eventvwr.msc</strong> et appuyez sur <strong d=
ata-start=3D"3952" data-end=3D"3962">Entr=C3=A9e</strong>.</p>
