</li>
<li data-start=3D"6167" data-end=3D"6276" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6170" data-end=3D"6276" class=3D"">Trouvez la valeur <stro=
ng data-start=3D"6188" data-end=3D"6205">SecurityLayer</strong> et modifiez=
-la en <strong data-start=3D"6224" data-end=3D"6229">1</strong> pour active=
r un chiffrement de niveau <strong data-start=3D"6268" data-end=3D"6275">RD=
P</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6277" data-end=3D"6341" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6280" data-end=3D"6341" class=3D"">Red=C3=A9marrez votre o=
rdinateur pour appliquer les modifications.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"6343" data-end=3D"6396" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6347" data-end=3D"6396">Limitation de l'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 certains utilisat=
eurs</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6398" data-end=3D"6646" class=3D"">Pour restreindre l'acc=
=C3=A8s =C3=A0 <strong data-start=3D"6425" data-end=3D"6443">Remote Desktop=
</strong>, vous pouvez sp=C3=A9cifier les utilisateurs autoris=C3=A9s =C3=
=A0 se connecter. Par d=C3=A9faut, tous les administrateurs peuvent se conn=
ecter, mais il peut =C3=AAtre n=C3=A9cessaire de limiter l'acc=C3=A8s aux u=
tilisateurs sp=C3=A9cifiques.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6648" data-end=3D"6927">
<li data-start=3D"6648" data-end=3D"6759" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6651" data-end=3D"6759" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"6662" data-end=3D"6690">Panneau de configuration</strong> &gt; <s=
trong data-start=3D"6693" data-end=3D"6716">Syst=C3=A8me et s=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"6719" data-end=3D"6730">Syst=C3=A8m=
e</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"6733" data-end=3D"6758">Param=C3=A8tr=
es =C3=A0 distance</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6760" data-end=3D"6809" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6763" data-end=3D"6809" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"6775" data-end=3D"6808">S=C3=A9lectionner les utilisateurs</stro=
ng>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6810" data-end=3D"6927" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6813" data-end=3D"6927" class=3D"">Ajoutez les utilisateur=
s ou groupes d=E2=80=99utilisateurs autoris=C3=A9s =C3=A0 se connecter =C3=
=A0 votre ordinateur via Remote Desktop.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"6929" data-end=3D"7012" class=3D"">Cela vous permettra de =
mieux contr=C3=B4ler qui peut acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 votre syst=C3=A8me =C3=A0=
 distance.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"7014" data-end=3D"7017" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7019" data-end=3D"7083" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7022" data-end=3D"7083">5. Utilisation d'un VPN pour s=C3=A9curiser l'acc=
=C3=A8s =C3=A0 distance</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"7085" data-end=3D"7364" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"7088" data-end=3D"7121">VPN (Virtual Private Network)</strong> offre un=
e couche de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 suppl=C3=A9mentaire en <strong data-start=3D=
"7169" data-end=3D"7199">chiffrant le trafic r=C3=A9seau</strong> entre l'u=
tilisateur distant et le r=C3=A9seau local. Utiliser un VPN pour se connect=
er =C3=A0 un r=C3=A9seau avant d'utiliser Remote Desktop renforce consid=C3=
=A9rablement la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"7366" data-end=3D"7404" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7370" data-end=3D"7404">Configurer un VPN sous Windows</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"7406" data-end=3D"7751">
<li data-start=3D"7406" data-end=3D"7470" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7409" data-end=3D"7470" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"7420" data-end=3D"7434">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> &gt; <strong dat=
a-start=3D"7437" data-end=3D"7459">R=C3=A9seau et Internet</strong> &gt; <s=
trong data-start=3D"7462" data-end=3D"7469">VPN</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7471" data-end=3D"7516" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7474" data-end=3D"7516" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"7486" data-end=3D"7515">Ajouter une connexion VPN</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7517" data-end=3D"7667" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7520" data-end=3D"7667" class=3D"">Choisissez un <strong d=
ata-start=3D"7534" data-end=3D"7556">fournisseur de VPN</strong> et saisiss=
ez les informations n=C3=A9cessaires (nom de connexion, adresse du serveur =
VPN, type de protocole, etc.).</p>
</li>
