<li data-start=3D"7129" data-end=3D"7208" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7132" data-end=3D"7208" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"7143" data-end=3D"7170">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong> &gt; <st=
rong data-start=3D"7173" data-end=3D"7183">Outils</strong> &gt; <strong dat=
a-start=3D"7186" data-end=3D"7207">Connexions r=C3=A9seau</strong>.</p>
