<p data-start=3D"7212" data-end=3D"7292" class=3D"">Cliquez droit sur la co=
nnexion r=C3=A9seau =C3=A0 configurer et choisissez <strong data-start=3D"7=
277" data-end=3D"7291">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
