<li data-start=3D"7787" data-end=3D"7924" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7790" data-end=3D"7924" class=3D"">Suivez l'assistant pour=
 s=C3=A9lectionner et installer les r=C3=B4les comme <strong data-start=3D"=
7856" data-end=3D"7876">Active Directory</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"78=
78" data-end=3D"7885">DNS</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"7887" data-end=3D=
"7895">DHCP</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"7897" data-end=3D"7918">Serveur=
 Web (IIS)</strong>, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7925" data-end=3D"8033" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7928" data-end=3D"8033" class=3D"">Apr=C3=A8s l'installati=
on, chaque r=C3=B4le aura ses propres outils de gestion dans le <strong dat=
a-start=3D"8005" data-end=3D"8032">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"8035" data-end=3D"8038" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8040" data-end=3D"8080" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8043" data-end=3D"8080">4. S=C3=A9curisation de Windows Server</strong></h2=
>
<h3 data-start=3D"8082" data-end=3D"8132" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8086" data-end=3D"8132">a. Mise en place de strat=C3=A9gies de s=C3=A9curit=
=C3=A9</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8134" data-end=3D"8247" class=3D"">Pour s=C3=A9curiser le =
