<li data-start=3D"6291" data-end=3D"6384" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6294" data-end=3D"6384" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"6307" data-end=3D"6350">Protocole Internet version 4 (TCP/=
IPv4)</strong>, puis cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"6369" data-end=3D"63=
83">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6385" data-end=3D"6691" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6388" data-end=3D"6475" class=3D"">Choisissez <strong data=
-start=3D"6399" data-end=3D"6433">Utiliser l'adresse IP suivante</strong>, =
puis entrez les informations suivantes :</p>
