<li data-start=3D"6479" data-end=3D"6531" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6481" data-end=3D"6531" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
481" data-end=3D"6495">Adresse IP</strong> : L'adresse IP statique du serve=
ur.</p>
