=B4leur de domaine)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7500" data-end=3D"7635" class=3D"">Si vous souhaitez confi=
gurer ce serveur comme contr=C3=B4leur de domaine, vous devez installer <st=
rong data-start=3D"7590" data-end=3D"7634">Active Directory Domain Services=
 (AD DS)</strong>.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"7637" data-end=3D"8225">
<li data-start=3D"7637" data-end=3D"7678" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7640" data-end=3D"7678" class=3D"">Ouvrez le <strong data-=
start=3D"7650" data-end=3D"7677">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7679" data-end=3D"7751" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7682" data-end=3D"7751" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"7694" data-end=3D"7703">G=C3=A9rer</strong> &gt; <strong data-st=
art=3D"7706" data-end=3D"7750">Ajouter des r=C3=B4les et des fonctionnalit=
=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7752" data-end=3D"7823" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7755" data-end=3D"7823" class=3D"">Dans l'assistant, s=C3=
=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"7786" data-end=3D"7822">Active Director=
y Domain Services</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7824" data-end=3D"8225" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7827" data-end=3D"7909" class=3D"">Apr=C3=A8s l'installati=
on, vous devrez promouvoir le serveur en contr=C3=B4leur de domaine :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7913" data-end=3D"8225">
<li data-start=3D"7913" data-end=3D"8025" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7915" data-end=3D"8025" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"7926" data-end=3D"7936">Outils</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=
=3D"7939" data-end=3D"7975">Active Directory Domain Services</strong> et su=
