<p data-start=3D"8268" data-end=3D"8373" class=3D"">Dans le <strong data-st=
art=3D"8276" data-end=3D"8303">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong>, allez dans=
 <strong data-start=3D"8316" data-end=3D"8325">G=C3=A9rer</strong> &gt; <st=
rong data-start=3D"8328" data-end=3D"8372">Ajouter des r=C3=B4les et des fo=
nctionnalit=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8374" data-end=3D"8445" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8377" data-end=3D"8445" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez le r=
=C3=B4le <strong data-start=3D"8398" data-end=3D"8406">DHCP</strong> et sui=
vez les =C3=A9tapes pour l'installer.</p>
