<ol data-start=3D"8669" data-end=3D"8897">
<li data-start=3D"8669" data-end=3D"8802" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8672" data-end=3D"8802" class=3D"">Par d=C3=A9faut, <stron=
g data-start=3D"8684" data-end=3D"8704">Windows Firewall</strong> est activ=
=C3=A9. Vous pouvez le configurer via le <strong data-start=3D"8750" data-e=
nd=3D"8778">Panneau de configuration</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"87=
81" data-end=3D"8801">Pare-feu Windows</strong>.</p>
