<li data-start=3D"8803" data-end=3D"8897" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8806" data-end=3D"8897" class=3D"">D=C3=A9finissez les r=
=C3=A8gles pour autoriser ou bloquer les connexions entrantes selon les bes=
oins.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"8899" data-end=3D"8950" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8903" data-end=3D"8950">b. Mise en place des strat=C3=A9gies de s=C3=A9curi=
t=C3=A9</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8952" data-end=3D"9036" class=3D"">Il est important de con=
figurer les strat=C3=A9gies de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 pour prot=C3=A9ger le ser=
veur :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"9037" data-end=3D"9209">
<li data-start=3D"9037" data-end=3D"9137" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9039" data-end=3D"9137" class=3D"">Utilisez <strong data-s=
tart=3D"9048" data-end=3D"9064">Group Policy</strong> pour appliquer des po=
litiques de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 comme des mots de passe forts.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9138" data-end=3D"9209" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9140" data-end=3D"9209" class=3D"">Activez <strong data-st=
art=3D"9148" data-end=3D"9161">BitLocker</strong> pour chiffrer les disques=
 de donn=C3=A9es sensibles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"9211" data-end=3D"9214" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9216" data-end=3D"9233" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
