<li data-start=3D"2341" data-end=3D"2393" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2344" data-end=3D"2393" class=3D"">Cr=C3=A9ez un support d=
=E2=80=99installation (cl=C3=A9 USB ou DVD).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2394" data-end=3D"2498" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2397" data-end=3D"2498" class=3D"">D=C3=A9marrez =C3=A0 pa=
rtir du support d'installation et suivez les instructions pour installer Wi=
ndows Server.</p>
