<ol data-start=3D"3184" data-end=3D"3501">
<li data-start=3D"3184" data-end=3D"3297" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3187" data-end=3D"3297" class=3D"">Toujours dans le <stron=
g data-start=3D"3204" data-end=3D"3231">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong>, a=
llez dans <strong data-start=3D"3244" data-end=3D"3253">G=C3=A9rer</strong>=
 &gt; <strong data-start=3D"3256" data-end=3D"3296">Ajouter des r=C3=B4les =
et fonctionnalit=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3298" data-end=3D"3414" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3301" data-end=3D"3331" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
301" data-end=3D"3329">S=C3=A9lectionner le r=C3=B4le DNS</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3335" data-end=3D"3414">
<li data-start=3D"3335" data-end=3D"3414" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3337" data-end=3D"3414" class=3D"">Dans l=E2=80=99assistan=
t, s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"3368" data-end=3D"3383">Serveur =
DNS</strong>, puis cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"3402" data-end=3D"3413=
">Suivant</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3415" data-end=3D"3501" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3418" data-end=3D"3501" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
418" data-end=3D"3443">Installer le r=C3=B4le DNS</strong> : Suivez les =C3=
=A9tapes restantes pour installer le r=C3=B4le DNS.</p>
