<li data-start=3D"3577" data-end=3D"3697" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3580" data-end=3D"3697" class=3D"">Ouvrez =C3=A0 nouveau l=
e <strong data-start=3D"3600" data-end=3D"3627">Gestionnaire de serveur</st=
rong> et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"3644" data-end=3D"3653">G=
=C3=A9rer</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"3656" data-end=3D"3696">Ajout=
er des r=C3=B4les et fonctionnalit=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3698" data-end=3D"3965" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3701" data-end=3D"3752" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
