strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3756" data-end=3D"3965">
<li data-start=3D"3756" data-end=3D"3847" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3758" data-end=3D"3847" class=3D"">Dans l=E2=80=99assistan=
t, cochez <strong data-start=3D"3783" data-end=3D"3819">Active Directory Do=
main Services</strong> et cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"3835" data-end=
=3D"3846">Suivant</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3851" data-end=3D"3965" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3853" data-end=3D"3965" class=3D"">Lorsque vous =C3=AAtes =
invit=C3=A9 =C3=A0 ajouter les fonctionnalit=C3=A9s n=C3=A9cessaires, cliqu=
ez sur <strong data-start=3D"3933" data-end=3D"3964">Ajouter des fonctionna=
lit=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3966" data-end=3D"4070" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3969" data-end=3D"4070" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
969" data-end=3D"3996">Installer le r=C3=B4le AD DS</strong> : Cliquez sur =
<strong data-start=3D"4011" data-end=3D"4024">Installer</strong> et attende=
z que l=E2=80=99installation soit termin=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4072" data-end=3D"4075" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4077" data-end=3D"4118" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4080" data-end=3D"4118">4. Configuration des r=C3=B4les serveur</strong></h=
2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4120" data-end=3D"4160" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4124" data-end=3D"4160">a. Configuration du serveur DHCP</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4162" data-end=3D"4329" class=3D"">Apr=C3=A8s avoir instal=
l=C3=A9 le r=C3=B4le DHCP, il est essentiel de configurer une plage d'adres=
ses IP pour le serveur DHCP afin qu'il puisse attribuer des adresses IP aux=
 clients.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4331" data-end=3D"5206">
<li data-start=3D"4331" data-end=3D"4477" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4334" data-end=3D"4359" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
334" data-end=3D"4357">Lancer le r=C3=B4le DHCP</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4363" data-end=3D"4477">
<li data-start=3D"4363" data-end=3D"4477" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4365" data-end=3D"4477" class=3D"">Dans le <strong data-st=
art=3D"4373" data-end=3D"4400">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong>, cliquez su=
r la notification <strong data-start=3D"4430" data-end=3D"4476">Compl=C3=A9=
ter la configuration du serveur DHCP</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4478" data-end=3D"4833" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4481" data-end=3D"4517" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
481" data-end=3D"4515">Configurer la plage d'adresses</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4521" data-end=3D"4833">
<li data-start=3D"4521" data-end=3D"4608" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4523" data-end=3D"4608" class=3D"">Ouvrez le <strong data-=
start=3D"4533" data-end=3D"4554">Gestionnaire DHCP</strong> (dans le menu <=
strong data-start=3D"4569" data-end=3D"4579">Outils</strong> du Gestionnair=
e de serveur).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4612" data-end=3D"4707" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4614" data-end=3D"4707" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r <strong data-start=3D"4639" data-end=3D"4660">Plages d'adresses</strong> =
et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"4677" data-end=3D"4706">Nouvelle=
 plage d=E2=80=99adresses</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4711" data-end=3D"4833" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4713" data-end=3D"4833" class=3D"">Suivez l=E2=80=99assist=
ant pour d=C3=A9finir une plage d'adresses IP =C3=A0 attribuer (par exemple=
, de <code data-start=3D"4798" data-end=3D"4813">192.168.1.100</code> =C3=
=A0 <code data-start=3D"4816" data-end=3D"4831">192.168.1.200</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4834" data-end=3D"5063" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4837" data-end=3D"4876" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
837" data-end=3D"4874">Configurer les baux d=E2=80=99adresses IP</strong> :=
</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4880" data-end=3D"5063">
<li data-start=3D"4880" data-end=3D"5063" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4882" data-end=3D"5063" class=3D"">Vous pouvez ajuster la =
dur=C3=A9e des baux (temps durant lequel une adresse IP est attribu=C3=A9e =
=C3=A0 un client) et les options suppl=C3=A9mentaires comme le serveur DNS =
=C3=A0 utiliser pour les clients.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5064" data-end=3D"5206" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5067" data-end=3D"5096" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
067" data-end=3D"5094">Activer le serveur DHCP</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5100" data-end=3D"5206">
<li data-start=3D"5100" data-end=3D"5206" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5102" data-end=3D"5206" class=3D"">Une fois la configurati=
on termin=C3=A9e, faites un clic droit sur <strong data-start=3D"5163" data=
-end=3D"5179">Serveur DHCP</strong> et choisissez <strong data-start=3D"519=
4" data-end=3D"5205">Activer</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5208" data-end=3D"5247" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5212" data-end=3D"5247">b. Configuration du serveur DNS</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5249" data-end=3D"5376" class=3D"">Le serveur DNS que vous=
 avez install=C3=A9 peut maintenant =C3=AAtre configur=C3=A9 pour r=C3=A9so=
udre les noms de domaine au sein de votre r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5378" data-end=3D"6076">
<li data-start=3D"5378" data-end=3D"5520" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5381" data-end=3D"5405" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
381" data-end=3D"5403">Lancer le r=C3=B4le DNS</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5409" data-end=3D"5520">
<li data-start=3D"5409" data-end=3D"5520" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5411" data-end=3D"5520" class=3D"">Dans le <strong data-st=
art=3D"5419" data-end=3D"5446">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong>, cliquez su=
r <strong data-start=3D"5460" data-end=3D"5470">Outils</strong> &gt; <stron=
g data-start=3D"5473" data-end=3D"5480">DNS</strong> pour ouvrir l'interfac=
e de gestion DNS.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5521" data-end=3D"5787" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5524" data-end=3D"5554" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
524" data-end=3D"5552">Configurer les zones DNS</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5558" data-end=3D"5787">
<li data-start=3D"5558" data-end=3D"5657" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5560" data-end=3D"5657" class=3D"">Cr=C3=A9ez une nouvelle=
 zone DNS pour le domaine de votre r=C3=A9seau (par exemple, <code data-sta=
rt=3D"5634" data-end=3D"5655">monentreprise.local</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5661" data-end=3D"5787" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5663" data-end=3D"5787" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"5674" data-end=3D"5703">Zone de recherche directe</strong> &gt; <=
strong data-start=3D"5706" data-end=3D"5723">Nouvelle zone</strong> et suiv=
ez l=E2=80=99assistant pour cr=C3=A9er une zone de recherche directe.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5788" data-end=3D"6076" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5791" data-end=3D"5828" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
791" data-end=3D"5826">Ajouter des enregistrements DNS</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5832" data-end=3D"6076">
<li data-start=3D"5832" data-end=3D"5937" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5834" data-end=3D"5937" class=3D"">Ajoutez des enregistrem=
ents A (pour les h=C3=B4tes) et MX (pour les serveurs de messagerie) dans v=
otre zone.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5941" data-end=3D"6076" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5943" data-end=3D"6076" class=3D"">Vous pouvez =C3=A9galem=
ent ajouter des enregistrements de service (SRV) pour Active Directory si v=
ous configurez un contr=C3=B4leur de domaine.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"6078" data-end=3D"6170" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6082" data-end=3D"6170">c. Configuration d'Active Directory et promotion du=
 serveur en contr=C3=B4leur de domaine</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6172" data-end=3D"6341" class=3D"">Active Directory permet=
 de centraliser la gestion des utilisateurs, groupes et ordinateurs dans un=
 domaine. Vous allez promouvoir votre serveur en contr=C3=B4leur de domaine=
.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6343" data-end=3D"7349">
<li data-start=3D"6343" data-end=3D"6735" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6346" data-end=3D"6407" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
346" data-end=3D"6405">Lancer la promotion du serveur en contr=C3=B4leur de=
 domaine</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6411" data-end=3D"6735">
<li data-start=3D"6411" data-end=3D"6547" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6413" data-end=3D"6547" class=3D"">Dans le <strong data-st=
art=3D"6421" data-end=3D"6448">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong>, cliquez su=
r <strong data-start=3D"6462" data-end=3D"6479">Notifications</strong> et s=
=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"6496" data-end=3D"6546">Promouvoir c=
e serveur en contr=C3=B4leur de domaine</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6551" data-end=3D"6735" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6553" data-end=3D"6735" class=3D"">Choisissez <strong data=
-start=3D"6564" data-end=3D"6585">Ajouter une for=C3=AAt</strong> ou <stron=
g data-start=3D"6589" data-end=3D"6633">Ajouter un domaine =C3=A0 une for=
=C3=AAt existante</strong> selon que vous configurez un nouveau domaine ou =
que vous ajoutez un contr=C3=B4leur =C3=A0 un domaine existant.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6736" data-end=3D"7039" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6739" data-end=3D"6779" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
739" data-end=3D"6777">Nom du domaine et options de for=C3=AAt</strong> :</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"6783" data-end=3D"7039">
<li data-start=3D"6783" data-end=3D"6847" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6785" data-end=3D"6847" class=3D"">Entrez un nom pour votr=
e domaine (ex : <code data-start=3D"6824" data-end=3D"6845">monentreprise.l=
ocal</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6851" data-end=3D"7039" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6853" data-end=3D"7039" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"6866" data-end=3D"6900">Niveau fonctionnel de la for=C3=AA=
t</strong> (par exemple, Windows Server 2016 ou Windows Server 2019) et con=
figurez les options de r=C3=A9plication et de mot de passe de l=E2=80=99adm=
inistrateur.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7040" data-end=3D"7209" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7043" data-end=3D"7087" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
043" data-end=3D"7085">Configurer les options suppl=C3=A9mentaires</strong>=
 :</p>
