<ol data-start=3D"3801" data-end=3D"4193">
<li data-start=3D"3801" data-end=3D"3928" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3834" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
804" data-end=3D"3832">Rechercher l'utilisateur</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3838" data-end=3D"3928">
<li data-start=3D"3838" data-end=3D"3924" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3840" data-end=3D"3924" class=3D"">Dans l'outil <strong da=
ta-start=3D"3853" data-end=3D"3861">ADUC</strong>, recherchez l'utilisateur=
 en question dans l'OU ou le domaine.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3929" data-end=3D"4193" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3932" data-end=3D"3963" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
932" data-end=3D"3961">Modifier les informations</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3967" data-end=3D"4193">
<li data-start=3D"3967" data-end=3D"4193" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3969" data-end=3D"4193" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r l'utilisateur et choisissez <strong data-start=3D"4022" data-end=3D"4036"=
>Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>. Vous pouvez maintenant modifier divers attr=
ibuts, tels que l'adresse e-mail, le groupe auquel l'utilisateur appartient=
, et les options li=C3=A9es =C3=A0 la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4195" data-end=3D"4244" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4199" data-end=3D"4244">d. D=C3=A9sactiver ou supprimer un utilisateur</str=
ong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4246" data-end=3D"4568">
<li data-start=3D"4246" data-end=3D"4422" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4249" data-end=3D"4280" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
249" data-end=3D"4278">D=C3=A9sactiver un utilisateur</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4284" data-end=3D"4422">
<li data-start=3D"4284" data-end=3D"4422" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4286" data-end=3D"4422" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r l'utilisateur et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"4341" data-end=
=3D"4365">D=C3=A9sactiver le compte</strong>. Cela emp=C3=AAchera l'utilisa=
teur de se connecter au r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4424" data-end=3D"4568" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4427" data-end=3D"4457" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
427" data-end=3D"4455">Supprimer un utilisateur</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4461" data-end=3D"4568">
<li data-start=3D"4461" data-end=3D"4568" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4463" data-end=3D"4568" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r l'utilisateur et choisissez <strong data-start=3D"4516" data-end=3D"4529"=
>Supprimer</strong>. Vous devrez confirmer la suppression.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4570" data-end=3D"4573" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4575" data-end=3D"4626" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4578" data-end=3D"4626">4. Gestion des groupes dans Active Directory</stron=
g></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4628" data-end=3D"4677" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4632" data-end=3D"4677">a. Types de groupes dans Active Directory</strong><=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"4679" data-end=3D"4732" class=3D"">Dans AD, il existe deux=
 types principaux de groupes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4734" data-end=3D"4934">
<li data-start=3D"4734" data-end=3D"4835" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4736" data-end=3D"4835" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
736" data-end=3D"4759">Groupes de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong> : Utilis=C3=
=A9s pour attribuer des permissions d'acc=C3=A8s aux ressources du r=C3=A9s=
eau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4836" data-end=3D"4934" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4838" data-end=3D"4934" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
838" data-end=3D"4865">Groupes de distribution</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9s pou=
r la distribution de messages (groupes de messagerie).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4936" data-end=3D"5004" class=3D"">De plus, les groupes pe=
uvent =C3=AAtre organis=C3=A9s de la mani=C3=A8re suivante :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5005" data-end=3D"5221">
<li data-start=3D"5005" data-end=3D"5092" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5007" data-end=3D"5092" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
007" data-end=3D"5025">Groupes locaux</strong> : Assign=C3=A9s =C3=A0 des r=
essources locales (comme un serveur sp=C3=A9cifique).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5093" data-end=3D"5147" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5095" data-end=3D"5147" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
095" data-end=3D"5114">Groupes globaux</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9s dans tout l=
e domaine.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5148" data-end=3D"5221" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5150" data-end=3D"5221" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
150" data-end=3D"5172">Groupes universels</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9s dans tou=
te la for=C3=AAt Active Directory.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5223" data-end=3D"5276" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5227" data-end=3D"5276">b. Cr=C3=A9ation d'un groupe dans Active Directory<=
/strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5278" data-end=3D"5953">
<li data-start=3D"5278" data-end=3D"5373" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5281" data-end=3D"5299" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
281" data-end=3D"5296">Ouvrir ADUC</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5303" data-end=3D"5373">
<li data-start=3D"5303" data-end=3D"5369" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5305" data-end=3D"5369" class=3D"">Ouvrez l=E2=80=99outil =
<strong data-start=3D"5320" data-end=3D"5368">Utilisateurs et ordinateurs A=
ctive Directory</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5374" data-end=3D"5542" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5377" data-end=3D"5398" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
377" data-end=3D"5396">Cr=C3=A9er un groupe</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5402" data-end=3D"5542">
<li data-start=3D"5402" data-end=3D"5494" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5404" data-end=3D"5494" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r l'unit=C3=A9 organisationnelle (OU) o=C3=B9 vous souhaitez cr=C3=A9er le =
groupe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5498" data-end=3D"5538" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5500" data-end=3D"5538" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"5513" data-end=3D"5524">Nouveau</strong> &gt; <strong data=
-start=3D"5527" data-end=3D"5537">Groupe</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5543" data-end=3D"5876" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5546" data-end=3D"5572" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
546" data-end=3D"5570">Configurer le groupe</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5576" data-end=3D"5876">
<li data-start=3D"5576" data-end=3D"5660" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5578" data-end=3D"5660" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
578" data-end=3D"5595">Nom du groupe</strong> : Entrez un nom pour le group=
e (ex. : <code data-start=3D"5634" data-end=3D"5658">Groupe_Administrateurs=
</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5664" data-end=3D"5788" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5666" data-end=3D"5788" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
666" data-end=3D"5684">Type de groupe</strong> : Choisissez <strong data-st=
art=3D"5698" data-end=3D"5710">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong> pour attribuer d=
es permissions ou <strong data-start=3D"5745" data-end=3D"5761">Distributio=
n</strong> pour envoyer des messages.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5792" data-end=3D"5872" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5794" data-end=3D"5872" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
794" data-end=3D"5814">Port=C3=A9e du groupe</strong> : Choisissez la port=
=C3=A9e (locale, globale, ou universelle).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5877" data-end=3D"5953" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5880" data-end=3D"5907" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
880" data-end=3D"5904">Terminer la cr=C3=A9ation</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5911" data-end=3D"5953">
<li data-start=3D"5911" data-end=3D"5953" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5913" data-end=3D"5953" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5925" data-end=3D"5931">OK</strong> pour cr=C3=A9er le groupe.</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5955" data-end=3D"6002" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5959" data-end=3D"6002">c. Ajouter des utilisateurs =C3=A0 un groupe</stron=
g></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"6004" data-end=3D"6368">
<li data-start=3D"6004" data-end=3D"6131" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6007" data-end=3D"6036" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
007" data-end=3D"6033">S=C3=A9lectionner un groupe</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6040" data-end=3D"6131">
<li data-start=3D"6040" data-end=3D"6127" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6042" data-end=3D"6127" class=3D"">Dans <strong data-start=
=3D"6047" data-end=3D"6055">ADUC</strong>, s=C3=A9lectionnez le groupe auqu=
el vous souhaitez ajouter des utilisateurs.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6132" data-end=3D"6368" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6135" data-end=3D"6165" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
135" data-end=3D"6163">Ajouter des utilisateurs</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6169" data-end=3D"6368">
<li data-start=3D"6169" data-end=3D"6237" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6171" data-end=3D"6237" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r le groupe et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"6222" data-end=3D"62=
36">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6241" data-end=3D"6302" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6243" data-end=3D"6302" class=3D"">Allez dans l'onglet <st=
rong data-start=3D"6263" data-end=3D"6274">Membres</strong> et cliquez sur =
<strong data-start=3D"6290" data-end=3D"6301">Ajouter</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6306" data-end=3D"6368" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6308" data-end=3D"6368" class=3D"">Recherchez les utilisat=
eurs =C3=A0 ajouter et cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"6361" data-end=3D"=
6367">OK</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"6370" data-end=3D"6412" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6374" data-end=3D"6412">d. Modifier ou supprimer un groupe</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"6414" data-end=3D"6753">
<li data-start=3D"6414" data-end=3D"6629" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6417" data-end=3D"6441" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
417" data-end=3D"6439">Modifier un groupe</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6445" data-end=3D"6629">
<li data-start=3D"6445" data-end=3D"6625" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6447" data-end=3D"6625" class=3D"">Pour modifier les param=
=C3=A8tres d'un groupe, faites un clic droit sur le groupe, s=C3=A9lectionn=
ez <strong data-start=3D"6538" data-end=3D"6552">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</stro=
ng>, et ajustez les param=C3=A8tres de groupe, tels que la port=C3=A9e ou l=
es membres.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6630" data-end=3D"6753" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6633" data-end=3D"6658" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
633" data-end=3D"6656">Supprimer un groupe</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6662" data-end=3D"6753">
<li data-start=3D"6662" data-end=3D"6753" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6664" data-end=3D"6753" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r le groupe et choisissez <strong data-start=3D"6713" data-end=3D"6726">Sup=
primer</strong>. Confirmez la suppression.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"6755" data-end=3D"6758" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6760" data-end=3D"6819" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6763" data-end=3D"6819">5. Strat=C3=A9gies de gestion des utilisateurs et g=
roupes</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6821" data-end=3D"6878" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6825" data-end=3D"6878">a. Utilisation des unit=C3=A9s organisationnelles (=
OU)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6880" data-end=3D"7136" class=3D"">Les unit=C3=A9s organis=
ationnelles permettent de mieux organiser les utilisateurs et les groupes. =
Par exemple, vous pouvez cr=C3=A9er des OU par d=C3=A9partement (ex : <stro=
ng data-start=3D"7033" data-end=3D"7056">Ressources humaines</strong>, <str=
ong data-start=3D"7058" data-end=3D"7069">Finance</strong>, etc.) et y plac=
er les utilisateurs et les groupes correspondants.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"7138" data-end=3D"7470">
<li data-start=3D"7138" data-end=3D"7333" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7141" data-end=3D"7168" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
141" data-end=3D"7166">Cr=C3=A9er une nouvelle OU</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7172" data-end=3D"7333">
<li data-start=3D"7172" data-end=3D"7284" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7174" data-end=3D"7284" class=3D"">Dans <strong data-start=
=3D"7179" data-end=3D"7187">ADUC</strong>, faites un clic droit sur le doma=
ine et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"7241" data-end=3D"7253">Nouv=
elle</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"7256" data-end=3D"7283">Unit=C3=A9=
 organisationnelle</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7288" data-end=3D"7333" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7290" data-end=3D"7333" class=3D"">Donnez un nom =C3=A0 l'=
OU et cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"7326" data-end=3D"7332">OK</strong>=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7335" data-end=3D"7470" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7338" data-end=3D"7381" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
338" data-end=3D"7379">D=C3=A9placer des utilisateurs vers une OU</strong> =
:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7385" data-end=3D"7470">
<li data-start=3D"7385" data-end=3D"7470" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7387" data-end=3D"7470" class=3D"">Faites glisser et d=C3=
=A9posez des utilisateurs dans l'OU appropri=C3=A9e pour les organiser.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"7472" data-end=3D"7525" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7476" data-end=3D"7525">b. Utilisation des strat=C3=A9gies de groupe (GPO)<=
/strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7527" data-end=3D"7794" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"7531" data-end=3D"7555">strat=C3=A9gies de groupe</strong> permettent d=
e d=C3=A9finir des r=C3=A8gles et des configurations =C3=A0 appliquer aux u=
tilisateurs et groupes dans Active Directory. Par exemple, vous pouvez cr=
=C3=A9er une GPO pour d=C3=A9finir un mot de passe complexe ou une politiqu=
e de verrouillage de compte.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"7796" data-end=3D"8073">
<li data-start=3D"7796" data-end=3D"7931" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7799" data-end=3D"7827" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
799" data-end=3D"7825">Cr=C3=A9er une nouvelle GPO</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7831" data-end=3D"7931">
<li data-start=3D"7831" data-end=3D"7927" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7833" data-end=3D"7927" class=3D"">Utilisez l'outil <stron=
g data-start=3D"7850" data-end=3D"7893">Gestion des strat=C3=A9gies de grou=
pe (GPMC)</strong> pour cr=C3=A9er et configurer des GPO.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7932" data-end=3D"8073" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7935" data-end=3D"7958" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
935" data-end=3D"7956">Appliquer une GPO</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7962" data-end=3D"8073">
<li data-start=3D"7962" data-end=3D"8073" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7964" data-end=3D"8073" class=3D"">Une fois la GPO configu=
r=C3=A9e, liez-la =C3=A0 l'OU ou au domaine sp=C3=A9cifique en cliquant sur=
 <strong data-start=3D"8048" data-end=3D"8072">Lier un GPO existant</strong=
>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"8075" data-end=3D"8078" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8080" data-end=3D"8136" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8083" data-end=3D"8136">6. Audits et s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des utilisateurs et=
 groupes</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"8138" data-end=3D"8197" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8142" data-end=3D"8197">a. Auditer l'acc=C3=A8s et les changements d'utilis=
ateur</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8199" data-end=3D"8443" class=3D"">L'audit des utilisateur=
s et des groupes dans Active Directory permet de suivre les =C3=A9v=C3=A9ne=
ments de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, comme les connexions et les tentatives d'acc=
=C3=A8s non autoris=C3=A9es. Vous pouvez configurer l'audit via les <strong=
 data-start=3D"8408" data-end=3D"8442">strat=C3=A9gies de s=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9 locales</strong>.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"8445" data-end=3D"8682">
<li data-start=3D"8445" data-end=3D"8682" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8448" data-end=3D"8469" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
448" data-end=3D"8467">Activer l'audit</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8473" data-end=3D"8682">
<li data-start=3D"8473" data-end=3D"8582" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8475" data-end=3D"8582" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
