<ul data-start=3D"3961" data-end=3D"4125">
<li data-start=3D"3961" data-end=3D"4125" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3963" data-end=3D"4125" class=3D"">Sous <strong data-start=
=3D"3968" data-end=3D"4004">S=C3=A9lectionner des fonctionnalit=C3=A9s</str=
ong>, assurez-vous que le r=C3=B4le <strong data-start=3D"4031" data-end=3D=
"4070">Services de fichiers et de stockage</strong> est install=C3=A9, puis=
 cochez <strong data-start=3D"4097" data-end=3D"4124">Partage de fichiers S=
MB</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4126" data-end=3D"4246" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4129" data-end=3D"4162" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
129" data-end=3D"4160">Appliquer les modifications</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4166" data-end=3D"4246">
<li data-start=3D"4166" data-end=3D"4246" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4168" data-end=3D"4246" class=3D"">Suivez l'assistant et a=
ppliquez les modifications, puis red=C3=A9marrez le serveur.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4248" data-end=3D"4251" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4253" data-end=3D"4290" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4256" data-end=3D"4290">3. Partage de fichiers via SMB</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4292" data-end=3D"4335" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4296" data-end=3D"4335">a. Cr=C3=A9ation d=E2=80=99un dossier =C3=A0 partag=
er</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4337" data-end=3D"4954">
<li data-start=3D"4337" data-end=3D"4486" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4340" data-end=3D"4362" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
340" data-end=3D"4360">Cr=C3=A9er un dossier</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4366" data-end=3D"4486">
<li data-start=3D"4366" data-end=3D"4403" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4368" data-end=3D"4403" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"4375" data-end=3D"4402">Explorateur de fichiers</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4407" data-end=3D"4486" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4409" data-end=3D"4486" class=3D"">Cr=C3=A9ez un dossier q=
ue vous souhaitez partager, par exemple, <strong data-start=3D"4468" data-e=
nd=3D"4485">"Partage_SMB"</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4487" data-end=3D"4954" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4490" data-end=3D"4535" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
490" data-end=3D"4533">Param=C3=A9trer les autorisations de partage</strong=
> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4539" data-end=3D"4954">
<li data-start=3D"4539" data-end=3D"4611" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4541" data-end=3D"4611" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r le dossier, puis s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"4596" data-end=
=3D"4610">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4615" data-end=3D"4680" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4617" data-end=3D"4680" class=3D"">Allez dans l'onglet <st=
rong data-start=3D"4637" data-end=3D"4648">Partage</strong>, puis cliquez s=
ur <strong data-start=3D"4667" data-end=3D"4679">Partager</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4684" data-end=3D"4862" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4686" data-end=3D"4862" class=3D"">Choisissez les utilisat=
eurs ou groupes qui auront acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 ce dossier. Vous pouvez choisi=
r <strong data-start=3D"4776" data-end=3D"4793">Tout le monde</strong> pour=
 un acc=C3=A8s public ou restreindre l'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 certains utilisate=
urs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4866" data-end=3D"4954" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4868" data-end=3D"4954" class=3D"">D=C3=A9finissez les niv=
eaux d'acc=C3=A8s : <strong data-start=3D"4901" data-end=3D"4912">Lecture</=
strong>, <strong data-start=3D"4914" data-end=3D"4930">Modification</strong=
>, ou <strong data-start=3D"4935" data-end=3D"4953">Contr=C3=B4le total</st=
rong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4956" data-end=3D"4993" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4960" data-end=3D"4993">b. Activer le partage via SMB</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4995" data-end=3D"5515">
<li data-start=3D"4995" data-end=3D"5195" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4998" data-end=3D"5029" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
998" data-end=3D"5027">Activer le partage avanc=C3=A9</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5033" data-end=3D"5195">
<li data-start=3D"5033" data-end=3D"5097" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5035" data-end=3D"5097" class=3D"">Allez dans les <strong =
data-start=3D"5050" data-end=3D"5064">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong> du doss=
ier &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5078" data-end=3D"5096">Partage avanc=C3=A9<=
/strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5101" data-end=3D"5142" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5103" data-end=3D"5142" class=3D"">Cochez la case <strong =
data-start=3D"5118" data-end=3D"5141">Partager ce dossier</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5146" data-end=3D"5195" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5148" data-end=3D"5195" class=3D"">Donnez un nom au partag=
e (ex : <strong data-start=3D"5179" data-end=3D"5193">PartageSmb</strong>).=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5196" data-end=3D"5515" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5199" data-end=3D"5239" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
199" data-end=3D"5237">G=C3=A9rer les autorisations de partage</strong> :</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"5243" data-end=3D"5515">
<li data-start=3D"5243" data-end=3D"5395" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5245" data-end=3D"5395" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5257" data-end=3D"5274">Autorisations</strong> pour g=C3=A9rer l=
es droits d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s. Par exemple, vous pouvez autoriser la lectu=
re ou l=E2=80=99=C3=A9criture pour diff=C3=A9rents utilisateurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5399" data-end=3D"5515" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5401" data-end=3D"5515" class=3D"">Les autorisations peuve=
nt =C3=AAtre configur=C3=A9es pour des utilisateurs sp=C3=A9cifiques en fon=
ction de leurs besoins d'acc=C3=A8s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5517" data-end=3D"5554" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5521" data-end=3D"5554">c. Acc=C3=A9der au partage via SMB</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5556" data-end=3D"5893">
<li data-start=3D"5556" data-end=3D"5734" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5559" data-end=3D"5588" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
559" data-end=3D"5586">Sur un autre ordinateur</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5592" data-end=3D"5734">
<li data-start=3D"5592" data-end=3D"5629" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5594" data-end=3D"5629" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5601" data-end=3D"5628">Explorateur de fichiers</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5633" data-end=3D"5734" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5635" data-end=3D"5734" class=3D"">Tapez le chemin UNC pou=
r acc=C3=A9der au partage SMB, par exemple :<br data-start=3D"5697" data-en=
d=3D"5700">
<code data-start=3D"5705" data-end=3D"5734">\\Nom_du_serveur\PartageSmb</co=
de></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5735" data-end=3D"5893" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5738" data-end=3D"5767" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
738" data-end=3D"5765">Entrer les identifiants</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5771" data-end=3D"5893">
<li data-start=3D"5771" data-end=3D"5893" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5773" data-end=3D"5893" class=3D"">Si n=C3=A9cessaire, ent=
rez les identifiants de connexion (nom d'utilisateur et mot de passe) pour =
acc=C3=A9der au dossier partag=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5895" data-end=3D"5898" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5900" data-end=3D"5931" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5903" data-end=3D"5931">4. S=C3=A9curiser l=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s SMB</strong>=
</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5933" data-end=3D"5985" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5937" data-end=3D"5985">a. Contr=C3=B4le des permissions d'acc=C3=A8s via N=
TFS</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5987" data-end=3D"6177" class=3D"">Les autorisations <stro=
ng data-start=3D"6005" data-end=3D"6013">NTFS</strong> permettent de contr=
=C3=B4ler l=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s aux fichiers et dossiers locaux, et elles so=
nt utilis=C3=A9es en compl=C3=A9ment des autorisations de partage. Voici co=
mment les configurer :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6179" data-end=3D"6531">
<li data-start=3D"6179" data-end=3D"6363" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6182" data-end=3D"6215" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
182" data-end=3D"6213">Acc=C3=A9der aux propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s NTFS</strong> =
:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6219" data-end=3D"6363">
<li data-start=3D"6219" data-end=3D"6296" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6221" data-end=3D"6296" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r le dossier partag=C3=A9 et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"6281" =
data-end=3D"6295">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6300" data-end=3D"6363" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6302" data-end=3D"6363" class=3D"">Allez dans l=E2=80=99on=
glet <strong data-start=3D"6322" data-end=3D"6334">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</stro=
ng> et cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"6350" data-end=3D"6362">Modifier</=
strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6364" data-end=3D"6531" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6367" data-end=3D"6403" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
367" data-end=3D"6401">D=C3=A9finir les autorisations NTFS</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6407" data-end=3D"6531">
<li data-start=3D"6407" data-end=3D"6531" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6409" data-end=3D"6531" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez un ut=
ilisateur ou groupe et attribuez les autorisations appropri=C3=A9es (Lectur=
e, =C3=89criture, Modifications, etc.).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"6533" data-end=3D"6583" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6537" data-end=3D"6583">b. S=C3=A9curisation de SMB avec le chiffrement</st=
rong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6585" data-end=3D"6722" class=3D"">SMB 3.0 prend en charge=
 le <strong data-start=3D"6612" data-end=3D"6627">chiffrement</strong> des =
donn=C3=A9es =C3=A9chang=C3=A9es, ce qui permet de s=C3=A9curiser les donn=
=C3=A9es lors du transfert sur le r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6724" data-end=3D"7142">
<li data-start=3D"6724" data-end=3D"6929" class=3D"">
