s</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2842" data-end=3D"3010" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2845" data-end=3D"2889" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
845" data-end=3D"2887">S=C3=A9lectionner la partition =C3=A0 configurer</st=
rong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2893" data-end=3D"3010">
<li data-start=3D"2893" data-end=3D"3010" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2895" data-end=3D"3010" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r la partition que vous souhaitez configurer avec des quotas et s=C3=A9lect=
ionnez <strong data-start=3D"2995" data-end=3D"3009">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</=
strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"3012" data-end=3D"3054" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3016" data-end=3D"3054">b. Activation des quotas de disque</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3056" data-end=3D"3460">
<li data-start=3D"3056" data-end=3D"3123" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3059" data-end=3D"3123" class=3D"">Allez dans l=E2=80=99on=
glet <strong data-start=3D"3079" data-end=3D"3088">Quota</strong> dans les =
<strong data-start=3D"3098" data-end=3D"3122">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s du volum=
