<h3 data-start=3D"4495" data-end=3D"4546" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4499" data-end=3D"4546">b. Configurer le routage sur Windows Server</strong=
></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4547" data-end=3D"4636" class=3D"">Si vous utilisez <stron=
g data-start=3D"4564" data-end=3D"4582">Windows Server</strong> comme route=
ur, vous devez activer le <strong data-start=3D"4620" data-end=3D"4634">rou=
tage IP</strong> :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4637" data-end=3D"4928">
<li data-start=3D"4637" data-end=3D"4746" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4640" data-end=3D"4746" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
640" data-end=3D"4670">Activer le r=C3=B4le de routage</strong> via <strong=
 data-start=3D"4675" data-end=3D"4702">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong> &gt=
; <strong data-start=3D"4705" data-end=3D"4745">Ajouter des r=C3=B4les et f=
onctionnalit=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4747" data-end=3D"4832" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4750" data-end=3D"4832" class=3D"">Dans le <strong data-st=
art=3D"4758" data-end=3D"4785">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong>, s=C3=A9lec=
tionnez <strong data-start=3D"4800" data-end=3D"4831">Routage et acc=C3=A8s=
 =C3=A0 distance</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4833" data-end=3D"4928" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4836" data-end=3D"4928" class=3D"">Activez le <strong data=
-start=3D"4847" data-end=3D"4861">Routage IP</strong> et configurez le serv=
eur pour acheminer le trafic entre les VLANs.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4930" data-end=3D"4933" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4935" data-end=3D"4973" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4938" data-end=3D"4973">6. V=C3=A9rification et Surveillance</strong></h2>
