<hr data-start=3D"1364" data-end=3D"1367" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1369" data-end=3D"1425" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1372" data-end=3D"1425">2. Pourquoi utiliser un VPN sous Windows Server ?</=
strong></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"1427" data-end=3D"1902">
<li data-start=3D"1427" data-end=3D"1551" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1429" data-end=3D"1551" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
429" data-end=3D"1441">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong> : Un VPN chiffre les don=
n=C3=A9es envoy=C3=A9es via Internet, garantissant ainsi la confidentialit=
=C3=A9 des communications.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1552" data-end=3D"1681" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1554" data-end=3D"1681" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
554" data-end=3D"1580">Acc=C3=A8s distant s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9</strong> : Per=
met aux utilisateurs distants (t=C3=A9l=C3=A9travailleurs, filiales) d=E2=
=80=99acc=C3=A9der au r=C3=A9seau de l'entreprise.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1682" data-end=3D"1794" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1684" data-end=3D"1794" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
684" data-end=3D"1707">R=C3=A9duction des co=C3=BBts</strong> : =C3=89vite =
d=E2=80=99avoir =C3=A0 mettre en place une infrastructure co=C3=BBteuse pou=
r l'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 distance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1795" data-end=3D"1902" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1797" data-end=3D"1902" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
797" data-end=3D"1820">Gestion centralis=C3=A9e</strong> : Le serveur g=C3=
=A8re les connexions et l=E2=80=99authentification des utilisateurs distant=
s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1904" data-end=3D"1907" class=3D"">
