</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4984" data-end=3D"5022" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4988" data-end=3D"5022">b. Configuration de L2TP/IPsec</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5024" data-end=3D"5365">
<li data-start=3D"5024" data-end=3D"5188" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5027" data-end=3D"5051" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
027" data-end=3D"5049">Activer L2TP/IPsec</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5055" data-end=3D"5188">
<li data-start=3D"5055" data-end=3D"5184" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5057" data-end=3D"5184" class=3D"">Dans <strong data-start=
=3D"5062" data-end=3D"5087">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s du serveur</strong>, sous =
l'onglet <strong data-start=3D"5103" data-end=3D"5115">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</=
strong>, cochez <strong data-start=3D"5124" data-end=3D"5138">L2TP/IPsec</s=
trong> et configurez un secret partag=C3=A9 pour l'IPsec.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5189" data-end=3D"5365" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5192" data-end=3D"5220" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
192" data-end=3D"5218">Configurer le pare-feu</strong> :</p>
