<p data-start=3D"5226" data-end=3D"5365" class=3D"">Ouvrez les ports <stron=
g data-start=3D"5243" data-end=3D"5256">500 (UDP)</strong>, <strong data-st=
art=3D"5258" data-end=3D"5272">4500 (UDP)</strong>, et <strong data-start=
=3D"5277" data-end=3D"5291">1701 (UDP)</strong> dans le pare-feu pour perme=
ttre =C3=A0 L2TP/IPsec de fonctionner correctement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5367" data-end=3D"5399" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5371" data-end=3D"5399">c. Configuration de SSTP</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5401" data-end=3D"5716">
<li data-start=3D"5401" data-end=3D"5534" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5404" data-end=3D"5452" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
