ive Directory. Ces strat=C3=A9gies peuvent =C3=AAtre appliqu=C3=A9es sur :<=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"1684" data-end=3D"1921">
<li data-start=3D"1684" data-end=3D"1769" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1686" data-end=3D"1769" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"1690" data-end=3D"1705">ordinateurs</strong> (param=C3=A8tres li=C3=A9s=
 =C3=A0 la configuration du syst=C3=A8me d'exploitation).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1770" data-end=3D"1921" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1772" data-end=3D"1921" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"1776" data-end=3D"1792">utilisateurs</strong> (param=C3=A8tres li=C3=A9=
s =C3=A0 la configuration de l'environnement utilisateur, comme les restric=
tions, les configurations du bureau, etc.).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1923" data-end=3D"1974" class=3D"">Les GPO sont appliqu=C3=
=A9es =C3=A0 des niveaux sp=C3=A9cifiques :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1976" data-end=3D"2179">
<li data-start=3D"1976" data-end=3D"2026" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1978" data-end=3D"2026" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
978" data-end=3D"1989">Domaine</strong> : Appliqu=C3=A9e =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99e=
nsemble du domaine.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2027" data-end=3D"2123" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2029" data-end=3D"2123" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
029" data-end=3D"2061">Unit=C3=A9 Organisationnelle (OU)</strong> : Appliqu=
=C3=A9e =C3=A0 une unit=C3=A9 organisationnelle sp=C3=A9cifique dans AD.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2124" data-end=3D"2176" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2126" data-end=3D"2176" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
126" data-end=3D"2134">Site</strong> : Appliqu=C3=A9e =C3=A0 un site r=C3=
=A9seau particulier.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2180" data-end=3D"2260" class=3D"">Les GPO sont stock=C3=
=A9es dans l'annuaire AD et sont g=C3=A9r=C3=A9es via la console <strong da=
ta-start=3D"2251" data-end=3D"2259">GPMC</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2262" data-end=3D"2265" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2267" data-end=3D"2315" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2270" data-end=3D"2315">3. Architecture de la Politique de Groupe</strong><=
/h2>
<p data-start=3D"2317" data-end=3D"2373" class=3D"">Les GPO peuvent conteni=
r plusieurs types de param=C3=A8tres :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2375" data-end=3D"2848">
<li data-start=3D"2375" data-end=3D"2517" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2377" data-end=3D"2517" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
377" data-end=3D"2403">Param=C3=A8tres de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong> : Con=
tr=C3=B4le des strat=C3=A9gies de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des comptes utilisateu=
rs, des mots de passe, de l=E2=80=99audit, des pare-feu, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2518" data-end=3D"2681" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2520" data-end=3D"2681" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
520" data-end=3D"2542">Param=C3=A8tres syst=C3=A8me</strong> : Configuratio=
n des param=C3=A8tres du syst=C3=A8me d'exploitation, comme les scripts de =
d=C3=A9marrage, les services, la gestion de l'alimentation, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2682" data-end=3D"2848" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2684" data-end=3D"2848" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
684" data-end=3D"2710">Param=C3=A8tres utilisateur</strong> : Param=C3=A8tr=
es de configuration pour l'environnement utilisateur, tels que les param=C3=
=A8tres du bureau, les applications, les raccourcis, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2850" data-end=3D"2913" class=3D"">Les GPO suivent une hi=
=C3=A9rarchie qui d=C3=A9termine leur application :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"2915" data-end=3D"3266">
<li data-start=3D"2915" data-end=3D"3034" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2918" data-end=3D"3034" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
918" data-end=3D"2937">Les GPO de Site</strong> : Appliqu=C3=A9es en premie=
r lieu (si l'ordinateur ou l'utilisateur appartient =C3=A0 un site sp=C3=A9=
cifique).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3035" data-end=3D"3096" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3038" data-end=3D"3096" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
038" data-end=3D"3060">Les GPO de Domaine</strong> : Appliqu=C3=A9es apr=C3=
=A8s les GPO de site.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3097" data-end=3D"3266" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3100" data-end=3D"3266" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
100" data-end=3D"3142">Les GPO d'Unit=C3=A9 Organisationnelle (OU)</strong>=
 : Appliqu=C3=A9es en dernier. Elles peuvent remplacer ou ajouter des confi=
gurations d=C3=A9finies dans les GPO de site ou de domaine.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3268" data-end=3D"3271" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3273" data-end=3D"3308" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3276" data-end=3D"3308">4. Outils pour G=C3=A9rer les GPO</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3310" data-end=3D"3458" class=3D"">Le principal outil pour=
 g=C3=A9rer les GPO est la <strong data-start=3D"3355" data-end=3D"3402">Co=
nsole de gestion des strat=C3=A9gies de groupe</strong> (GPMC). Voici les =
=C3=A9tapes pour y acc=C3=A9der et l'utiliser :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"3460" data-end=3D"3847">
<li data-start=3D"3460" data-end=3D"3645" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3463" data-end=3D"3483" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
463" data-end=3D"3481">Acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 GPMC</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3487" data-end=3D"3645">
<li data-start=3D"3487" data-end=3D"3563" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3489" data-end=3D"3563" class=3D"">Sur un serveur avec Win=
dows Server, ouvrez le <strong data-start=3D"3535" data-end=3D"3562">Gestio=
nnaire de serveur</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3567" data-end=3D"3645" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3569" data-end=3D"3645" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"3580" data-end=3D"3590">Outils</strong> et s=C3=A9lectionnez <str=
ong data-start=3D"3607" data-end=3D"3644">Gestion de la strat=C3=A9gie de g=
roupe</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3647" data-end=3D"3847" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3650" data-end=3D"3669" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
650" data-end=3D"3667">Explorer GPMC</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3673" data-end=3D"3847">
<li data-start=3D"3673" data-end=3D"3798" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3675" data-end=3D"3798" class=3D"">La fen=C3=AAtre GPMC s=
=E2=80=99ouvre, affichant une arborescence avec les diff=C3=A9rents domaine=
s et les <strong data-start=3D"3763" data-end=3D"3792">Unit=C3=A9s Organisa=
tionnelles</strong> (OU).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3802" data-end=3D"3847" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3847" class=3D"">Vous pouvez y cr=C3=A9e=
r, lier et g=C3=A9rer les GPO.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3849" data-end=3D"3852" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3854" data-end=3D"3882" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3857" data-end=3D"3882">5. Cr=C3=A9ation d=E2=80=99une GPO</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3884" data-end=3D"3918" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3888" data-end=3D"3918">a. Cr=C3=A9er une GPO dans GPMC</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3920" data-end=3D"4531">
<li data-start=3D"3920" data-end=3D"4039" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3923" data-end=3D"3940" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
923" data-end=3D"3938">Ouvrir GPMC</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3944" data-end=3D"4039">
<li data-start=3D"3944" data-end=3D"4035" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3946" data-end=3D"4035" class=3D"">Lancez la console <stro=
ng data-start=3D"3964" data-end=3D"3972">GPMC</strong> depuis le Gestionnai=
re de serveur ou via le menu <strong data-start=3D"4022" data-end=3D"4034">=
D=C3=A9marrer</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4040" data-end=3D"4252" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4043" data-end=3D"4071" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
043" data-end=3D"4069">Cr=C3=A9er une nouvelle GPO</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4075" data-end=3D"4252">
<li data-start=3D"4075" data-end=3D"4177" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4077" data-end=3D"4177" class=3D"">Dans l=E2=80=99arboresc=
ence, faites un clic droit sur le domaine ou l'OU o=C3=B9 vous souhaitez ap=
pliquer la GPO.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4181" data-end=3D"4248" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4183" data-end=3D"4248" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4196" data-end=3D"4247">Cr=C3=A9er un GPO dans ce domaine,=
 et le lier ici...</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4253" data-end=3D"4367" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4256" data-end=3D"4275" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
256" data-end=3D"4273">Nommer la GPO</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4279" data-end=3D"4367">
<li data-start=3D"4279" data-end=3D"4363" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4281" data-end=3D"4363" class=3D"">Donnez un nom descripti=
f =C3=A0 la GPO (ex. : "Strat=C3=A9gie de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 - Mots de pass=
e").</p>
