<li data-start=3D"4368" data-end=3D"4531" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4371" data-end=3D"4394" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
371" data-end=3D"4392">Configurer la GPO</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4398" data-end=3D"4531">
<li data-start=3D"4398" data-end=3D"4531" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4400" data-end=3D"4531" class=3D"">Une fois la GPO cr=C3=
=A9=C3=A9e, faites un clic droit sur celle-ci et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong =
data-start=3D"4473" data-end=3D"4485">Modifier</strong> pour ouvrir l'=C3=
=A9diteur de strat=C3=A9gie de groupe.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4533" data-end=3D"4536" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4538" data-end=3D"4570" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4541" data-end=3D"4570">6. Modification d=E2=80=99une GPO</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4572" data-end=3D"4690" class=3D"">L'=C3=A9diteur de strat=
=C3=A9gie de groupe permet de d=C3=A9finir des configurations pour <strong =
data-start=3D"4647" data-end=3D"4663">l'ordinateur</strong> et pour <strong=
 data-start=3D"4672" data-end=3D"4689">l'utilisateur</strong>.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4692" data-end=3D"5650">
<li data-start=3D"4692" data-end=3D"5008" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4695" data-end=3D"4727" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
695" data-end=3D"4725">Param=C3=A8tres de l=E2=80=99ordinateur</strong> :</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"4731" data-end=3D"5008">
<li data-start=3D"4731" data-end=3D"4879" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4733" data-end=3D"4879" class=3D"">Les param=C3=A8tres sou=
s <strong data-start=3D"4753" data-end=3D"4786">Configuration de l'ordinate=
ur</strong> affectent le syst=C3=A8me d'exploitation, les services, les scr=
ipts de d=C3=A9marrage et d'arr=C3=AAt, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4883" data-end=3D"5004" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4885" data-end=3D"5004" class=3D"">Exemple : <strong data-=
start=3D"4895" data-end=3D"4923">Configuration de Windows</strong> &gt; <st=
rong data-start=3D"4926" data-end=3D"4952">Param=C3=A8tres de s=C3=A9curit=
=C3=A9</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"4955" data-end=3D"4977">Strat=C3=
=A9gies locales</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"4980" data-end=3D"5003"=
>Options de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5009" data-end=3D"5316" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5012" data-end=3D"5045" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
012" data-end=3D"5043">Param=C3=A8tres de l=E2=80=99utilisateur</strong> :<=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"5049" data-end=3D"5316">
<li data-start=3D"5049" data-end=3D"5221" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5051" data-end=3D"5221" class=3D"">Les param=C3=A8tres sou=
s <strong data-start=3D"5071" data-end=3D"5105">Configuration de l'utilisat=
eur</strong> affectent l'environnement de l'utilisateur, comme les profils,=
 les restrictions, les redirections de dossiers, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5225" data-end=3D"5316" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5227" data-end=3D"5316" class=3D"">Exemple : <strong data-=
start=3D"5237" data-end=3D"5271">Configuration de l=E2=80=99utilisateur</st=
rong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5274" data-end=3D"5302">Mod=C3=A8les d'adm=
inistration</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5305" data-end=3D"5315">Bur=
eau</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5318" data-end=3D"5650" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5321" data-end=3D"5421" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
