"5443" data-end=3D"5476">Configuration de l'ordinateur</strong> &gt; <stron=
g data-start=3D"5479" data-end=3D"5507">Mod=C3=A8les d'administration</stro=
ng> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5510" data-end=3D"5532">Composants Windows</=
strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5535" data-end=3D"5571">Contr=C3=B4le de=
 compte d=E2=80=99utilisateur</strong>.</p>
