</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2711" data-end=3D"3019" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2714" data-end=3D"2759" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
714" data-end=3D"2757">V=C3=A9rification des Param=C3=A8tres de Kerberos</s=
trong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2763" data-end=3D"3019">
<li data-start=3D"2763" data-end=3D"2943" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2765" data-end=3D"2943" class=3D"">Vous pouvez v=C3=A9rifi=
er l'=C3=A9tat de Kerberos en utilisant la commande <code data-start=3D"283=
0" data-end=3D"2837">klist</code> dans l'invite de commandes. Cette command=
e permet d'afficher les tickets Kerberos en cours d'utilisation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2947" data-end=3D"3019" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2949" data-end=3D"3019" class=3D"">Exemple : <code data-st=
