ets Kerberos actuels.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3021" data-end=3D"3521" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3024" data-end=3D"3068" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
024" data-end=3D"3066">Configurer le Dur=C3=A9e de Vie des Tickets</strong>=
 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3072" data-end=3D"3521">
<li data-start=3D"3072" data-end=3D"3181" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3074" data-end=3D"3181" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"3077" data-end=3D"3101">Dur=C3=A9e de vie des TGT</strong> et des <stro=
ng data-start=3D"3109" data-end=3D"3131">Tickets de Service</strong> peuven=
t =C3=AAtre modifi=C3=A9s via la strat=C3=A9gie de groupe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3185" data-end=3D"3382" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3187" data-end=3D"3382" class=3D"">Acc=C3=A9dez =C3=A0 <st=
rong data-start=3D"3197" data-end=3D"3239">GPMC (Group Policy Management Co=
nsole)</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"3242" data-end=3D"3275">Configur=
ation de l'ordinateur</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"3278" data-end=3D=
"3300">Param=C3=A8tres Windows</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"3303" da=
ta-end=3D"3329">Param=C3=A8tres de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong> &gt; <strong=
 data-start=3D"3332" data-end=3D"3356">Strat=C3=A9gies de compte</strong> &=
gt; <strong data-start=3D"3359" data-end=3D"3381">Strat=C3=A9gie Kerberos</=
strong>.</p>
