<li data-start=3D"1550" data-end=3D"1651" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1553" data-end=3D"1569" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
553" data-end=3D"1566">M=C3=A9thode 1</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1573" data-end=3D"1651">
<li data-start=3D"1573" data-end=3D"1647" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1575" data-end=3D"1647" class=3D"">Appuyez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"1587" data-end=3D"1598">Win + R</strong>, tapez <code data-start=
=3D"1606" data-end=3D"1620">eventvwr.msc</code> et appuyez sur <strong data=
-start=3D"1636" data-end=3D"1646">Entr=C3=A9e</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1652" data-end=3D"1789" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1655" data-end=3D"1671" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
655" data-end=3D"1668">M=C3=A9thode 2</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1675" data-end=3D"1789">
<li data-start=3D"1675" data-end=3D"1789" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1677" data-end=3D"1789" class=3D"">Cliquez sur le menu <st=
rong data-start=3D"1697" data-end=3D"1709">D=C3=A9marrer</strong> et tapez =
<code data-start=3D"1719" data-end=3D"1733">Event Viewer</code>, puis s=C3=
=A9lectionnez l'outil dans la liste des r=C3=A9sultats.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"1791" data-end=3D"1880" class=3D"">Une fois ouvert, vous v=
errez plusieurs cat=C3=A9gories principales dans le panneau de gauche :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1881" data-end=3D"2116">
<li data-start=3D"1881" data-end=3D"2008" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1883" data-end=3D"2008" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
883" data-end=3D"1903">Journaux Windows</strong> : Cette section contient l=
a plupart des journaux relatifs au syst=C3=A8me, =C3=A0 la s=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9 et aux applications.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2009" data-end=3D"2116" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2011" data-end=3D"2116" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
011" data-end=3D"2044">Applications et Services Logs</strong> : Regroupe de=
s =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements sp=C3=A9cifiques aux applications ou aux services.</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2118" data-end=3D"2169" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2122" data-end=3D"2169">b. Structure des Journaux dans Event Viewer</strong=
></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2170" data-end=3D"2231" class=3D"">Chaque =C3=A9v=C3=A9nem=
ent dans Event Viewer est une entr=C3=A9e contenant :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2232" data-end=3D"2519">
<li data-start=3D"2232" data-end=3D"2267" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2234" data-end=3D"2267" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
234" data-end=3D"2251">Date et heure</strong> de l=E2=80=99=C3=A9v=C3=A9nem=
ent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2268" data-end=3D"2343" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2270" data-end=3D"2343" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
270" data-end=3D"2295">Niveau de l=E2=80=99=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement</strong> (In=
formation, Avertissement, Erreur, Critique).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2344" data-end=3D"2413" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2346" data-end=3D"2413" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
346" data-end=3D"2356">Source</strong> (le programme ou le composant ayant =
g=C3=A9n=C3=A9r=C3=A9 l'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2414" data-end=3D"2438" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2416" data-end=3D"2438" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
416" data-end=3D"2437">ID de l'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2439" data-end=3D"2519" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2441" data-end=3D"2519" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
441" data-end=3D"2456">Description</strong> d=C3=A9taillant l'=C3=A9v=C3=A9=
nement, les erreurs, ou les alertes associ=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2521" data-end=3D"2524" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2526" data-end=3D"2581" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2529" data-end=3D"2581">3. Types de Journaux d'=C3=89v=C3=A9nements Li=C3=
=A9s au R=C3=A9seau</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2583" data-end=3D"2704" class=3D"">Pour surveiller les act=
ivit=C3=A9s r=C3=A9seau, il est important de se concentrer sur plusieurs jo=
urnaux d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements sp=C3=A9cifiques :</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2706" data-end=3D"2737" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2710" data-end=3D"2737">a. Journaux de S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2739" data-end=3D"2952" class=3D"">Les journaux de s=C3=A9=
curit=C3=A9 dans <strong data-start=3D"2769" data-end=3D"2785">Event Viewer=
</strong> sont essentiels pour suivre les connexions, les tentatives d'acc=
=C3=A8s, les changements de privil=C3=A8ges, et d'autres =C3=A9v=C3=A9nemen=
ts critiques concernant la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 du syst=C3=A8me.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2954" data-end=3D"3269">
<li data-start=3D"2954" data-end=3D"3087" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2956" data-end=3D"3087" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
956" data-end=3D"2980">Connexion au domaine</strong> : Toute tentative de c=
onnexion r=C3=A9ussie ou =C3=A9chou=C3=A9e =C3=A0 un serveur, domaine ou or=
dinateur est enregistr=C3=A9e ici.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3088" data-end=3D"3266" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3090" data-end=3D"3266" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
090" data-end=3D"3124">=C3=89v=C3=A9nements de connexion r=C3=A9seau</stron=
g> : Les tentatives de connexion =C3=A0 un serveur via le r=C3=A9seau, via =
RDP (Remote Desktop Protocol), ou par des partages de fichiers sont consign=
=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3270" data-end=3D"3310" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
270" data-end=3D"3308">Exemples d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements =C3=A0 surveiller</s=
trong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3311" data-end=3D"3417">
<li data-start=3D"3311" data-end=3D"3357" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3313" data-end=3D"3357" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
313" data-end=3D"3336">ID d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement 4624</strong> : Connexion r=
=C3=A9ussie.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3358" data-end=3D"3417" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3360" data-end=3D"3417" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
360" data-end=3D"3383">ID d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement 4625</strong> : Tentative d=
e connexion =C3=A9chou=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3419" data-end=3D"3445" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
419" data-end=3D"3443">D=C3=A9tails =C3=A0 rechercher</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3446" data-end=3D"3654">
<li data-start=3D"3446" data-end=3D"3505" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3448" data-end=3D"3505" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99adresse IP de=
 l=E2=80=99utilisateur ou de l=E2=80=99h=C3=B4te se connectant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3506" data-end=3D"3554" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3508" data-end=3D"3554" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99utilisateur a=
uthentifi=C3=A9 (nom d'utilisateur).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3555" data-end=3D"3654" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3557" data-end=3D"3654" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99origine de la=
 tentative de connexion (telles que les adresses IP ou les appareils sp=C3=
=A9cifiques).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3656" data-end=3D"3683" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3660" data-end=3D"3683">b. Journaux Syst=C3=A8me</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3685" data-end=3D"3885" class=3D"">Les journaux syst=C3=A8=
me contiennent des informations sur les services et composants li=C3=A9s au=
 r=C3=A9seau. Par exemple, si le service DHCP ou le service DNS est en pann=
e ou subit un =C3=A9chec, il sera rapport=C3=A9 ici.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3887" data-end=3D"3916" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
887" data-end=3D"3914">=C3=89v=C3=A9nements =C3=A0 surveiller</strong> :</p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"3917" data-end=3D"4095">
<li data-start=3D"3917" data-end=3D"4005" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3919" data-end=3D"4005" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
919" data-end=3D"3942">ID d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement 1058</strong> : Le service =
DHCP ne parvient pas =C3=A0 contacter un serveur DHCP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4006" data-end=3D"4095" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4008" data-end=3D"4095" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
008" data-end=3D"4031">ID d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement 1014</strong> : Le service =
DNS n'a pas pu r=C3=A9soudre une adresse ou un domaine.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4097" data-end=3D"4145" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4101" data-end=3D"4145">c. Journaux des Applications et Services</strong></=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"4147" data-end=3D"4468" class=3D"">Les journaux d'applicat=
ion contiennent des =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements g=C3=A9n=C3=A9r=C3=A9s par des app=
lications ou des services tiers. Si vous utilisez des logiciels de gestion =
du r=C3=A9seau, des outils de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 ou des services de serveur=
 de fichiers, ces journaux peuvent fournir des d=C3=A9tails sur les connexi=
ons ou =C3=A9checs sp=C3=A9cifiques aux applications.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4470" data-end=3D"4483" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
470" data-end=3D"4481">Exemple</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4484" data-end=3D"4618">
<li data-start=3D"4484" data-end=3D"4615" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4486" data-end=3D"4615" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
486" data-end=3D"4518">Journaux d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements de VPN</strong> : Le=
s connexions VPN sont enregistr=C3=A9es ici pour analyser les tentatives de=
 connexion =C3=A0 distance.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4619" data-end=3D"4622" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4624" data-end=3D"4684" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4627" data-end=3D"4684">4. Personnalisation et Filtrage des =C3=89v=C3=A9ne=
ments R=C3=A9seau</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4686" data-end=3D"4745" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4690" data-end=3D"4745">a. Cr=C3=A9ation de Filtres pour une Surveillance C=
ibl=C3=A9e</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4747" data-end=3D"4945" class=3D"">Afin de rendre la surve=
illance plus cibl=C3=A9e et efficace, vous pouvez <strong data-start=3D"481=
5" data-end=3D"4826">filtrer</strong> les =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements en fonction =
de crit=C3=A8res pr=C3=A9cis tels que la source, l'ID d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement=
, le niveau de s=C3=A9v=C3=A9rit=C3=A9, ou la date.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4947" data-end=3D"4972" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
947" data-end=3D"4970">Exemple de filtrage</strong> :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4973" data-end=3D"5388">
<li data-start=3D"4973" data-end=3D"5112" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4976" data-end=3D"5112" class=3D"">Dans <strong data-start=
=3D"4981" data-end=3D"4997">Event Viewer</strong>, sous <strong data-start=
=3D"5004" data-end=3D"5035">Journaux Windows &gt; S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</stron=
g>, cliquez avec le bouton droit et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D=
"5082" data-end=3D"5111">Filtrer le journal actuel</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5113" data-end=3D"5276" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5116" data-end=3D"5276" class=3D"">Dans la fen=C3=AAtre de=
 filtrage, vous pouvez filtrer par <strong data-start=3D"5169" data-end=3D"=
5187">ID d=E2=80=99=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"51=
91" data-end=3D"5201">niveau</strong> pour rechercher des connexions r=C3=
=A9ussies (ID 4624) ou des =C3=A9checs (ID 4625).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5277" data-end=3D"5388" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5280" data-end=3D"5388" class=3D"">Vous pouvez aussi filtr=
er par <strong data-start=3D"5310" data-end=3D"5325">Utilisateur</strong> p=
our voir les =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements associ=C3=A9s =C3=A0 un utilisateur sp=C3=
=A9cifique.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5390" data-end=3D"5439" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5394" data-end=3D"5439">b. Configuration des Alertes d'=C3=89v=C3=A9nements=
</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5441" data-end=3D"5690" class=3D"">Vous pouvez configurer =
des alertes pour =C3=AAtre averti imm=C3=A9diatement lorsqu'un =C3=A9v=C3=
=A9nement particulier se produit. Par exemple, si une tentative de connexio=
n =C3=A9choue de mani=C3=A8re r=C3=A9p=C3=A9t=C3=A9e (indiquant une attaque=
 par brute force), une alerte peut =C3=AAtre g=C3=A9n=C3=A9r=C3=A9e.</p>
<p data-start=3D"5692" data-end=3D"5727" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
692" data-end=3D"5725">Comment configurer une alerte</strong> :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5728" data-end=3D"6068">
<li data-start=3D"5728" data-end=3D"5824" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5731" data-end=3D"5824" class=3D"">Clic droit sur un journ=
al (par exemple, <strong data-start=3D"5771" data-end=3D"5783">S=C3=A9curit=
=C3=A9</strong>), puis s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"5804" data-e=
nd=3D"5823">Cr=C3=A9er une t=C3=A2che</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5825" data-end=3D"5952" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5828" data-end=3D"5952" class=3D"">Sous l'onglet <strong d=
ata-start=3D"5842" data-end=3D"5858">D=C3=A9clencheurs</strong>, vous pouve=
z sp=C3=A9cifier une condition (par exemple, lorsque l=E2=80=99ID d=E2=80=
=99=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement 4625 se produit).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5953" data-end=3D"6068" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5956" data-end=3D"6068" class=3D"">Dans l'onglet <strong d=
ata-start=3D"5970" data-end=3D"5981">Actions</strong>, vous pouvez choisir =
d'envoyer un email, ex=C3=A9cuter un programme ou afficher un message.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"6070" data-end=3D"6073" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6075" data-end=3D"6135" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6078" data-end=3D"6135">5. Surveiller les Connexions R=C3=A9seau avec Event=
 Viewer</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"6137" data-end=3D"6302" class=3D"">Pour une surveillance a=
vanc=C3=A9e des connexions r=C3=A9seau, vous devez examiner plusieurs types=
 d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements qui indiquent des tentatives d'acc=C3=A8s ou des co=
nnexions actives.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6304" data-end=3D"6350" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6308" data-end=3D"6350">a. Connexions RDP et Bureau =C3=A0 Distance</strong=
></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6352" data-end=3D"6520" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s au=
 r=C3=A9seau via <strong data-start=3D"6374" data-end=3D"6407">Remote Deskt=
op Protocol (RDP)</strong> est un vecteur d'attaque privil=C3=A9gi=C3=A9 po=
ur les cybercriminels. Il est donc essentiel de suivre les =C3=A9v=C3=A9nem=
ents RDP.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6522" data-end=3D"6690">
<li data-start=3D"6522" data-end=3D"6576" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6524" data-end=3D"6576" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
524" data-end=3D"6547">ID d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement 1149</strong> : Connexion r=
=C3=A9ussie via RDP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6577" data-end=3D"6633" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6579" data-end=3D"6633" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
579" data-end=3D"6602">ID d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement 4778</strong> : Ouverture d=
'une session RDP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6634" data-end=3D"6690" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6636" data-end=3D"6690" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
636" data-end=3D"6659">ID d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement 4779</strong> : Fermeture d=
'une session RDP.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6692" data-end=3D"6753" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6696" data-end=3D"6753">b. Tentatives de Connexion =C3=A0 des Partages de F=
ichiers</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6755" data-end=3D"6930" class=3D"">Lorsqu'un utilisateur t=
ente d'acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 des ressources partag=C3=A9es sur un r=C3=A9seau=
 (comme des fichiers partag=C3=A9s), cet =C3=A9v=C3=A9nement peut =C3=AAtre=
 enregistr=C3=A9 dans les journaux de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6932" data-end=3D"7020">
<li data-start=3D"6932" data-end=3D"7017" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6934" data-end=3D"7017" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
934" data-end=3D"6957">ID d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement 5140</strong> : Une tentati=
ve d'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 un partage de fichiers a eu lieu.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7021" data-end=3D"7156" class=3D"">Examinez ces =C3=A9v=C3=
=A9nements pour identifier les utilisateurs, les ordinateurs, les adresses =
IP et les ressources auxquelles ils ont acc=C3=A9d=C3=A9.</p>
