data-end=3D"1698">Windows Server</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"1702" da=
ta-end=3D"1733">Windows 10/11 Professionnel</strong> et <strong data-start=
=3D"1737" data-end=3D"1751">Enterprise</strong>.</p>
