<li data-start=3D"3449" data-end=3D"3589" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3452" data-end=3D"3589" class=3D"">Red=C3=A9marrez votre m=
achine et acc=C3=A9dez au BIOS/UEFI (g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement via une touche =
comme <strong data-start=3D"3536" data-end=3D"3542">F2</strong>, <strong da=
ta-start=3D"3544" data-end=3D"3554">Delete</strong>, ou <strong data-start=
=3D"3559" data-end=3D"3566">Esc</strong> pendant le d=C3=A9marrage).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3590" data-end=3D"3698" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3593" data-end=3D"3698" class=3D"">Recherchez les param=C3=
=A8tres de virtualisation et assurez-vous que <strong data-start=3D"3657" d=
ata-end=3D"3671">Intel VT-x</strong> (ou <strong data-start=3D"3676" data-e=
nd=3D"3685">AMD-V</strong>) est activ=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3699" data-end=3D"3760" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3702" data-end=3D"3760" class=3D"">Sauvegardez les modific=
ations et red=C3=A9marrez votre machine.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3762" data-end=3D"3765" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3767" data-end=3D"3814" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3770" data-end=3D"3814">3. Installation et Activation de Hyper-V</strong></=
h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3816" data-end=3D"3890" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3820" data-end=3D"3890">a. Installation de Hyper-V sur Windows 10/11 Pro et=
 Windows Server</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3892" data-end=3D"4819">
<li data-start=3D"3892" data-end=3D"4399" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3895" data-end=3D"3932" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
895" data-end=3D"3930">Via le Panneau de Configuration</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3936" data-end=3D"4399">
<li data-start=3D"3936" data-end=3D"4188" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3938" data-end=3D"3957" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
938" data-end=3D"3955">Windows 10/11</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3963" data-end=3D"4188">
<li data-start=3D"3963" data-end=3D"4070" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3965" data-end=3D"4070" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"3976" data-end=3D"4069">Panneau de Configuration &gt; Programmes =
&gt; Activer ou d=C3=A9sactiver des fonctionnalit=C3=A9s Windows</strong>.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4076" data-end=3D"4121" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4078" data-end=3D"4121" class=3D"">Cochez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"4085" data-end=3D"4096">Hyper-V</strong> puis cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4114" data-end=3D"4120">OK</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4127" data-end=3D"4184" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4129" data-end=3D"4184" class=3D"">Red=C3=A9marrez l=E2=80=
=99ordinateur pour appliquer les changements.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4192" data-end=3D"4399" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4194" data-end=3D"4214" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
194" data-end=3D"4212">Windows Server</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4220" data-end=3D"4399">
<li data-start=3D"4220" data-end=3D"4321" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4222" data-end=3D"4321" class=3D"">Ouvrez le <strong data-=
start=3D"4232" data-end=3D"4259">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong> et s=C3=
=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"4276" data-end=3D"4320">Ajouter des r=
=C3=B4les et des fonctionnalit=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4327" data-end=3D"4395" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4329" data-end=3D"4395" class=3D"">Choisissez <strong data=
-start=3D"4340" data-end=3D"4356">R=C3=B4le Hyper-V</strong> et suivez les =
=C3=A9tapes pour l'installer.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4400" data-end=3D"4658" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4403" data-end=3D"4423" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
403" data-end=3D"4421">Via PowerShell</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4427" data-end=3D"4658">
<li data-start=3D"4427" data-end=3D"4658" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4429" data-end=3D"4530" class=3D"">Ouvrez PowerShell en ta=
nt qu=E2=80=99administrateur et ex=C3=A9cutez la commande suivante pour ins=
