 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4703" data-end=3D"4819">
<li data-start=3D"4703" data-end=3D"4819" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4705" data-end=3D"4819" class=3D"">Une fois install=C3=A9,=
 vous pouvez v=C3=A9rifier si Hyper-V est activ=C3=A9 en ouvrant <strong da=
ta-start=3D"4778" data-end=3D"4797">Hyper-V Manager</strong> via le menu D=
=C3=A9marrer.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4821" data-end=3D"4824" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4826" data-end=3D"4896" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4829" data-end=3D"4896">4. Configuration de Hyper-V et Cr=C3=A9ation d'une =
Machine Virtuelle</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4898" data-end=3D"4937" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4902" data-end=3D"4937">a. Lancement de Hyper-V Manager</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4939" data-end=3D"5144">
<li data-start=3D"4939" data-end=3D"5144" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4942" data-end=3D"4970" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
942" data-end=3D"4968">Ouvrir Hyper-V Manager</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4974" data-end=3D"5144">
<li data-start=3D"4974" data-end=3D"5064" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4976" data-end=3D"5064" class=3D"">Dans <strong data-start=
=3D"4981" data-end=3D"4998">Windows 10/11</strong>, tapez <code data-start=
=3D"5006" data-end=3D"5023">Hyper-V Manager</code> dans la barre de recherc=
he et ouvrez-le.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5068" data-end=3D"5144" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5070" data-end=3D"5144" class=3D"">Sur <strong data-start=
=3D"5074" data-end=3D"5092">Windows Server</strong>, ouvrez-le =C3=A0 parti=
r du <strong data-start=3D"5116" data-end=3D"5143">Gestionnaire de serveur<=
/strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5146" data-end=3D"5189" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5150" data-end=3D"5189">b. Cr=C3=A9ation d'une Machine Virtuelle</strong></=
h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5191" data-end=3D"6055">
<li data-start=3D"5191" data-end=3D"5325" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5194" data-end=3D"5239" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
194" data-end=3D"5237">Lancer l'Assistant de Cr=C3=A9ation d=E2=80=99une VM=
</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5243" data-end=3D"5325">
<li data-start=3D"5243" data-end=3D"5321" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5245" data-end=3D"5321" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5257" data-end=3D"5288">Nouveau &gt; Machine virtuelle</strong> =
dans le menu de Hyper-V Manager.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5326" data-end=3D"5929" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5329" data-end=3D"5384" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
329" data-end=3D"5382">Configurer les Param=C3=A8tres de la Machine Virtuel=
le</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5388" data-end=3D"5929">
<li data-start=3D"5388" data-end=3D"5449" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5390" data-end=3D"5449" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
390" data-end=3D"5406">Nom de la VM</strong> : Donnez un nom =C3=A0 votre m=
achine virtuelle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5453" data-end=3D"5535" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5455" data-end=3D"5535" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
455" data-end=3D"5470">Emplacement</strong> : Choisissez l'emplacement o=C3=
=B9 la machine virtuelle sera stock=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5539" data-end=3D"5581" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5541" data-end=3D"5581" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
541" data-end=3D"5552">M=C3=A9moire</strong> : Allouez de la RAM =C3=A0 la =
VM.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5585" data-end=3D"5701" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5587" data-end=3D"5701" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
587" data-end=3D"5608">Adaptateur r=C3=A9seau</strong> : Assurez-vous que l=
a VM dispose d'un adaptateur r=C3=A9seau virtuel pour se connecter au r=C3=
=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5705" data-end=3D"5798" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5707" data-end=3D"5798" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
707" data-end=3D"5740">Disque dur virtuel (VHD/VHDX)</strong> : Cr=C3=A9ez =
un disque virtuel ou utilisez un disque existant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5802" data-end=3D"5929" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5804" data-end=3D"5929" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
804" data-end=3D"5828">Installation de l'OS</strong> : Vous pouvez installe=
r un syst=C3=A8me d'exploitation en utilisant un fichier ISO ou un CD/DVD p=
hysique.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5931" data-end=3D"6055" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5934" data-end=3D"6055" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
934" data-end=3D"5959">Finaliser la cr=C3=A9ation</strong> : Suivez les =C3=
=A9tapes restantes pour finaliser la configuration et d=C3=A9marrez la mach=
ine virtuelle.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"6057" data-end=3D"6109" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6061" data-end=3D"6109">c. Lancer et Connecter une Machine Virtuelle</stron=
g></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6113" data-end=3D"6354">
<li data-start=3D"6113" data-end=3D"6227" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6115" data-end=3D"6227" class=3D"">Une fois la machine vir=
tuelle cr=C3=A9=C3=A9e, s=C3=A9lectionnez-la dans le <strong data-start=3D"=
6176" data-end=3D"6195">Hyper-V Manager</strong>, puis cliquez sur <strong =
data-start=3D"6214" data-end=3D"6226">D=C3=A9marrer</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6231" data-end=3D"6354" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6233" data-end=3D"6354" class=3D"">Vous pouvez vous connec=
ter =C3=A0 la VM en cliquant sur <strong data-start=3D"6284" data-end=3D"63=
00">Se connecter</strong> et en acc=C3=A9dant =C3=A0 l'interface de la mach=
ine virtuelle.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6356" data-end=3D"6359" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6361" data-end=3D"6418" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6364" data-end=3D"6418">5. Configuration des R=C3=A9seaux Virtuels dans Hyp=
er-V</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6420" data-end=3D"6459" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6424" data-end=3D"6459">a. Cr=C3=A9ation d=E2=80=99un Switch Virtuel</stron=
g></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"6461" data-end=3D"7271">
<li data-start=3D"6461" data-end=3D"6628" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6464" data-end=3D"6511" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
464" data-end=3D"6509">Acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 la gestion des r=C3=A9seaux virt=
uels</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6515" data-end=3D"6628">
<li data-start=3D"6515" data-end=3D"6628" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6517" data-end=3D"6628" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"6524" data-end=3D"6543">Hyper-V Manager</strong>, puis cliquez sur <s=
trong data-start=3D"6562" data-end=3D"6603">Gestionnaire de commutateurs vi=
rtuels</strong> dans le volet de droite.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6630" data-end=3D"7122" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6633" data-end=3D"6670" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
633" data-end=3D"6668">Cr=C3=A9er un nouveau switch virtuel</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6674" data-end=3D"7122">
<li data-start=3D"6674" data-end=3D"7122" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6676" data-end=3D"6809" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"6688" data-end=3D"6719">Nouveau commutateur virtuel</strong> et =
choisissez le type de r=C3=A9seau (Externe, Interne, ou Priv=C3=A9) en fonc=
tion de vos besoins :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6815" data-end=3D"7122">
<li data-start=3D"6815" data-end=3D"6930" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6817" data-end=3D"6930" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
817" data-end=3D"6828">Externe</strong> : Permet =C3=A0 la VM de se connect=
er au r=C3=A9seau physique (id=C3=A9al pour un serveur web ou un service r=
=C3=A9seau).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6936" data-end=3D"7041" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6938" data-end=3D"7041" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
938" data-end=3D"6949">Interne</strong> : Permet =C3=A0 la VM de communique=
r avec l=E2=80=99h=C3=B4te et les autres VMs, mais pas le r=C3=A9seau physi=
que.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7047" data-end=3D"7122" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7049" data-end=3D"7122" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
049" data-end=3D"7058">Priv=C3=A9</strong> : Permet une communication uniqu=
ement entre les VMs sur l=E2=80=99h=C3=B4te.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7124" data-end=3D"7271" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7127" data-end=3D"7161" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
127" data-end=3D"7159">Configurer le switch virtuel</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7165" data-end=3D"7271">
<li data-start=3D"7165" data-end=3D"7271" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7167" data-end=3D"7271" class=3D"">Donnez un nom =C3=A0 vo=
tre commutateur, associez-le =C3=A0 une carte r=C3=A9seau physique et appli=
quez les changements.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"7273" data-end=3D"7334" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7277" data-end=3D"7334">b. Affecter un Switch Virtuel =C3=A0 une Machine Vi=
rtuelle</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"7336" data-end=3D"7601">
<li data-start=3D"7336" data-end=3D"7419" class=3D"">
