gestion du routage entre VLANs et sous-r=C3=A9seaux.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4155" data-end=3D"4158" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4160" data-end=3D"4218" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4163" data-end=3D"4218">3. Configuration de VLANs sous Windows avec Hyper-V=
</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4220" data-end=3D"4285" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4224" data-end=3D"4285">a. Cr=C3=A9ation d'un Commutateur Virtuel Hyper-V p=
our un VLAN</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4287" data-end=3D"4985">
<li data-start=3D"4287" data-end=3D"4366" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4290" data-end=3D"4318" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
290" data-end=3D"4316">Ouvrir Hyper-V Manager</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4322" data-end=3D"4366">
<li data-start=3D"4322" data-end=3D"4366" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4324" data-end=3D"4366" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"4335" data-end=3D"4365">D=C3=A9marrer &gt; Hyper-V Manager</stron=
g>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4368" data-end=3D"4702" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4371" data-end=3D"4413" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
371" data-end=3D"4411">Cr=C3=A9er un nouveau commutateur virtuel</strong> :=
</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4417" data-end=3D"4702">
<li data-start=3D"4417" data-end=3D"4499" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4419" data-end=3D"4499" class=3D"">Dans le panneau =C3=A0 =
droite, cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"4457" data-end=3D"4498">Gestionna=
ire de commutateurs virtuels</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4503" data-end=3D"4620" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4505" data-end=3D"4620" class=3D"">Choisissez <strong data=
-start=3D"4516" data-end=3D"4539">Commutateur externe</strong> pour permett=
re =C3=A0 vos machines virtuelles de communiquer avec le r=C3=A9seau physiq=
ue.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4624" data-end=3D"4702" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4626" data-end=3D"4702" class=3D"">Associez ce commutateur=
 virtuel =C3=A0 la carte r=C3=A9seau physique de votre serveur.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4704" data-end=3D"4985" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4707" data-end=3D"4760" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
707" data-end=3D"4758">Configurer les VLANs sur un Commutateur Virtuel</str=
ong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4764" data-end=3D"4985">
<li data-start=3D"4764" data-end=3D"4848" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4766" data-end=3D"4848" class=3D"">Lors de la cr=C3=A9atio=
n du commutateur, cochez <strong data-start=3D"4809" data-end=3D"4847">Acti=
ver la prise en charge de VLAN</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4852" data-end=3D"4943" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4854" data-end=3D"4943" class=3D"">Entrez un <strong data-=
start=3D"4864" data-end=3D"4875">ID VLAN</strong> pour identifier le VLAN a=
uquel ce commutateur virtuel sera associ=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4947" data-end=3D"4985" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4949" data-end=3D"4985" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4961" data-end=3D"4974">Appliquer</strong> et <strong data-start=
=3D"4978" data-end=3D"4984">OK</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4987" data-end=3D"5043" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4991" data-end=3D"5043">b. Affectation d'un VLAN =C3=A0 une Machine Virtuel=
le</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5045" data-end=3D"5538">
<li data-start=3D"5045" data-end=3D"5174" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5048" data-end=3D"5087" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
048" data-end=3D"5085">S=C3=A9lectionner la Machine Virtuelle</strong> :</p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"5091" data-end=3D"5174">
<li data-start=3D"5091" data-end=3D"5174" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5093" data-end=3D"5174" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"5104" data-end=3D"5123">Hyper-V Manager</strong> et s=C3=A9lectio=
nnez la machine virtuelle =C3=A0 configurer.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5176" data-end=3D"5538" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5179" data-end=3D"5232" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
179" data-end=3D"5230">Configurer l'adaptateur r=C3=A9seau virtuel de la VM=
</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5236" data-end=3D"5538">
<li data-start=3D"5236" data-end=3D"5302" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5238" data-end=3D"5302" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5250" data-end=3D"5264">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> de la VM, puis =
<strong data-start=3D"5280" data-end=3D"5301">Adaptateur r=C3=A9seau</stron=
g>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5306" data-end=3D"5378" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5308" data-end=3D"5378" class=3D"">Choisissez le <strong d=
ata-start=3D"5322" data-end=3D"5345">Commutateur virtuel</strong> que vous =
avez cr=C3=A9=C3=A9 pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9demment.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5382" data-end=3D"5487" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5384" data-end=3D"5487" class=3D"">Activez l'option <stron=
g data-start=3D"5401" data-end=3D"5409">VLAN</strong> et entrez l'ID du VLA=
N que vous souhaitez assigner =C3=A0 cette machine virtuelle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5491" data-end=3D"5538" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5493" data-end=3D"5538" class=3D"">Sauvegardez les param=
=C3=A8tres et d=C3=A9marrez la VM.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5540" data-end=3D"5543" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5545" data-end=3D"5628" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5548" data-end=3D"5628">4. Configuration des Sous-R=C3=A9seaux et des Masqu=
es de Sous-R=C3=A9seau sous Windows</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5630" data-end=3D"5671" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5634" data-end=3D"5671">a. Planification des Sous-R=C3=A9seaux</strong></h3=
>
<p data-start=3D"5673" data-end=3D"5898" class=3D"">Lorsque vous configurez=
 un r=C3=A9seau avec plusieurs sous-r=C3=A9seaux, il est important de bien =
planifier les plages d=E2=80=99adresses IP et de sous-r=C3=A9seaux pour max=
imiser l=E2=80=99utilisation des adresses tout en r=C3=A9duisant la surchar=
ge du r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5900" data-end=3D"6529">
<li data-start=3D"5900" data-end=3D"6051" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5903" data-end=3D"6051" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
903" data-end=3D"5938">Choisir une plage d=E2=80=99adresses IP</strong> : P=
ar exemple, pour un r=C3=A9seau de taille moyenne, vous pouvez utiliser une=
 plage priv=C3=A9e comme <strong data-start=3D"6032" data-end=3D"6050">192.=
168.0.0/24</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6052" data-end=3D"6247" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6055" data-end=3D"6247" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
055" data-end=3D"6092">Diviser le r=C3=A9seau en sous-r=C3=A9seaux</strong>=
 : Utilisez le <strong data-start=3D"6107" data-end=3D"6121">subnetting</st=
rong> pour d=C3=A9couper cette plage en plusieurs sous-r=C3=A9seaux plus pe=
tits (par exemple, <strong data-start=3D"6200" data-end=3D"6218">192.168.0.=
0/26</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"6220" data-end=3D"6239">192.168.0.64/2=
6</strong>, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6248" data-end=3D"6529" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6251" data-end=3D"6529" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
251" data-end=3D"6291">Appliquer des masques de sous-r=C3=A9seau</strong> :=
 D=C3=A9terminez les masques de sous-r=C3=A9seau n=C3=A9cessaires pour chaq=
ue sous-r=C3=A9seau. Le masque <strong data-start=3D"6379" data-end=3D"6396=
">255.255.255.0</strong> correspond =C3=A0 un r=C3=A9seau <strong data-star=
t=3D"6420" data-end=3D"6427">/24</strong> et permet 254 h=C3=B4tes. Un masq=
ue <strong data-start=3D"6459" data-end=3D"6478">255.255.255.192</strong> c=
orrespond =C3=A0 un r=C3=A9seau <strong data-start=3D"6502" data-end=3D"650=
9">/26</strong> et permet 62 h=C3=B4tes.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"6531" data-end=3D"6591" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6535" data-end=3D"6591">b. Configuration des Sous-R=C3=A9seaux sur Windows =
Server</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"6593" data-end=3D"7206">
<li data-start=3D"6593" data-end=3D"6752" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6596" data-end=3D"6644" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
596" data-end=3D"6642">Acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 la gestion des interfaces r=C3=
=A9seau</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6648" data-end=3D"6752">
<li data-start=3D"6648" data-end=3D"6748" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6650" data-end=3D"6748" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"6657" data-end=3D"6747">Panneau de configuration &gt; R=C3=A9seau et =
partage &gt; Modifier les param=C3=A8tres de l=E2=80=99adaptateur</strong>.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6753" data-end=3D"7206" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6756" data-end=3D"6818" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
756" data-end=3D"6816">Attribuer une adresse IP statique =C3=A0 une interfa=
ce r=C3=A9seau</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6822" data-end=3D"7206">
<li data-start=3D"6822" data-end=3D"6958" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6824" data-end=3D"6958" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r l=E2=80=99interface r=C3=A9seau que vous souhaitez configurer (par exempl=
e, un adaptateur VLAN ou un adaptateur physique).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6962" data-end=3D"7051" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6964" data-end=3D"7051" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"6976" data-end=3D"6990">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong> et s=C3=A9=
lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"7007" data-end=3D"7050">Protocole Internet=
 Version 4 (TCP/IPv4)</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7055" data-end=3D"7206" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7057" data-end=3D"7206" class=3D"">Cochez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"7064" data-end=3D"7098">Utiliser l'adresse IP suivante</strong> et en=
trez l'adresse IP dans le sous-r=C3=A9seau appropri=C3=A9, le masque de sou=
s-r=C3=A9seau et la passerelle par d=C3=A9faut.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"7208" data-end=3D"7211" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7213" data-end=3D"7278" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7216" data-end=3D"7278">5. Routage entre VLANs et Sous-R=C3=A9seaux avec Wi=
ndows Server</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7280" data-end=3D"7331" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7284" data-end=3D"7331">a. Activer le Routage et l'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 distan=
ce</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"7333" data-end=3D"7991">
<li data-start=3D"7333" data-end=3D"7403" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7336" data-end=3D"7403" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
336" data-end=3D"7373">Ouvrir le Gestionnaire de serveur</strong> sur votre=
 <strong data-start=3D"7384" data-end=3D"7402">Windows Server</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7404" data-end=3D"7600" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7407" data-end=3D"7459" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
407" data-end=3D"7426">Ajouter le r=C3=B4le</strong> <strong data-start=3D"=
7427" data-end=3D"7458">Routage et acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 distance</strong>.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7463" data-end=3D"7600">
<li data-start=3D"7463" data-end=3D"7596" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7465" data-end=3D"7596" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"7476" data-end=3D"7553">Gestionnaire de serveur &gt; Ajouter des =
r=C3=B4les et des fonctionnalit=C3=A9s &gt; R=C3=B4le</strong> et cochez <s=
trong data-start=3D"7564" data-end=3D"7595">Routage et acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 di=
stance</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7601" data-end=3D"7892" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7604" data-end=3D"7631" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
604" data-end=3D"7629">Configurer le Routage</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7635" data-end=3D"7892">
<li data-start=3D"7635" data-end=3D"7786" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7637" data-end=3D"7786" class=3D"">Une fois le r=C3=B4le i=
nstall=C3=A9, ouvrez <strong data-start=3D"7671" data-end=3D"7702">Routage =
et acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 distance</strong> et configurez le serveur pour agir c=
omme un <strong data-start=3D"7747" data-end=3D"7758">routeur</strong> entr=
e les diff=C3=A9rents VLANs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7790" data-end=3D"7892" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7792" data-end=3D"7892" class=3D"">Configurez un <strong d=
ata-start=3D"7806" data-end=3D"7826">routage statique</strong> ou <strong d=
ata-start=3D"7830" data-end=3D"7843">dynamique</strong> (selon vos besoins)=
 entre les sous-r=C3=A9seaux VLAN.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7894" data-end=3D"7991" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7897" data-end=3D"7991" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
897" data-end=3D"7934">Configurer les r=C3=A8gles de pare-feu</strong> pour=
 autoriser le trafic entre les VLANs, si n=C3=A9cessaire.</p>
</li>
</ol>
