<h3 data-start=3D"6659" data-end=3D"6719" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6663" data-end=3D"6719">b. R=C3=A9plication par Compression et Contr=C3=B4l=
e du Trafic</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6720" data-end=3D"6997" class=3D"">Pour limiter la quantit=
=C3=A9 de donn=C3=A9es r=C3=A9pliqu=C3=A9es entre les sites, <strong data-s=
