<h3 data-start=3D"4417" data-end=3D"4476" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4421" data-end=3D"4476">d. Configurer DNS pour un Environnement Multi-Sites=
</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4477" data-end=3D"5008">
<li data-start=3D"4477" data-end=3D"4615" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4480" data-end=3D"4615" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
