/strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5069" data-end=3D"5117" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5073" data-end=3D"5117">a. Installation et Configuration de DHCP</strong></=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"5118" data-end=3D"5332" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"5121" data-end=3D"5129">DHCP</strong> distribu=C3=A9 sous Windows Serve=
r permet de fournir des adresses IP automatiquement =C3=A0 tous les apparei=
ls qui se connectent au r=C3=A9seau. Voici comment configurer DHCP de mani=
=C3=A8re distribu=C3=A9e sur plusieurs sites.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5334" data-end=3D"5883">
<li data-start=3D"5334" data-end=3D"5556" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5337" data-end=3D"5368" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
337" data-end=3D"5366">Installation du r=C3=B4le DHCP</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5372" data-end=3D"5556">
<li data-start=3D"5372" data-end=3D"5472" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5374" data-end=3D"5472" class=3D"">Ouvrez le <strong data-=
start=3D"5384" data-end=3D"5411">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong>, puis s=
=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"5431" data-end=3D"5471">Ajouter des =
r=C3=B4les et fonctionnalit=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5476" data-end=3D"5556" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5478" data-end=3D"5556" class=3D"">Choisissez le r=C3=B4le=
 <strong data-start=3D"5497" data-end=3D"5513">Serveur DHCP</strong>, puis =
suivez l=E2=80=99assistant pour l=E2=80=99installer.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5558" data-end=3D"5883" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5561" data-end=3D"5688" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
561" data-end=3D"5591">Cr=C3=A9ation d=E2=80=99un =C3=89tendue DHCP</strong=
> :
Une =C3=A9tendue est un ensemble d'adresses IP que le serveur DHCP peut att=
ribuer =C3=A0 des clients.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5692" data-end=3D"5883">
<li data-start=3D"5692" data-end=3D"5791" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5694" data-end=3D"5791" class=3D"">Dans le <strong data-st=
art=3D"5702" data-end=3D"5723">Gestionnaire DHCP</strong>, faites un clic d=
roit sur <strong data-start=3D"5750" data-end=3D"5767">=C3=89tendues DHCP</=
strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5770" data-end=3D"5790">Nouvelle =C3=A9t=
endue</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5795" data-end=3D"5883" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5797" data-end=3D"5883" class=3D"">Configurez la plage d=
=E2=80=99adresses IP, les <strong data-start=3D"5836" data-end=3D"5853">bau=
x de dur=C3=A9e</strong>, les <strong data-start=3D"5859" data-end=3D"5877"=
>param=C3=A8tres DNS</strong>, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5885" data-end=3D"5934" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5889" data-end=3D"5934">b. Configurer le DHCP sur Plusieurs Sites</strong><=
/h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5935" data-end=3D"6810">
<li data-start=3D"5935" data-end=3D"6228" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5938" data-end=3D"6082" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
938" data-end=3D"5990">D=C3=A9finir des =C3=A9tendues distinctes pour chaqu=
e site</strong> : Chaque site peut avoir sa propre plage d'adresses IP pour=
 =C3=A9viter les conflits d=E2=80=99adresses.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6086" data-end=3D"6228">
<li data-start=3D"6086" data-end=3D"6228" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6088" data-end=3D"6228" class=3D"">Par exemple, site 1 pou=
rrait avoir une plage d=E2=80=99adresses <code data-start=3D"6144" data-end=
=3D"6175">192.168.1.100 - 192.168.1.200</code> et site 2 une plage <code da=
ta-start=3D"6196" data-end=3D"6227">192.168.2.100 - 192.168.2.200</code>.</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6230" data-end=3D"6569" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6233" data-end=3D"6430" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
233" data-end=3D"6262">Configurer le Relais DHCP</strong> :
Si les serveurs DHCP ne sont pas sur le m=C3=AAme r=C3=A9seau que les clien=
ts, vous devez configurer un relais DHCP sur les <strong data-start=3D"6382=
" data-end=3D"6394">routeurs</strong> pour transmettre les requ=C3=AAtes DH=
CP.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6434" data-end=3D"6569">
<li data-start=3D"6434" data-end=3D"6569" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6436" data-end=3D"6569" class=3D"">Sur le routeur ou le p=
=C3=A9riph=C3=A9rique de relais, configurez l'option <strong data-start=3D"=
6501" data-end=3D"6521">DHCP relay agent</strong> pour pointer vers les ser=
veurs DHCP appropri=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6571" data-end=3D"6810" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6574" data-end=3D"6810" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
574" data-end=3D"6635">Ajouter des serveurs DHCP suppl=C3=A9mentaires pour =
redondance</strong> :
Vous pouvez configurer un <strong data-start=3D"6667" data-end=3D"6694">ser=
veur DHCP secondaire</strong> pour chaque site afin de garantir la disponib=
ilit=C3=A9 du service DHCP m=C3=AAme en cas de d=C3=A9faillance du serveur =
principal.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"6812" data-end=3D"6878" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6816" data-end=3D"6878">c. Configurer le Failover DHCP pour la Haute Dispon=
ibilit=C3=A9</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"6879" data-end=3D"7530">
<li data-start=3D"6879" data-end=3D"7331" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6882" data-end=3D"7066" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
882" data-end=3D"6910">Activer le Failover DHCP</strong> :
Dans un environnement multi-sites, la configuration de la r=C3=A9plication =
et du failover est essentielle pour garantir la disponibilit=C3=A9 des serv=
ices DHCP.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7074" data-end=3D"7331">
<li data-start=3D"7074" data-end=3D"7174" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7076" data-end=3D"7174" class=3D"">Dans <strong data-start=
=3D"7081" data-end=3D"7102">Gestionnaire DHCP</strong>, faites un clic droi=
t sur le serveur DHCP &gt; <strong data-start=3D"7147" data-end=3D"7173">Co=
nfigurer le failover</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7178" data-end=3D"7331" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7180" data-end=3D"7331" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez les s=
erveurs DHCP partenaires et d=C3=A9finissez un mode <strong data-start=3D"7=
245" data-end=3D"7261">Actif/Passif</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"7265"=
 data-end=3D"7280">Actif/Actif</strong> en fonction de la strat=C3=A9gie de=
 votre organisation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7333" data-end=3D"7530" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7336" data-end=3D"7366" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
336" data-end=3D"7364">V=C3=A9rification du Failover</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7370" data-end=3D"7478">
<li data-start=3D"7370" data-end=3D"7478" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7372" data-end=3D"7478" class=3D"">Sur chaque serveur DHCP=
, v=C3=A9rifiez la configuration du <strong data-start=3D"7426" data-end=3D=
"7452">partenaire de failover</strong> en utilisant PowerShell :</p>
</li>
</ul>
<pre class=3D"!overflow-visible" data-start=3D"7482" data-end=3D"7530"><div=
