<h2 data-start=3D"7537" data-end=3D"7599" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7540" data-end=3D"7599">4. Surveillance et Maintenance des Services DNS et =
DHCP</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7601" data-end=3D"7639" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7605" data-end=3D"7639">a. Surveillance du Serveur DNS</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"7640" data-end=3D"7918">
<li data-start=3D"7640" data-end=3D"7760" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7643" data-end=3D"7760" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
643" data-end=3D"7680">V=C3=A9rification de la r=C3=A9solution DNS</strong>=
 : Utilisez les commandes <code data-start=3D"7706" data-end=3D"7716">nsloo=
kup</code> et <code data-start=3D"7720" data-end=3D"7725">dig</code> pour t=
ester la r=C3=A9solution de noms.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7761" data-end=3D"7918" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7764" data-end=3D"7918" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
764" data-end=3D"7780">Journaux DNS</strong> : Surveillez les journaux d'=
=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements DNS via l'outil <strong data-start=3D"7836" data-end=
=3D"7864">Visualiseur d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements</strong> pour d=C3=A9tecter de=
s erreurs dans la r=C3=A9solution de noms.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"7920" data-end=3D"7959" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7924" data-end=3D"7959">b. Surveillance du Serveur DHCP</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"7960" data-end=3D"8230">
<li data-start=3D"7960" data-end=3D"8100" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7963" data-end=3D"8100" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
963" data-end=3D"7980">Journaux DHCP</strong> : Surveillez les <strong data=
-start=3D"7998" data-end=3D"8028">journaux d=E2=80=99=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements D=
HCP</strong> pour d=C3=A9tecter toute erreur ou panne dans l=E2=80=99attrib=
ution des adresses IP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8101" data-end=3D"8230" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8104" data-end=3D"8230" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
104" data-end=3D"8128">Examen des baux DHCP</strong> : Utilisez le <strong =
data-start=3D"8143" data-end=3D"8164">Gestionnaire DHCP</strong> pour v=C3=
=A9rifier les baux DHCP actifs et les r=C3=A9soudre si n=C3=A9cessaire.</p>
</li>
</ol>
