<hr data-start=3D"1347" data-end=3D"1350" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1352" data-end=3D"1408" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1355" data-end=3D"1408">1. Introduction aux Profils Sans Fil sous Windows</=
strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1410" data-end=3D"1454" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1414" data-end=3D"1454">a. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce qu=E2=80=99un Profil Sans Fil =
?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1455" data-end=3D"1589" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"1458" data-end=3D"1477">profil sans fil</strong> est un ensemble de par=
am=C3=A8tres de configuration associ=C3=A9s =C3=A0 un r=C3=A9seau Wi-Fi sp=
=C3=A9cifique. Ces param=C3=A8tres incluent :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1590" data-end=3D"1838">
<li data-start=3D"1590" data-end=3D"1620" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1592" data-end=3D"1620" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"1595" data-end=3D"1612">nom du r=C3=A9seau</strong> (SSID).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1621" data-end=3D"1687" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1623" data-end=3D"1687" class=3D"">La m=C3=A9thode de <str=
ong data-start=3D"1637" data-end=3D"1653">s=C3=A9curisation</strong> utilis=
=C3=A9e (WPA2, WPA3, WEP, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1688" data-end=3D"1739" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1690" data-end=3D"1739" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"1693" data-end=3D"1712">cl=C3=A9 de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong> ou mot =
de passe du r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1740" data-end=3D"1835" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1742" data-end=3D"1835" class=3D"">Des informations suppl=
=C3=A9mentaires telles que le type de <strong data-start=3D"1797" data-end=
=3D"1810">connexion</strong> (adhoc, infrastructure).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1839" data-end=3D"1985" class=3D"">Windows permet de stock=
er plusieurs profils sans fil, ce qui facilite la gestion de multiples conn=
exions sans fil dans un environnement dynamique.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1987" data-end=3D"2036" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1991" data-end=3D"2036">b. Comment Windows G=C3=A8re les Profils Wi-Fi</str=
ong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2037" data-end=3D"2314" class=3D"">Sous Windows, chaque fo=
is qu'une connexion =C3=A0 un r=C3=A9seau sans fil est effectu=C3=A9e, un <=
strong data-start=3D"2119" data-end=3D"2148">profil de r=C3=A9seau sans fil=
</strong> est cr=C3=A9=C3=A9 et enregistr=C3=A9 dans l'ordinateur. Windows =
peut automatiquement se reconnecter =C3=A0 ce r=C3=A9seau chaque fois qu'il=
 devient disponible, tant que le profil est actif.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2316" data-end=3D"2488" class=3D"">Les profils Wi-Fi sont =
g=C3=A9r=C3=A9s via <strong data-start=3D"2349" data-end=3D"2395">l'outil d=
e gestion des connexions sans fil</strong> dans le panneau de configuration=
 ou en ligne de commande =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99aide de l=E2=80=99utilitaire <str=
ong data-start=3D"2478" data-end=3D"2487">netsh</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2490" data-end=3D"2493" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2495" data-end=3D"2546" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2498" data-end=3D"2546">2. Gestion des Profils Sans Fil sous Windows</stron=
g></h2>
