<li data-start=3D"4211" data-end=3D"4325" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4214" data-end=3D"4325" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4226" data-end=3D"4237">Ajouter</strong> et entrez les informati=
ons requises (nom du r=C3=A9seau, type de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, cl=C3=A9 de s=
=C3=A9curit=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4326" data-end=3D"4378" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4329" data-end=3D"4378" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4341" data-end=3D"4356">Enregistrer</strong> pour cr=C3=A9er le =
profil.</p>
</li>
</ol>
