<hr data-start=3D"4741" data-end=3D"4744" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4746" data-end=3D"4805" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4749" data-end=3D"4805">3. S=C3=A9curisation des Connexions Sans Fil sous W=
indows</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4807" data-end=3D"4848" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4811" data-end=3D"4848">a. S=C3=A9curisation avec WPA2 et WPA3</strong></h3=
>
<p data-start=3D"4849" data-end=3D"5066" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"4852" data-end=3D"4892">s=C3=A9curisation des connexions sans fil</stro=
ng> est l'un des aspects les plus importants de la gestion des r=C3=A9seaux=
 sans fil. Les protocoles <strong data-start=3D"4985" data-end=3D"4993">WPA=
2</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"4997" data-end=3D"5005">WPA3</strong> s=
ont les normes de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 modernes pour les r=C3=A9seaux Wi-Fi.<=
/p>
<ol data-start=3D"5068" data-end=3D"5611">
<li data-start=3D"5068" data-end=3D"5285" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5071" data-end=3D"5285" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
071" data-end=3D"5106">WPA2 (Wi-Fi Protected Access 2)</strong> est un prot=
ocole de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 robuste qui utilise un chiffrement <strong data=
-start=3D"5171" data-end=3D"5178">AES</strong> (Advanced Encryption Standar=
d). Il est actuellement largement utilis=C3=A9 pour s=C3=A9curiser les r=C3=
=A9seaux sans fil.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5290" data-end=3D"5611" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5293" data-end=3D"5418" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
293" data-end=3D"5301">WPA3</strong> est la derni=C3=A8re norme de s=C3=A9c=
urit=C3=A9 qui remplace WPA2. Il offre des fonctionnalit=C3=A9s de s=C3=A9c=
urit=C3=A9 avanc=C3=A9es, telles que :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5422" data-end=3D"5611">
<li data-start=3D"5422" data-end=3D"5514" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5424" data-end=3D"5514" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
424" data-end=3D"5457">Authentification plus robuste</strong> avec le <stro=
ng data-start=3D"5466" data-end=3D"5513">Simultaneous Authentication of Equ=
als (SAE)</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5518" data-end=3D"5611" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5520" data-end=3D"5611" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
520" data-end=3D"5545">Chiffrement plus fort</strong> avec une meilleure pr=
otection contre les attaques de force brute.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"5613" data-end=3D"5663" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5618" data-end=3D"5663">Activer WPA2 ou WPA3 dans un r=C3=A9seau Wi-Fi</str=
ong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5664" data-end=3D"6052">
<li data-start=3D"5664" data-end=3D"5830" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5666" data-end=3D"5830" class=3D"">Sur votre <strong data-=
start=3D"5676" data-end=3D"5687">routeur</strong>, vous devez activer <stro=
ng data-start=3D"5708" data-end=3D"5716">WPA2</strong> ou <strong data-star=
t=3D"5720" data-end=3D"5728">WPA3</strong> via l'interface de gestion (g=C3=
=A9n=C3=A9ralement accessible via un navigateur web =C3=A0 l'adresse <code =
data-start=3D"5815" data-end=3D"5828">192.168.1.1</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5831" data-end=3D"6052" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5833" data-end=3D"6052" class=3D"">Sous Windows, assurez-v=
ous de connecter votre PC =C3=A0 un r=C3=A9seau Wi-Fi qui utilise WPA2 ou W=
PA3 comme m=C3=A9thode de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9. Cela peut =C3=AAtre v=C3=A9ri=
fi=C3=A9 via le <strong data-start=3D"5982" data-end=3D"6051">Panneau de co=
nfiguration &gt; R=C3=A9seau et Internet &gt; Connexions r=C3=A9seau</stron=
g>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6054" data-end=3D"6161" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6058" data-end=3D"6161">b. Utilisation de la S=C3=A9curisation des Profils =
Wi-Fi avec 802.1X (WPA2-Enterprise / WPA3-Enterprise)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6162" data-end=3D"6391" class=3D"">Pour les entreprises ou=
 les environnements n=C3=A9cessitant une s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 accrue, l=E2=80=
=99authentification <strong data-start=3D"6257" data-end=3D"6267">802.1X</s=
trong> est recommand=C3=A9e. Ce m=C3=A9canisme permet d'utiliser des <stron=
g data-start=3D"6320" data-end=3D"6349">certificats ou des tokens</strong> =
pour l'authentification des utilisateurs.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6393" data-end=3D"6669">
<li data-start=3D"6393" data-end=3D"6476" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6396" data-end=3D"6476" class=3D"">Activez <strong data-st=
art=3D"6404" data-end=3D"6423">WPA2-Enterprise</strong> ou <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"6427" data-end=3D"6446">WPA3-Enterprise</strong> sur votre <strong da=
ta-start=3D"6457" data-end=3D"6475">serveur RADIUS</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6477" data-end=3D"6669" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6480" data-end=3D"6669" class=3D"">Configurez votre profil=
 sans fil pour utiliser <strong data-start=3D"6527" data-end=3D"6537">802.1=
X</strong> et demandez aux utilisateurs de s'authentifier =C3=A0 l'aide de =
<strong data-start=3D"6597" data-end=3D"6623">certificats num=C3=A9riques</=
strong> ou d'une <strong data-start=3D"6633" data-end=3D"6668">authentifica=
tion multi-facteurs</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"6671" data-end=3D"6730" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6676" data-end=3D"6730">Configurer l'authentification 802.1X sur Windows :<=
/strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"6731" data-end=3D"7064">
<li data-start=3D"6731" data-end=3D"6822" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6734" data-end=3D"6822" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"6745" data-end=3D"6821">Panneau de configuration &gt; R=C3=A9seau=
 et Internet &gt; Centre R=C3=A9seau et partage</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6823" data-end=3D"6901" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6826" data-end=3D"6901" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"6838" data-end=3D"6868">G=C3=A9rer les r=C3=A9seaux sans fil</st=
rong>, puis sur votre profil sans fil.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6902" data-end=3D"7064" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6905" data-end=3D"7064" class=3D"">Sous l=E2=80=99onglet <=
strong data-start=3D"6919" data-end=3D"6931">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong>, s=
=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"6946" data-end=3D"6965">WPA2-Enterpr=
ise</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"6969" data-end=3D"6988">WPA3-Enterpri=
se</strong> comme m=C3=A9thode de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 et configurez <strong =
data-start=3D"7029" data-end=3D"7039">802.1X</strong> pour l=E2=80=99authen=
tification.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"7066" data-end=3D"7069" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7071" data-end=3D"7136" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7074" data-end=3D"7136">4. G=C3=A9rer les Connexions Multiples et Optimiser=
 la S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7138" data-end=3D"7182" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7142" data-end=3D"7182">a. Priorisation des Connexions Wi-Fi</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7183" data-end=3D"7355" class=3D"">Dans un environnement o=
=C3=B9 plusieurs r=C3=A9seaux sans fil sont disponibles, il est possible de=
 prioriser certaines connexions par rapport =C3=A0 d'autres. Pour ce faire,=
 vous pouvez :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"7356" data-end=3D"7552">
<li data-start=3D"7356" data-end=3D"7426" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7359" data-end=3D"7426" class=3D"">Acc=C3=A9der aux <stron=
g data-start=3D"7371" data-end=3D"7391">Param=C3=A8tres Wi-Fi</strong> dans=
 <strong data-start=3D"7397" data-end=3D"7425">Panneau de configuration</st=
rong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7427" data-end=3D"7552" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7430" data-end=3D"7552" class=3D"">Dans <strong data-start=
=3D"7435" data-end=3D"7465">G=C3=A9rer les r=C3=A9seaux sans fil</strong>, =
faites un clic droit sur le profil souhait=C3=A9 et choisissez <strong data=
-start=3D"7525" data-end=3D"7551">D=C3=A9finir comme priorit=C3=A9</strong>=
.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"7554" data-end=3D"7604" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7558" data-end=3D"7604">b. Optimisation de la S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des Profil=
s</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"7605" data-end=3D"7896">
<li data-start=3D"7605" data-end=3D"7760" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7608" data-end=3D"7760" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
608" data-end=3D"7643">Supprimer les profils obsol=C3=A8tes</strong> : Pour=
 =C3=A9viter les connexions non s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9es, supprimez tous les pr=
ofils de r=C3=A9seaux sans fil inutilis=C3=A9s ou obsol=C3=A8tes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7761" data-end=3D"7896" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7764" data-end=3D"7896" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
764" data-end=3D"7802">Mettre =C3=A0 jour les cl=C3=A9s de s=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9</strong> : Veillez =C3=A0 changer r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8rement les mots de p=
asse et =C3=A0 les distribuer de mani=C3=A8re s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"7898" data-end=3D"7941" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7902" data-end=3D"7941">c. Gestion des Connexions Multiples</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7942" data-end=3D"8134" class=3D"">Les utilisateurs peuven=
t avoir plusieurs profils Wi-Fi pour diff=C3=A9rents r=C3=A9seaux (domestiq=
ues, professionnels, publics). Windows g=C3=A8re la priorit=C3=A9 des conne=
xions en fonction des r=C3=A9seaux d=C3=A9tect=C3=A9s.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8136" data-end=3D"8331">
<li data-start=3D"8136" data-end=3D"8331" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8138" data-end=3D"8331" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
138" data-end=3D"8180">D=C3=A9sactiver les connexions automatiques</strong>=
 : Si vous ne voulez pas que Windows se connecte automatiquement =C3=A0 un =
r=C3=A9seau Wi-Fi non s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9, d=C3=A9sactivez cette option dans=
 les param=C3=A8tres du profil.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8333" data-end=3D"8336" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8338" data-end=3D"8391" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8341" data-end=3D"8391">5. D=C3=A9pannage des Connexions Wi-Fi sous Windows=
</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"8393" data-end=3D"8444" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8397" data-end=3D"8444">a. Utiliser l'Outil de D=C3=A9pannage de Windows</s=
trong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8445" data-end=3D"8554" class=3D"">Si vous rencontrez des =
probl=C3=A8mes avec vos connexions sans fil, l=E2=80=99outil de d=C3=A9pann=
age int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9 peut vous aider :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"8555" data-end=3D"8743">
<li data-start=3D"8555" data-end=3D"8670" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8558" data-end=3D"8670" class=3D"">Acc=C3=A9dez =C3=A0 <st=
rong data-start=3D"8568" data-end=3D"8669">Param=C3=A8tres &gt; Mise =C3=A0=
 jour et s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 &gt; D=C3=A9pannage &gt; R=C3=A9soudre les prob=
l=C3=A8mes de connexion =C3=A0 Internet</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8671" data-end=3D"8743" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8674" data-end=3D"8743" class=3D"">Suivez les instructions=
 pour diagnostiquer et corriger les probl=C3=A8mes.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"8745" data-end=3D"8779" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8749" data-end=3D"8779">b. Commandes de Diagnostic</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"8780" data-end=3D"9092">
<li data-start=3D"8780" data-end=3D"8919" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8783" data-end=3D"8882" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
783" data-end=3D"8815">V=C3=A9rifier la connexion r=C3=A9seau</strong> : Ut=
ilisez la commande <code data-start=3D"8839" data-end=3D"8845">ping</code> =
pour tester la connectivit=C3=A9 r=C3=A9seau :</p>
<pre class=3D"!overflow-visible" data-start=3D"8886" data-end=3D"8919"><div=
 class=3D"contain-inline-size rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-token-border=
-medium relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class=3D"flex items=
-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-betwe=
en h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondar=
y select-none rounded-t-[5px]">bash</div><div class=3D"sticky top-9"><div c=
lass=3D"absolute bottom-0 right-0 flex h-9 items-center pr-2"><div class=3D=
