ues</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6935" data-end=3D"6975" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6939" data-end=3D"6975">a. Probl=C3=A8mes de port=C3=A9e du signal</strong>=
</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"6976" data-end=3D"7442">
<li data-start=3D"6976" data-end=3D"7209" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6979" data-end=3D"7024" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
979" data-end=3D"7022">D=C3=A9placer l=E2=80=99appareil ou le point d=E2=80=
=99acc=C3=A8s</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7028" data-end=3D"7209">
<li data-start=3D"7028" data-end=3D"7209" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7030" data-end=3D"7209" class=3D"">Si le signal est faible=
 ou intermittente, essayez de rapprocher votre appareil du point d=E2=80=99=
acc=C3=A8s ou du routeur. Vous pouvez =C3=A9galement ajuster l'orientation =
des antennes du routeur.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7211" data-end=3D"7442" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7214" data-end=3D"7245" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
214" data-end=3D"7243">R=C3=A9duire les interf=C3=A9rences</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7249" data-end=3D"7442">
<li data-start=3D"7249" data-end=3D"7442" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7251" data-end=3D"7442" class=3D"">=C3=89vitez d=E2=80=99u=
tiliser des appareils =C3=A9lectroniques qui peuvent causer des interf=C3=
=A9rences, comme les <strong data-start=3D"7345" data-end=3D"7360">micro-on=
des</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"7362" data-end=3D"7385">t=C3=A9l=C3=A9p=
hones sans fil</strong> et autres appareils qui utilisent des bandes simila=
ires.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"7444" data-end=3D"7496" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7448" data-end=3D"7496">b. Probl=C3=A8mes de congestion du canal sans fil</=
strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"7497" data-end=3D"7931">
<li data-start=3D"7497" data-end=3D"7753" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7500" data-end=3D"7528" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
500" data-end=3D"7526">Changer de canal Wi-Fi</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7532" data-end=3D"7753">
<li data-start=3D"7532" data-end=3D"7753" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7534" data-end=3D"7753" class=3D"">Si vous avez beaucoup d=
=E2=80=99appareils connect=C3=A9s au m=C3=AAme canal Wi-Fi, cela peut entra=
=C3=AEner une congestion. Modifiez le canal sur votre routeur pour en chois=
ir un moins encombr=C3=A9 (g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement 1, 6 ou 11 pour la bande =
2,4 GHz).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7755" data-end=3D"7931" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7758" data-end=3D"7787" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
758" data-end=3D"7785">Utiliser la bande 5 GHz</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7791" data-end=3D"7931">
<li data-start=3D"7791" data-end=3D"7931" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7793" data-end=3D"7931" class=3D"">Si votre appareil et vo=
tre routeur le supportent, passez =C3=A0 la <strong data-start=3D"7855" dat=
a-end=3D"7870">bande 5 GHz</strong> qui est moins encombr=C3=A9e et permet =
des vitesses plus rapides.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"7933" data-end=3D"7987" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7937" data-end=3D"7987">c. Probl=C3=A8mes de performance du r=C3=A9seau san=
s fil</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"7988" data-end=3D"8433">
<li data-start=3D"7988" data-end=3D"8201" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7991" data-end=3D"8038" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
991" data-end=3D"8036">Red=C3=A9marrer le point d'acc=C3=A8s ou le routeur<=
/strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8042" data-end=3D"8201">
<li data-start=3D"8042" data-end=3D"8201" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8044" data-end=3D"8201" class=3D"">Si la connexion est len=
te, essayez de red=C3=A9marrer le point d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s ou le routeur.=
 Cela peut r=C3=A9soudre des probl=C3=A8mes de congestion ou de gestion des=
 connexions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8203" data-end=3D"8433" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8206" data-end=3D"8265" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
206" data-end=3D"8263">V=C3=A9rifier la bande passante et les appareils con=
nect=C3=A9s</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8269" data-end=3D"8433">
<li data-start=3D"8269" data-end=3D"8433" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8271" data-end=3D"8433" class=3D"">Si de nombreux appareil=
s sont connect=C3=A9s au r=C3=A9seau, cela peut affecter la performance. Es=
sayez de d=C3=A9connecter certains appareils pour lib=C3=A9rer de la bande =
passante.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
