<hr data-start=3D"7530" data-end=3D"7533" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7535" data-end=3D"7587" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7538" data-end=3D"7587">3. Analyser les Logs R=C3=A9seau avec Event Viewer<=
/strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"7589" data-end=3D"7855" class=3D"">En plus des outils Perf=
ormance Monitor et Netsh, <strong data-start=3D"7638" data-end=3D"7654">Eve=
nt Viewer</strong> est un autre outil essentiel pour effectuer des audits d=
e r=C3=A9seau sous Windows. Il permet de suivre les =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements et=
 les erreurs r=C3=A9seau, notamment celles li=C3=A9es aux interfaces r=C3=
=A9seau et aux protocoles.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"7857" data-end=3D"7888" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7862" data-end=3D"7888">Acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 Event Viewer</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"7889" data-end=3D"8151">
<li data-start=3D"7889" data-end=3D"8000" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7892" data-end=3D"8000" class=3D"">Tapez <strong data-star=
t=3D"7898" data-end=3D"7914">eventvwr.msc</strong> dans l'<strong data-star=
t=3D"7922" data-end=3D"7944">Invite de commande</strong> ou <strong data-st=
art=3D"7948" data-end=3D"7960">Ex=C3=A9cuter</strong> (Windows + R) pour ou=
vrir Event Viewer.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8002" data-end=3D"8151" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8005" data-end=3D"8151" class=3D"">Sous <strong data-start=
=3D"8010" data-end=3D"8040">Journaux Windows &gt; Syst=C3=A8me</strong>, vo=
us trouverez des =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements relatifs aux probl=C3=A8mes mat=C3=A9=
riels, aux erreurs r=C3=A9seau et aux pannes d'interface.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"8153" data-end=3D"8156" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8158" data-end=3D"8243" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8161" data-end=3D"8243">4. Utilisation Conjointe de Performance Monitor et =
Netsh pour un Audit Complet</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"8245" data-end=3D"8387" class=3D"">Les administrateurs peu=
vent combiner l=E2=80=99utilisation de Performance Monitor et de Netsh pour=
 effectuer un audit r=C3=A9seau approfondi. Par exemple :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8389" data-end=3D"8703">
<li data-start=3D"8389" data-end=3D"8543" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8391" data-end=3D"8543" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
391" data-end=3D"8414">Performance Monitor</strong> peut =C3=AAtre utilis=
=C3=A9 pour surveiller les performances en temps r=C3=A9el, identifier les =
goulets d'=C3=A9tranglement et recevoir des alertes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8544" data-end=3D"8703" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8546" data-end=3D"8703" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
546" data-end=3D"8555">Netsh</strong> permet de v=C3=A9rifier les configura=
tions r=C3=A9seau d=C3=A9taill=C3=A9es, ex=C3=A9cuter des tests de connecti=
vit=C3=A9, et afficher les erreurs ou les statistiques de r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8705" data-end=3D"8757" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8709" data-end=3D"8755">Exemple de sc=C3=A9nario d=E2=80=99audit r=C3=A9sea=
u complet</strong> :</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"8759" data-end=3D"9299">
<li data-start=3D"8759" data-end=3D"8865" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8762" data-end=3D"8865" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"8769" data-end=3D"8792">Performance Monitor</strong> et ajoutez les c=
ompteurs <strong data-start=3D"8818" data-end=3D"8840">Bytes Received/sec</=
strong> et <strong data-start=3D"8844" data-end=3D"8864">Packets Sent/sec</=
strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8866" data-end=3D"8991" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8869" data-end=3D"8991" class=3D"">Utilisez <strong data-s=
tart=3D"8878" data-end=3D"8887">Netsh</strong> pour afficher la configurati=
on IP et v=C3=A9rifier les serveurs DNS avec <strong data-start=3D"8956" da=
ta-end=3D"8990">netsh interface ip show config</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8992" data-end=3D"9166" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8995" data-end=3D"9166" class=3D"">Ex=C3=A9cutez un test d=
e connectivit=C3=A9 avec <strong data-start=3D"9033" data-end=3D"9041">ping=
</strong> et consultez <strong data-start=3D"9055" data-end=3D"9071">Event =
Viewer</strong> pour v=C3=A9rifier si des erreurs ou des avertissements son=
t enregistr=C3=A9s dans les journaux syst=C3=A8me.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9167" data-end=3D"9299" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9170" data-end=3D"9299" class=3D"">Surveillez les alertes =
dans <strong data-start=3D"9198" data-end=3D"9221">Performance Monitor</str=
ong> si des valeurs d=C3=A9passent des seuils d=C3=A9finis, indiquant un pr=
obl=C3=A8me potentiel.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"9301" data-end=3D"9304" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9306" data-end=3D"9326" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
