467" data-end=3D"5503">V=C3=A9rification de la configuration</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5509" data-end=3D"5648">
<li data-start=3D"5509" data-end=3D"5648" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5511" data-end=3D"5648" class=3D"">Assurez-vous que les =
=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements sont correctement envoy=C3=A9s vers le serveur collect=
or en v=C3=A9rifiant les <strong data-start=3D"5612" data-end=3D"5627">Abon=
nements</strong> dans l'Event Viewer.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5650" data-end=3D"5719" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5654" data-end=3D"5719">c. Configurer Syslog pour la Collecte de Journaux (=
optionnel)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5721" data-end=3D"6004" class=3D"">Si votre SIEM utilise l=
e <strong data-start=3D"5746" data-end=3D"5756">Syslog</strong> pour la col=
lecte des journaux, vous pouvez utiliser des outils tiers pour envoyer des =
=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements Windows vers Syslog. Des outils comme <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5892" data-end=3D"5901">NXLog</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"5905"=
 data-end=3D"5926">Snare for Windows</strong> peuvent =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=
=A9s pour convertir les =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements Windows en format Syslog.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"6006" data-end=3D"6044" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6011" data-end=3D"6044">=C3=89tapes pour installer NXLog :</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"6046" data-end=3D"6662">
<li data-start=3D"6046" data-end=3D"6230" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6049" data-end=3D"6107" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
049" data-end=3D"6083">T=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargez et installez NXLog</strong> su=
r le serveur Windows.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6111" data-end=3D"6230">
<li data-start=3D"6111" data-end=3D"6230" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6113" data-end=3D"6230" class=3D"">Rendez-vous sur le site=
 de NXLog (<a data-start=3D"6147" data-end=3D"6164" rel=3D"noopener" target=
=3D"_new" class=3D"" href=3D"https://nxlog.co/">https://nxlog.co/</a>) et t=
=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargez la version gratuite ou payante selon vos besoins.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6232" data-end=3D"6581" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6235" data-end=3D"6293" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
235" data-end=3D"6291">Configurer NXLog pour envoyer des =C3=A9v=C3=A9nemen=
ts au SIEM</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6297" data-end=3D"6581">
<li data-start=3D"6297" data-end=3D"6414" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6299" data-end=3D"6414" class=3D"">Modifiez le fichier de =
configuration de NXLog (<code data-start=3D"6346" data-end=3D"6358">nxlog.c=
onf</code>) pour indiquer la destination Syslog (adresse du SIEM).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6418" data-end=3D"6581" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6420" data-end=3D"6446" class=3D"">Exemple de configuratio=
n :</p>
