<li data-start=3D"3304" data-end=3D"3426" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3307" data-end=3D"3426" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
307" data-end=3D"3322">Gateway VPN</strong> : La <strong data-start=3D"3328=
" data-end=3D"3343">VPN Gateway</strong> Azure est requise pour =C3=A9tabli=
r la connexion VPN entre votre r=C3=A9seau local et Azure.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3428" data-end=3D"3431" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3433" data-end=3D"3511" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
