<li data-start=3D"3908" data-end=3D"3958" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3911" data-end=3D"3958" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3923" data-end=3D"3932">Cr=C3=A9er</strong> pour d=C3=A9ployer v=
otre VNet.</p>
