ce n=C3=A9cessaire pour =C3=A9tablir un tunnel VPN entre Azure et votre r=
=C3=A9seau local. Voici comment la configurer :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4158" data-end=3D"4627">
<li data-start=3D"4158" data-end=3D"4219" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4161" data-end=3D"4219" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
