<li data-start=3D"4220" data-end=3D"4276" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4223" data-end=3D"4276" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4236" data-end=3D"4247">Ajouter</strong> et cherchez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4260" data-end=3D"4275">VPN Gateway</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4277" data-end=3D"4353" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4280" data-end=3D"4353" class=3D"">Cr=C3=A9ez une <strong =
data-start=3D"4290" data-end=3D"4305">VPN Gateway</strong> et associez-la a=
u VNet que vous venez de cr=C3=A9er.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4354" data-end=3D"4450" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4357" data-end=3D"4450" class=3D"">Choisissez le type de g=
ateway : <strong data-start=3D"4389" data-end=3D"4404">Route-based</strong>=
 (pour une compatibilit=C3=A9 avec Windows Server).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4451" data-end=3D"4556" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4454" data-end=3D"4556" class=3D"">Configurez les param=C3=
=A8tres de la passerelle VPN et les informations de connexion (nom, r=C3=A9=
