<ul data-start=3D"5069" data-end=3D"5418">
<li data-start=3D"5069" data-end=3D"5219" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5071" data-end=3D"5219" class=3D"">Allez dans le <strong d=
ata-start=3D"5085" data-end=3D"5106">Gestionnaire RRAS</strong>, faites un =
clic droit sur le serveur et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"5160" =
data-end=3D"5218">Configurer et activer le routage et l'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 d=
istance</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5223" data-end=3D"5346" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5225" data-end=3D"5346" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"5238" data-end=3D"5245">VPN</strong> et configurez l=E2=80=
=99interface r=C3=A9seau (telles que l=E2=80=99interface Ethernet) pour acc=
epter les connexions VPN.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5350" data-end=3D"5418" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5352" data-end=3D"5418" class=3D"">Choisissez le mode <str=
ong data-start=3D"5371" data-end=3D"5382">Routage</strong> et le type de VP=
N <strong data-start=3D"5401" data-end=3D"5417">Site-to-Site</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5419" data-end=3D"5811" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5422" data-end=3D"5466" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
422" data-end=3D"5464">Configurer la connexion VPN avec Azure</strong> :</p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"5470" data-end=3D"5811">
<li data-start=3D"5470" data-end=3D"5619" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5472" data-end=3D"5619" class=3D"">Sur votre serveur Windo=
ws, sous <strong data-start=3D"5504" data-end=3D"5512">RRAS</strong>, confi=
gurez une connexion VPN =C3=A0 Azure en utilisant les informations de <stro=
ng data-start=3D"5584" data-end=3D"5599">VPN Gateway</strong> fournies par =
Azure.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5623" data-end=3D"5701" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5625" data-end=3D"5701" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"5638" data-end=3D"5652">L2TP/IPsec</strong> ou <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5656" data-end=3D"5665">IKEv2</strong> comme protocole de tunnel=
 s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5705" data-end=3D"5811" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5707" data-end=3D"5811" class=3D"">Entrez les d=C3=A9tails=
 du <strong data-start=3D"5729" data-end=3D"5748">pr=C3=A9-partag=C3=A9 key=
</strong> (PSK) fournis par Azure lors de la cr=C3=A9ation de la VPN Gatewa=
y.</p>
</li>
</ul>
