<h3 data-start=3D"4786" data-end=3D"4861" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4790" data-end=3D"4861">a. Services de stockage cloud : S=C3=A9curisation e=
t gestion des donn=C3=A9es</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4863" data-end=3D"5047" class=3D"">Un aspect cl=C3=A9 de l=
'int=C3=A9gration hybride est la gestion et la s=C3=A9curisation des <stron=
g data-start=3D"4940" data-end=3D"4951">donn=C3=A9es</strong> stock=C3=A9es=
