<h4 data-start=3D"6157" data-end=3D"6213" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6162" data-end=3D"6213">3. Gestion des sauvegardes et des restaurations</st=
rong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"6215" data-end=3D"6493" class=3D"">Utilisez <strong data-s=
tart=3D"6224" data-end=3D"6240">Azure Backup</strong> pour effectuer des sa=
