<p data-start=3D"9079" data-end=3D"9315" class=3D"">Une bonne gestion des s=
ervices cloud n=C3=A9cessite une surveillance constante. <strong data-start=
=3D"9154" data-end=3D"9171">Azure Monitor</strong> et <strong data-start=3D=
"9175" data-end=3D"9198">Azure Log Analytics</strong> vous permettent de co=
