our r=C3=A9soudre ce type de probl=C3=A8me.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5655" data-end=3D"5695" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5659" data-end=3D"5695">a. V=C3=A9rification des Serveurs DNS</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5697" data-end=3D"5755" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifiez si votre =
appareil utilise les bons serveurs DNS :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5756" data-end=3D"5973">
