<hr data-start=3D"1321" data-end=3D"1324" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1326" data-end=3D"1385" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1329" data-end=3D"1385">2. Diagnostiquer les Probl=C3=A8mes de Performance =
R=C3=A9seau</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1387" data-end=3D"1455" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1391" data-end=3D"1455">a. V=C3=A9rification des Performances de Base avec =
"Task Manager"</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1457" data-end=3D"1574" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"1460" data-end=3D"1487">Gestionnaire des t=C3=A2ches</strong> de Window=
s peut vous donner un aper=C3=A7u rapide des performances r=C3=A9seau de vo=
tre machine.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"1576" data-end=3D"1593" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1581" data-end=3D"1593">=C3=89tapes :</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"1594" data-end=3D"1937">
<li data-start=3D"1594" data-end=3D"1690" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1597" data-end=3D"1690" class=3D"">Faites un <strong data-=
start=3D"1607" data-end=3D"1621">clic droit</strong> sur la barre des t=C3=
=A2ches et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"1662" data-end=3D"1689">=
Gestionnaire des t=C3=A2ches</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1691" data-end=3D"1759" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1694" data-end=3D"1759" class=3D"">Allez =C3=A0 l'onglet <=
strong data-start=3D"1711" data-end=3D"1726">Performance</strong> et clique=
z sur <strong data-start=3D"1742" data-end=3D"1758">Carte r=C3=A9seau</stro=
ng>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1760" data-end=3D"1937" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1763" data-end=3D"1782" class=3D"">Vous pourrez voir :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1786" data-end=3D"1937">
<li data-start=3D"1786" data-end=3D"1845" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1788" data-end=3D"1845" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"1791" data-end=3D"1812">taux de transfert</strong> (en Mbps) de votre c=
arte r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1849" data-end=3D"1898" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1851" data-end=3D"1898" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"1854" data-end=3D"1876">taux d'utilisation</strong> de la bande passant=
e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1902" data-end=3D"1937" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1904" data-end=3D"1937" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"1908" data-end=3D"1936">paquets envoy=C3=A9s et re=C3=A7us</strong>.</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"1939" data-end=3D"2094" class=3D"">Cela peut vous donner u=
ne premi=C3=A8re indication si la bande passante est satur=C3=A9e ou si un =
p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9rique sp=C3=A9cifique consomme une grande partie de la con=
nexion.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2096" data-end=3D"2148" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2100" data-end=3D"2148">b. V=C3=A9rification avec "Task Manager" - R=C3=A9s=
eau</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2150" data-end=3D"2476" class=3D"">Dans l'onglet <strong d=
ata-start=3D"2164" data-end=3D"2179">Performance</strong> du <strong data-s=
tart=3D"2183" data-end=3D"2210">Gestionnaire des t=C3=A2ches</strong>, vous=
 pouvez observer en temps r=C3=A9el les <strong data-start=3D"2251" data-en=
d=3D"2262">paquets</strong> et la <strong data-start=3D"2269" data-end=3D"2=
280">latence</strong> r=C3=A9seau. Si vous constatez une forte utilisation =
du r=C3=A9seau, cela peut signifier que des processus sur votre machine ou =
d'autres p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9riques connect=C3=A9s sur le r=C3=A9seau sollicit=
ent la bande passante.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2478" data-end=3D"2481" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2483" data-end=3D"2560" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2486" data-end=3D"2560">3. Utilisation des Outils de Commande pour Diagnost=
iquer les Probl=C3=A8mes</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2562" data-end=3D"2610" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2566" data-end=3D"2610">a. Ping pour Tester la Latence du R=C3=A9seau</stro=
ng></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2612" data-end=3D"2712" class=3D"">L'outil <strong data-st=
art=3D"2620" data-end=3D"2628">ping</strong> permet de tester la latence en=
tre votre machine et une autre machine sur le r=C3=A9seau.</p>
