<p data-start=3D"2847" data-end=3D"2877" class=3D"">Cela vous permet de v=
=C3=A9rifier :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2878" data-end=3D"3022">
<li data-start=3D"2878" data-end=3D"2982" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2880" data-end=3D"2982" class=3D"">Si vous pouvez atteindr=
e votre <strong data-start=3D"2911" data-end=3D"2925">passerelle</strong> (=
routeur) et les autres machines sur votre r=C3=A9seau local.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2983" data-end=3D"3022" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2985" data-end=3D"3022" class=3D"">Si le r=C3=A9seau inter=
net est accessible.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3024" data-end=3D"3081" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3028" data-end=3D"3081">b. Traceroute pour Localiser la Latence du R=C3=A9s=
