'=C3=A9coute.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3934" data-end=3D"4004" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3936" data-end=3D"4004" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
936" data-end=3D"3952"><code data-start=3D"3938" data-end=3D"3950">netstat =
-b</code></strong> : Affiche les processus ex=C3=A9cutant chaque connexion.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4005" data-end=3D"4095" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4007" data-end=3D"4095" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
007" data-end=3D"4023"><code data-start=3D"4009" data-end=3D"4021">netstat =
-e</code></strong> : Affiche des statistiques d=C3=A9taill=C3=A9es sur les =
paquets envoy=C3=A9s et re=C3=A7us.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4097" data-end=3D"4220" class=3D"">Cela peut vous aider =
=C3=A0 rep=C3=A9rer une application ou un service sp=C3=A9cifique qui utili=
