1437" data-end=3D"1481">a. Acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 l'Outil de D=C3=A9pannage R=
=C3=A9seau</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"1483" data-end=3D"1535" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1488" data-end=3D"1535">M=C3=A9thode 1 : Via le Panneau de Configuration</s=
trong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"1536" data-end=3D"1879">
<li data-start=3D"1536" data-end=3D"1687" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1539" data-end=3D"1687" class=3D"">Ouvrez le <strong data-=
start=3D"1549" data-end=3D"1577">Panneau de configuration</strong> en cliqu=
ant avec le bouton droit sur le bouton <strong data-start=3D"1625" data-end=
=3D"1637">D=C3=A9marrer</strong> et en s=C3=A9lectionnant <strong data-star=
t=3D"1658" data-end=3D"1686">Panneau de configuration</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1688" data-end=3D"1756" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1691" data-end=3D"1756" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"1702" data-end=3D"1724">R=C3=A9seau et Internet</strong> &gt; <st=
rong data-start=3D"1727" data-end=3D"1755">Centre R=C3=A9seau et partage</s=
trong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1757" data-end=3D"1830" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1760" data-end=3D"1830" class=3D"">Sur le c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 g=
auche de l'=C3=A9cran, cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"1803" data-end=3D"=
1829">R=C3=A9soudre les probl=C3=A8mes</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1831" data-end=3D"1879" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1834" data-end=3D"1879" class=3D"">Choisissez <strong data=
-start=3D"1845" data-end=3D"1878">D=C3=A9panner les probl=C3=A8mes r=C3=A9s=
eau</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"1881" data-end=3D"1931" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1886" data-end=3D"1931">M=C3=A9thode 2 : Via les Param=C3=A8tres de Windows=
</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"1932" data-end=3D"2210">
<li data-start=3D"1932" data-end=3D"1989" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1935" data-end=3D"1989" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1942" data-end=3D"1956">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> en appuyant sur <str=
ong data-start=3D"1973" data-end=3D"1988">Windows + I</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1990" data-end=3D"2027" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1993" data-end=3D"2027" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"2004" data-end=3D"2026">R=C3=A9seau et Internet</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2028" data-end=3D"2097" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2031" data-end=3D"2097" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"2043" data-end=3D"2051">=C3=89tat</strong>, puis sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"2062" data-end=3D"2074">D=C3=A9panner</strong> sous "=C3=89tat d=
u r=C3=A9seau".</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2098" data-end=3D"2210" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2101" data-end=3D"2210" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"2113" data-end=3D"2135">R=C3=A9seau et Internet</strong>, puis s=
=C3=A9lectionnez le type de probl=C3=A8me =C3=A0 r=C3=A9soudre (Wi-Fi, Ethe=
rnet, etc.).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"2212" data-end=3D"2261" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2216" data-end=3D"2261">b. Fonctionnement de l'Outil de D=C3=A9pannage</str=
ong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2262" data-end=3D"2367" class=3D"">L'outil d=C3=A9tecte au=
tomatiquement les probl=C3=A8mes courants et fournit des solutions. Une foi=
s l'outil lanc=C3=A9 :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"2368" data-end=3D"2669">
<li data-start=3D"2368" data-end=3D"2410" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2371" data-end=3D"2410" class=3D"">L'outil analyse votre c=
onnexion r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2411" data-end=3D"2452" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2414" data-end=3D"2452" class=3D"">Il affiche les r=C3=A9s=
ultats de l=E2=80=99analyse.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2453" data-end=3D"2669" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2456" data-end=3D"2534" class=3D"">Si un probl=C3=A8me est=
 d=C3=A9tect=C3=A9, l'outil propose des solutions automatis=C3=A9es comme :=
</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2538" data-end=3D"2669">
<li data-start=3D"2538" data-end=3D"2584" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2540" data-end=3D"2584" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
540" data-end=3D"2583">R=C3=A9initialisation de la connexion r=C3=A9seau</s=
trong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2588" data-end=3D"2617" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2590" data-end=3D"2617" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
590" data-end=3D"2616">Red=C3=A9marrage du routeur</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2621" data-end=3D"2669" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2623" data-end=3D"2669" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
623" data-end=3D"2668">V=C3=A9rification des c=C3=A2bles et des connexions<=
/strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"2671" data-end=3D"2811" class=3D"">L'outil peut aussi vous=
 fournir des informations d=C3=A9taill=C3=A9es sur les param=C3=A8tres r=C3=
=A9seau de votre syst=C3=A8me pour comprendre la cause du probl=C3=A8me.</p=
>
<hr data-start=3D"2813" data-end=3D"2816" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2818" data-end=3D"2878" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2821" data-end=3D"2878">3. Utilisation Avanc=C3=A9e de l'Outil de D=C3=A9pa=
nnage R=C3=A9seau</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2880" data-end=3D"3106" class=3D"">Bien que l=E2=80=99outi=
l de d=C3=A9pannage int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9 de Windows soit g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralemen=
t suffisant pour r=C3=A9soudre les probl=C3=A8mes courants, il existe des o=
ptions avanc=C3=A9es pour les utilisateurs qui souhaitent effectuer des dia=
gnostics plus approfondis.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3108" data-end=3D"3166" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3112" data-end=3D"3166">a. Ex=C3=A9cution de l=E2=80=99Outil en Ligne de Co=
mmande (CMD)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3167" data-end=3D"3311" class=3D"">L'outil de d=C3=A9panna=
ge r=C3=A9seau de Windows peut =C3=A9galement =C3=AAtre lanc=C3=A9 en utili=
sant l'invite de commande (CMD) pour effectuer des diagnostics avanc=C3=A9s=
.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3313" data-end=3D"3330" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3318" data-end=3D"3330">=C3=89tapes :</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"3331" data-end=3D"3731">
<li data-start=3D"3331" data-end=3D"3408" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3334" data-end=3D"3408" class=3D"">Appuyez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3346" data-end=3D"3361">Windows + R</strong> pour ouvrir la bo=
=C3=AEte de dialogue <strong data-start=3D"3395" data-end=3D"3407">Ex=C3=A9=
cuter</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3409" data-end=3D"3485" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3412" data-end=3D"3485" class=3D"">Tapez <strong data-star=
t=3D"3418" data-end=3D"3425">cmd</strong> et appuyez sur <strong data-start=
=3D"3441" data-end=3D"3451">Entr=C3=A9e</strong> pour ouvrir l=E2=80=99invi=
te de commande.</p>
</li>
