=C3=A9seau</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4710" data-end=3D"4836" class=3D"">Voici une liste des pro=
bl=C3=A8mes courants que l=E2=80=99outil de d=C3=A9pannage peut r=C3=A9soud=
re, ainsi que les =C3=A9tapes propos=C3=A9es pour chaque cas.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4838" data-end=3D"4885" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4842" data-end=3D"4885">a. Probl=C3=A8mes de Connectivit=C3=A9 =C3=A0 Inter=
net</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"4887" data-end=3D"4917" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4892" data-end=3D"4917">Probl=C3=A8mes Possibles :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4918" data-end=3D"4996">
<li data-start=3D"4918" data-end=3D"4963" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4920" data-end=3D"4963" class=3D"">Pas d'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0=
 Internet ou pas de connexion.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4964" data-end=3D"4996" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4966" data-end=3D"4996" class=3D"">Probl=C3=A8mes de confi=
guration IP.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"4998" data-end=3D"5028" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5003" data-end=3D"5028">Solution de l'Outil :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5029" data-end=3D"5374">
<li data-start=3D"5029" data-end=3D"5157" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5031" data-end=3D"5157" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
031" data-end=3D"5065">Red=C3=A9marrage de la carte r=C3=A9seau</strong> : =
Si la connexion r=C3=A9seau a =C3=A9chou=C3=A9, l'outil peut red=C3=A9marre=
r automatiquement la carte r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5158" data-end=3D"5374" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5160" data-end=3D"5374" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
160" data-end=3D"5198">V=C3=A9rification des configurations IP</strong> : S=
i le probl=C3=A8me est li=C3=A9 =C3=A0 un serveur DHCP ou une adresse IP ma=
l configur=C3=A9e, l'outil propose d'attribuer une nouvelle adresse IP ou d=
e configurer manuellement la carte r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5376" data-end=3D"5432" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5380" data-end=3D"5432">b. Probl=C3=A8mes de DNS (Serveur de Noms de Domain=
e)</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"5434" data-end=3D"5464" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5439" data-end=3D"5464">Probl=C3=A8mes Possibles :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5465" data-end=3D"5582">
<li data-start=3D"5465" data-end=3D"5543" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5467" data-end=3D"5543" class=3D"">Les pages web ne se cha=
rgent pas, ou des messages d=E2=80=99erreur DNS apparaissent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5544" data-end=3D"5582" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5546" data-end=3D"5582" class=3D"">Le serveur DNS n'est pa=
s accessible.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5584" data-end=3D"5614" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5589" data-end=3D"5614">Solution de l'Outil :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5615" data-end=3D"5902">
<li data-start=3D"5615" data-end=3D"5773" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5617" data-end=3D"5773" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
617" data-end=3D"5661">R=C3=A9initialisation de la configuration DNS</stron=
g> : L=E2=80=99outil peut r=C3=A9initialiser la configuration DNS pour r=C3=
=A9soudre les probl=C3=A8mes de r=C3=A9solution de noms de domaine.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5774" data-end=3D"5902" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5776" data-end=3D"5902" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
776" data-end=3D"5804">Test de la connexion DNS</strong> : V=C3=A9rificatio=
n de la connectivit=C3=A9 entre le client et le serveur DNS, et r=C3=A9para=
tion si n=C3=A9cessaire.</p>
</li>
</ul>
