<p data-start=3D"4079" data-end=3D"4154" class=3D"">Cela fournit les d=C3=
=A9tails sur les programmes associ=C3=A9s aux connexions r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4156" data-end=3D"4203" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4160" data-end=3D"4203">c. Utilisation de "Performance Monitor"</strong></h=
3>
<p data-start=3D"4205" data-end=3D"4367" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"4208" data-end=3D"4231">Performance Monitor</strong> (ou Moniteur de pe=
rformances) est un outil avanc=C3=A9 de Windows qui vous permet de surveill=
er les ressources syst=C3=A8me, y compris le r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4369" data-end=3D"4818">
<li data-start=3D"4369" data-end=3D"4480" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4372" data-end=3D"4480" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"4379" data-end=3D"4402">Performance Monitor</strong> en appuyant sur =
<strong data-start=3D"4419" data-end=3D"4434">Windows + R</strong>, tapez <=
strong data-start=3D"4442" data-end=3D"4453">perfmon</strong> et appuyez su=
r <strong data-start=3D"4469" data-end=3D"4479">Entr=C3=A9e</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4481" data-end=3D"4580" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4484" data-end=3D"4580" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"4495" data-end=3D"4522">Moniteur de Performance</strong> &gt; <st=
rong data-start=3D"4525" data-end=3D"4551">Collecteurs de donn=C3=A9es</str=
ong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"4554" data-end=3D"4579">Donn=C3=A9es en tem=
ps r=C3=A9el</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4581" data-end=3D"4704" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4584" data-end=3D"4704" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4596" data-end=3D"4621">Ajouter des compteurs</strong> et choisi=
ssez <strong data-start=3D"4636" data-end=3D"4656">Interface r=C3=A9seau</s=
trong> pour suivre l=E2=80=99utilisation de la bande passante.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4705" data-end=3D"4818" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4708" data-end=3D"4818" class=3D"">Ajoutez les compteurs p=
our surveiller la <strong data-start=3D"4749" data-end=3D"4767">bande passa=
nte</strong> envoy=C3=A9e et re=C3=A7ue, ainsi que la <strong data-start=3D=
"4799" data-end=3D"4817">latence r=C3=A9seau</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"4820" data-end=3D"4954" class=3D"">Cela vous permet de sui=
vre l'=C3=A9tat de votre connexion r=C3=A9seau en temps r=C3=A9el et d'iden=
tifier les tendances et les goulots d'=C3=A9tranglement.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4956" data-end=3D"4959" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4961" data-end=3D"5024" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4964" data-end=3D"5024">3. Optimisation de la Bande Passante R=C3=A9seau so=
us Windows</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5026" data-end=3D"5080" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5030" data-end=3D"5080">a. Optimiser les Param=C3=A8tres de la Carte R=C3=
=A9seau</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"5082" data-end=3D"5124" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5087" data-end=3D"5124">1. Mise =C3=A0 jour des pilotes r=C3=A9seau</strong=
></h4>
<p data-start=3D"5126" data-end=3D"5295" class=3D"">Des pilotes obsol=C3=A8=
tes peuvent ralentir la connexion r=C3=A9seau. Pour garantir des performanc=
es optimales, il est essentiel de mettre =C3=A0 jour les pilotes de vos car=
tes r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5297" data-end=3D"5700">
<li data-start=3D"5297" data-end=3D"5426" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5300" data-end=3D"5426" class=3D"">Ouvrez le <strong data-=
start=3D"5310" data-end=3D"5343">Gestionnaire de p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9riques</s=
trong> en appuyant sur <strong data-start=3D"5360" data-end=3D"5375">Window=
s + X</strong> et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"5392" data-end=3D=
"5425">Gestionnaire de p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9riques</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5427" data-end=3D"5562" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5430" data-end=3D"5562" class=3D"">D=C3=A9veloppez la sect=
ion <strong data-start=3D"5452" data-end=3D"5469">Cartes r=C3=A9seau</stron=
g>, faites un clic droit sur votre carte r=C3=A9seau, puis s=C3=A9lectionne=
z <strong data-start=3D"5534" data-end=3D"5561">Mettre =C3=A0 jour le pilot=
e</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5563" data-end=3D"5700" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5566" data-end=3D"5700" class=3D"">Suivez les instructions=
 pour rechercher automatiquement des mises =C3=A0 jour ou t=C3=A9l=C3=A9cha=
rgez les derniers pilotes sur le site du fabricant.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"5702" data-end=3D"5772" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5707" data-end=3D"5772">2. Configurer la carte r=C3=A9seau pour des perform=
ances maximales</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"5774" data-end=3D"6415">
<li data-start=3D"5774" data-end=3D"5868" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5777" data-end=3D"5868" class=3D"">Acc=C3=A9dez aux <stron=
g data-start=3D"5789" data-end=3D"5803">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong> de vo=
tre carte r=C3=A9seau dans le <strong data-start=3D"5834" data-end=3D"5867"=
>Gestionnaire de p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9riques</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5869" data-end=3D"5934" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5872" data-end=3D"5934" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5884" data-end=3D"5898">Configurer</strong> puis acc=C3=A9dez =
=C3=A0 l'onglet <strong data-start=3D"5923" data-end=3D"5933">Avanc=C3=A9</=
strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5935" data-end=3D"6415" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5938" data-end=3D"6004" class=3D"">Modifiez les param=C3=
=A8tres suivants pour am=C3=A9liorer les performances :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6008" data-end=3D"6415">
<li data-start=3D"6008" data-end=3D"6108" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6010" data-end=3D"6108" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
010" data-end=3D"6031">Vitesse et duplex</strong> : R=C3=A9glez la vitesse =
sur <strong data-start=3D"6056" data-end=3D"6069">1000 Mbps</strong> ou <st=
rong data-start=3D"6073" data-end=3D"6081">Auto</strong> pour une connexion=
 rapide.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6112" data-end=3D"6266" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6114" data-end=3D"6266" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
114" data-end=3D"6130">Jumbo Frames</strong> : Si votre r=C3=A9seau prend e=
n charge des trames Ethernet plus grandes, activez cette option pour am=C3=
=A9liorer l'efficacit=C3=A9 des transmissions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6270" data-end=3D"6415" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6272" data-end=3D"6415" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
272" data-end=3D"6316">R=C3=A9duire le nombre de paquets par seconde</stron=
g> : Activez cette option pour r=C3=A9duire la surcharge de la CPU et am=C3=
=A9liorer les performances globales.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"6417" data-end=3D"6485" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6421" data-end=3D"6485">b. Utiliser des outils de gestion de la bande passa=
nte (QoS)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6487" data-end=3D"6641" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"6491" data-end=3D"6533">strat=C3=A9gies de qualit=C3=A9 de service (QoS=
)</strong> permettent de donner la priorit=C3=A9 =C3=A0 certains types de t=
rafic sur le r=C3=A9seau pour optimiser la bande passante.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"6643" data-end=3D"6692" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6648" data-end=3D"6692">Activer QoS via les Strat=C3=A9gies de Groupe</stro=
ng></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"6693" data-end=3D"7110">
<li data-start=3D"6693" data-end=3D"6815" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6696" data-end=3D"6815" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"6703" data-end=3D"6732">GPO (Group Policy Editor)</strong> en tapant =
<strong data-start=3D"6743" data-end=3D"6757">gpedit.msc</strong> dans la b=
o=C3=AEte de dialogue <strong data-start=3D"6784" data-end=3D"6796">Ex=C3=
=A9cuter</strong> (<strong data-start=3D"6798" data-end=3D"6813">Windows + =
R</strong>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6816" data-end=3D"6915" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6819" data-end=3D"6915" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"6830" data-end=3D"6914">Configuration ordinateur &gt; Mod=C3=A8le=
s d'administration &gt; R=C3=A9seau &gt; Planification QoS</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6916" data-end=3D"7110" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6919" data-end=3D"7110" class=3D"">Activez <strong data-st=
art=3D"6927" data-end=3D"6988">Limiter la bande passante pour les applicati=
ons critiques</strong> et d=C3=A9finissez une priorit=C3=A9 plus =C3=A9lev=
=C3=A9e pour le trafic important (par exemple, VoIP ou applications de gest=
ion de r=C3=A9seau).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"7112" data-end=3D"7180" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7116" data-end=3D"7180">c. Limiter les applications consommatrices de bande=
 passante</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7182" data-end=3D"7372" class=3D"">Des applications comme =
les t=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargements en arri=C3=A8re-plan, le streaming vid=C3=A9o=
 ou les jeux en ligne peuvent monopoliser votre bande passante. Voici quelq=
ues =C3=A9tapes pour limiter leur impact :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"7374" data-end=3D"7724">
<li data-start=3D"7374" data-end=3D"7534" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7377" data-end=3D"7534" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
377" data-end=3D"7421">Fermer les applications non essentielles</strong> : =
Surveillez les applications qui utilisent la bande passante via le <strong =
data-start=3D"7491" data-end=3D"7518">Gestionnaire des t=C3=A2ches</strong>=
 ou <strong data-start=3D"7522" data-end=3D"7533">Netstat</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7535" data-end=3D"7724" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7538" data-end=3D"7724" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
538" data-end=3D"7584">Utiliser un gestionnaire de bande passante</strong> =
: Certaines applications comme <strong data-start=3D"7616" data-end=3D"7630=
">NetLimiter</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"7634" data-end=3D"7647">cFos=
Speed</strong> permettent de d=C3=A9finir des limites de bande passante pou=
r chaque application.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"7726" data-end=3D"7779" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7730" data-end=3D"7779">d. Optimiser la connectivit=C3=A9 sans fil (Wi-Fi)<=
/strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7781" data-end=3D"7892" class=3D"">Si vous utilisez une co=
nnexion Wi-Fi, des ajustements peuvent =C3=AAtre effectu=C3=A9s pour am=C3=
=A9liorer la bande passante :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"7894" data-end=3D"8418">
<li data-start=3D"7894" data-end=3D"8087" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7897" data-end=3D"8087" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
897" data-end=3D"7923">Changer de canal Wi-Fi</strong> : Utilisez des outil=
s comme <strong data-start=3D"7952" data-end=3D"7970">Wi-Fi Analyzer</stron=
g> pour scanner les canaux Wi-Fi disponibles et choisissez celui qui offre =
la meilleure performance sans interf=C3=A9rences.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8088" data-end=3D"8253" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8091" data-end=3D"8253" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
091" data-end=3D"8140">Placer votre routeur =C3=A0 un emplacement optimal</=
strong> : Assurez-vous que votre routeur est plac=C3=A9 dans un endroit cen=
tral et d=C3=A9gag=C3=A9 pour maximiser la couverture Wi-Fi.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8254" data-end=3D"8418" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8257" data-end=3D"8418" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
257" data-end=3D"8291">Passer =C3=A0 une norme plus rapide</strong> : Si po=
ssible, passez =C3=A0 la norme <strong data-start=3D"8325" data-end=3D"8347=
