</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3770" data-end=3D"3922" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3773" data-end=3D"3922" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
773" data-end=3D"3799">Appliquer la strat=C3=A9gie</strong> : Une fois la s=
trat=C3=A9gie configur=C3=A9e, cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"3848" data=
-end=3D"3861">Appliquer</strong> pour activer la QoS sur les interfaces r=
=C3=A9seau s=C3=A9lectionn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"3924" data-end=3D"3979" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3929" data-end=3D"3979">4. Configurer le Contr=C3=B4le de la Bande Passante=
</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3981" data-end=3D"4145" class=3D"">Dans la m=C3=AAme secti=
on de l'=C3=89diteur de strat=C3=A9gie de groupe, vous pouvez activer le co=
ntr=C3=B4le de la bande passante pour restreindre le d=C3=A9bit de certaine=
s applications :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4147" data-end=3D"4367">
<li data-start=3D"4147" data-end=3D"4233" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4150" data-end=3D"4233" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"4161" data-end=3D"4182">Planification QoS</strong> et activez l'o=
ption <strong data-start=3D"4203" data-end=3D"4232">Limiter la bande passan=
te</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4234" data-end=3D"4367" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4237" data-end=3D"4367" class=3D"">D=C3=A9finissez la band=
e passante maximale pour chaque application ou service afin de contr=C3=B4l=
er leur utilisation des ressources r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4369" data-end=3D"4372" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4374" data-end=3D"4442" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4377" data-end=3D"4442">3. Configurer la QoS =C3=A0 l'aide de la ligne de c=
ommande (Netsh)</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4444" data-end=3D"4545" class=3D"">Windows permet =C3=A9ga=
lement de configurer la QoS via la ligne de commande =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99aide =
de l'outil <strong data-start=3D"4535" data-end=3D"4544">Netsh</strong>.</p=
>
<h3 data-start=3D"4547" data-end=3D"4573" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4551" data-end=3D"4573">a. Acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 Netsh</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4575" data-end=3D"4832">
<li data-start=3D"4575" data-end=3D"4760" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4578" data-end=3D"4760" class=3D"">Ouvrez l'<strong data-s=
tart=3D"4587" data-end=3D"4610">Invite de commandes</strong> en tant qu'adm=
inistrateur (recherchez "cmd" dans le menu D=C3=A9marrer, puis faites un cl=
ic droit et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"4720" data-end=3D"4758"=
>Ex=C3=A9cuter en tant qu'administrateur</strong>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4761" data-end=3D"4832" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4764" data-end=3D"4832" class=3D"">Tapez <strong data-star=
t=3D"4770" data-end=3D"4779">netsh</strong> et appuyez sur <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"4795" data-end=3D"4805">Entr=C3=A9e</strong> pour ouvrir l'outil Nets=
h.</p>
</li>
</ol>
