<hr data-start=3D"5418" data-end=3D"5421" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5423" data-end=3D"5481" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5426" data-end=3D"5481">4. Surveillance et D=C3=A9pannage de la QoS sous Wi=
ndows</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5483" data-end=3D"5532" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5487" data-end=3D"5532">a. Utilisation du Moniteur de Performance</strong><=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"5534" data-end=3D"5665" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"5537" data-end=3D"5564">Moniteur de Performance</strong> (Performance M=
onitor) sous Windows peut =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=A9 pour suivre l'efficacit=C3=
=A9 de vos strat=C3=A9gies QoS.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5667" data-end=3D"6041">
<li data-start=3D"5667" data-end=3D"5768" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5670" data-end=3D"5768" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5677" data-end=3D"5700">Performance Monitor</strong> en tapant <stron=
g data-start=3D"5711" data-end=3D"5722">perfmon</strong> dans la bo=C3=AEte=
 <strong data-start=3D"5737" data-end=3D"5749">Ex=C3=A9cuter</strong> (<str=
ong data-start=3D"5751" data-end=3D"5766">Windows + R</strong>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5769" data-end=3D"5869" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5772" data-end=3D"5869" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"5783" data-end=3D"5811">Moniteur de performances</strong> &gt; <s=
trong data-start=3D"5814" data-end=3D"5840">Collecteurs de donn=C3=A9es</st=
rong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5843" data-end=3D"5868">Donn=C3=A9es en te=
mps r=C3=A9el</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5870" data-end=3D"6041" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5873" data-end=3D"6041" class=3D"">Cliquez sur <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5885" data-end=3D"5910">Ajouter des compteurs</strong> et s=C3=
=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"5927" data-end=3D"5934">QoS</strong> so=
us <strong data-start=3D"5940" data-end=3D"5961">Planification QoS</strong>=
 pour voir les statistiques li=C3=A9es =C3=A0 la gestion du trafic et =C3=
=A0 la bande passante.</p>
</li>
</ol>
