-start=3D"4590" data-end=3D"4604">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> &gt; <strong dat=
a-start=3D"4607" data-end=3D"4634">Mise =C3=A0 jour et s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</=
strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"4637" data-end=3D"4657">Options avanc=C3=
=A9es</strong> et s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"4674" data-end=3D=
"4716">Notifier pour planifier le red=C3=A9marrage</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4719" data-end=3D"5126" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4722" data-end=3D"4954" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
722" data-end=3D"4746">Windows Peer-to-Peer</strong> : Windows utilise parf=
ois des ressources r=C3=A9seau pour partager des mises =C3=A0 jour avec d'a=
utres PC (fonctionnement peer-to-peer). D=C3=A9sactivez cette fonction pour=
 =C3=A9viter la consommation de bande passante inutile.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4958" data-end=3D"5126">
<li data-start=3D"4958" data-end=3D"5126" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4960" data-end=3D"5126" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"4967" data-end=3D"4981">Param=C3=A8tres</strong> &gt; <strong data-st=
art=3D"4984" data-end=3D"5011">Mise =C3=A0 jour et s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</stro=
ng> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5014" data-end=3D"5046">Optimisation de la l=
ivraison</strong>, puis d=C3=A9sactivez l'option <strong data-start=3D"5073=
" data-end=3D"5125">Autoriser les t=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargements depuis d'autres=
 PC</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5128" data-end=3D"5131" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5133" data-end=3D"5209" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5136" data-end=3D"5209">3. Configuration du Planificateur de Paquets QoS (Q=
uality of Service)</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"5211" data-end=3D"5457" class=3D"">Si plusieurs applicatio=
ns partagent la bande passante, la configuration de la <strong data-start=
=3D"5289" data-end=3D"5296">QoS</strong> peut aider =C3=A0 assurer que des =
applications critiques (comme la VoIP ou la vid=C3=A9oconf=C3=A9rence) re=
=C3=A7oivent une priorit=C3=A9 plus =C3=A9lev=C3=A9e que des applications n=
on critiques.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5459" data-end=3D"5525" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5463" data-end=3D"5525">a. Cr=C3=A9er une strat=C3=A9gie QoS via le Planifi=
cateur de Paquets</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5527" data-end=3D"5917">
<li data-start=3D"5527" data-end=3D"5591" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5530" data-end=3D"5591" class=3D"">Ouvrez <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5537" data-end=3D"5551">gpedit.msc</strong> (=C3=89diteur de strat=C3=
=A9gie de groupe local).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5592" data-end=3D"5719" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5595" data-end=3D"5719" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"5606" data-end=3D"5639">Configuration de l'ordinateur</strong> &g=
t; <strong data-start=3D"5642" data-end=3D"5670">Mod=C3=A8les d'administrat=
ion</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5673" data-end=3D"5683">R=C3=A9seau=
</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"5686" data-end=3D"5718">Planificateur =
de paquets QoS</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5720" data-end=3D"5917" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5723" data-end=3D"5917" class=3D"">Activez et configurez l=
es strat=C3=A9gies pour les applications sensibles aux d=C3=A9lais. Par exe=
mple, vous pouvez d=C3=A9finir une bande passante minimale pour la VoIP afi=
n d'assurer des appels sans latence.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5919" data-end=3D"5967" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5923" data-end=3D"5967">b. Prioriser la bande passante via Netsh</strong></=
h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5969" data-end=3D"6219">
<li data-start=3D"5969" data-end=3D"6042" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5972" data-end=3D"6042" class=3D"">Ouvrez une <strong data=
-start=3D"5983" data-end=3D"6006">Invite de commandes</strong> avec des pri=
vil=C3=A8ges administratifs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6043" data-end=3D"6219" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6046" data-end=3D"6137" class=3D"">Utilisez la commande <s=
trong data-start=3D"6067" data-end=3D"6076">Netsh</strong> pour d=C3=A9fini=
r des priorit=C3=A9s QoS pour certaines applications :</p>
