<hr data-start=3D"8300" data-end=3D"8303" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8305" data-end=3D"8361" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8308" data-end=3D"8361">6. R=C3=A9solution des probl=C3=A8mes de performanc=
e r=C3=A9seau</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"8363" data-end=3D"8418" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8367" data-end=3D"8418">a. Diagnostiquer les conflits de bande passante</st=
rong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"8420" data-end=3D"8653">
<li data-start=3D"8420" data-end=3D"8507" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8423" data-end=3D"8507" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
423" data-end=3D"8432">Netsh</strong> peut =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=A9 pour anal=
yser les probl=C3=A8mes de QoS et de bande passante.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8508" data-end=3D"8653" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8511" data-end=3D"8653" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
511" data-end=3D"8549">V=C3=A9rifiez les journaux d=E2=80=99=C3=A9v=C3=A9ne=
ments</strong> dans <strong data-start=3D"8555" data-end=3D"8583">Observate=
ur d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements</strong> pour toute erreur li=C3=A9e =C3=A0 l'int=
erface r=C3=A9seau ou aux param=C3=A8tres TCP/IP.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"8655" data-end=3D"8698" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8659" data-end=3D"8698">b. R=C3=A9parer les connexions d=C3=A9grad=C3=A9es<=
/strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8700" data-end=3D"8905" class=3D"">Si vous rencontrez des =
probl=C3=A8mes persistants avec votre connexion =C3=A0 haut d=C3=A9bit, vou=
