trong data-start=3D"2946" data-end=3D"2969">Syst=C3=A8me et s=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"2972" data-end=3D"3001">Pare-feu Wi=
ndows Defender</strong> &gt; <strong data-start=3D"3004" data-end=3D"3026">=
Param=C3=A8tres avanc=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
