1410" data-end=3D"1464">b. Faciliter les Mises =C3=A0 Jour et les Modificat=
ions</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1465" data-end=3D"1728" class=3D"">Lorsque vous effectuez =
des changements sur des configurations r=C3=A9seau critiques (modification =
d=E2=80=99adresses IP, configuration des interfaces r=C3=A9seau, modificati=
ons de DNS, etc.), il est essentiel de pouvoir revenir rapidement aux param=
=C3=A8tres pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dents en cas d'erreur.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1730" data-end=3D"1774" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1734" data-end=3D"1774">c. Am=C3=A9liorer la R=C3=A9silience du R=C3=A9seau=
</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1775" data-end=3D"1957" class=3D"">En cas de sinistre, la =
sauvegarde des configurations r=C3=A9seau assure une continuit=C3=A9 de ser=
vice, car vous pouvez restaurer l=E2=80=99ensemble de la configuration avec=
 une intervention minimale.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1959" data-end=3D"1962" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1964" data-end=3D"2038" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1967" data-end=3D"2038">2. Composants de la Configuration R=C3=A9seau sous =
Windows =C3=A0 Sauvegarder</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2040" data-end=3D"2218" class=3D"">Avant de lancer une sau=
vegarde, il est crucial de savoir quelles parties des configurations r=C3=
=A9seau doivent =C3=AAtre prises en compte. Les principaux =C3=A9l=C3=A9men=
ts =C3=A0 sauvegarder incluent :</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2220" data-end=3D"2248" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2224" data-end=3D"2248">a. Interfaces R=C3=A9seau</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2249" data-end=3D"2367">
<li data-start=3D"2249" data-end=3D"2302" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2251" data-end=3D"2302" class=3D"">Param=C3=A8tres IP (adr=
esses IP statiques ou dynamiques)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2303" data-end=3D"2327" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2305" data-end=3D"2327" class=3D"">Masques de sous-r=C3=A9=
seau</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2328" data-end=3D"2352" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2330" data-end=3D"2352" class=3D"">Passerelles par d=C3=A9=
faut</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2353" data-end=3D"2367" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2355" data-end=3D"2367" class=3D"">Serveurs DNS</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2369" data-end=3D"2395" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2373" data-end=3D"2395">b. Param=C3=A8tres DHCP</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2396" data-end=3D"2516" class=3D"">Les configurations du s=
erveur DHCP, telles que les plages d'adresses IP attribu=C3=A9es et les opt=
ions sp=C3=A9cifiques au r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2518" data-end=3D"2550" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2522" data-end=3D"2550">c. Param=C3=A8tres de Routage</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2551" data-end=3D"2672" class=3D"">Les configurations de r=
outage statique et dynamique utilis=C3=A9es pour acheminer le trafic entre =
les diff=C3=A9rents sous-r=C3=A9seaux.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2674" data-end=3D"2718" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2678" data-end=3D"2718">d. R=C3=A8gles de Pare-feu et de S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9=
</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2719" data-end=3D"2814" class=3D"">Les r=C3=A8gles d=C3=A9=
finissant les connexions entrantes et sortantes autoris=C3=A9es sur votre r=
=C3=A9seau local.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2816" data-end=3D"2878" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2820" data-end=3D"2878">e. Configurations de VLAN (Virtual Local Area Netwo=
rk)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2879" data-end=3D"3014" class=3D"">Les param=C3=A8tres qui=
 d=C3=A9finissent les VLANs (identification des VLANs, les interfaces assoc=
i=C3=A9es et les param=C3=A8tres de routage entre VLANs).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3016" data-end=3D"3019" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3021" data-end=3D"3099" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3024" data-end=3D"3099">3. Outils Int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9s =C3=A0 Windows pour Sa=
uvegarder les Configurations R=C3=A9seau</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3101" data-end=3D"3238" class=3D"">Windows offre plusieurs=
 outils int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9s pour sauvegarder et restaurer les configurations=
 r=C3=A9seau. Voici les principaux outils =C3=A0 utiliser :</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3240" data-end=3D"3290" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3244" data-end=3D"3290">a. Sauvegarde via les Commandes PowerShell</strong>=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3292" data-end=3D"3397" class=3D"">PowerShell offre une m=
=C3=A9thode avanc=C3=A9e et flexible pour sauvegarder et restaurer les conf=
igurations r=C3=A9seau.</p>
