<h3 data-start=3D"6221" data-end=3D"6300" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6225" data-end=3D"6300">a. Utilisation de l'outil de Sauvegarde Windows (Wi=
ndows Server Backup)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6302" data-end=3D"6432" class=3D"">Windows Server propose =
un outil graphique pour effectuer des sauvegardes compl=C3=A8tes du syst=C3=
=A8me, incluant les configurations r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6434" data-end=3D"7058">
<li data-start=3D"6434" data-end=3D"6563" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6437" data-end=3D"6474" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
437" data-end=3D"6472">Acc=C3=A9dez =C3=A0 la Sauvegarde Windows</strong> :=
</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6478" data-end=3D"6563">
<li data-start=3D"6478" data-end=3D"6559" class=3D"">
