trong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6616" data-end=3D"6838">
<li data-start=3D"6616" data-end=3D"6688" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6618" data-end=3D"6688" class=3D"">Dans l'outil de sauvega=
rde, s=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"6659" data-end=3D"6687">Sauveg=
arde personnalis=C3=A9e</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6692" data-end=3D"6838" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6694" data-end=3D"6838" class=3D"">Choisissez de sauvegard=
er <strong data-start=3D"6720" data-end=3D"6778">les param=C3=A8tres du sys=
t=C3=A8me et les configurations r=C3=A9seau</strong>. Cela inclut les fichi=
ers de configuration r=C3=A9seau associ=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6840" data-end=3D"7058" class=3D"">
