<hr data-start=3D"4187" data-end=3D"4190" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4192" data-end=3D"4283" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4195" data-end=3D"4283">3. Utilisation des Outils de Sauvegarde et Restaura=
tion Windows pour la R=C3=A9cup=C3=A9ration</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4285" data-end=3D"4437" class=3D"">Windows propose des out=
ils graphiques et de ligne de commande pour faciliter la sauvegarde et la r=
estauration des configurations r=C3=A9seau en cas de panne.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4439" data-end=3D"4502" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4443" data-end=3D"4502">a. Sauvegarde et Restauration via Windows Server Ba=
ckup</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"4504" data-end=3D"4564" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4509" data-end=3D"4564">i. Sauvegarde du Syst=C3=A8me avec Windows Server B=
ackup</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"4566" data-end=3D"4715" class=3D"">L'outil <strong data-st=
art=3D"4574" data-end=3D"4599">Windows Server Backup</strong> permet de sau=
vegarder non seulement les configurations r=C3=A9seau, mais =C3=A9galement =
l'ensemble des param=C3=A8tres du serveur.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4717" data-end=3D"5062">
<li data-start=3D"4717" data-end=3D"4872" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4720" data-end=3D"4757" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
720" data-end=3D"4755">Acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 Windows Server Backup</strong> :=
</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4761" data-end=3D"4872">
<li data-start=3D"4761" data-end=3D"4872" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4763" data-end=3D"4872" class=3D"">Ouvrez le <strong data-=
start=3D"4773" data-end=3D"4800">Gestionnaire de serveur</strong>, puis cli=
quez sur <strong data-start=3D"4819" data-end=3D"4829">Outils</strong> et s=
=C3=A9lectionnez <strong data-start=3D"4846" data-end=3D"4871">Windows Serv=
er Backup</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4874" data-end=3D"5062" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4877" data-end=3D"4921" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
877" data-end=3D"4919">Effectuer une Sauvegarde Personnalis=C3=A9e</strong>=
 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4925" data-end=3D"5062">
<li data-start=3D"4925" data-end=3D"5062" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4927" data-end=3D"5062" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4940" data-end=3D"4968">Sauvegarde personnalis=C3=A9e</str=
ong> et incluez les <strong data-start=3D"4984" data-end=3D"5006">param=C3=
=A8tres syst=C3=A8me</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"5010" data-end=3D"50=
39">les configurations r=C3=A9seau</strong> dans votre sauvegarde.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"5064" data-end=3D"5130" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5069" data-end=3D"5130">ii. Restauration des Param=C3=A8tres =C3=A0 Partir =
de la Sauvegarde</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"5132" data-end=3D"5386">
<li data-start=3D"5132" data-end=3D"5386" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5135" data-end=3D"5179" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
135" data-end=3D"5177">Restaurer une Sauvegarde Personnalis=C3=A9e</strong>=
 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5183" data-end=3D"5386">
<li data-start=3D"5183" data-end=3D"5253" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5185" data-end=3D"5253" class=3D"">Acc=C3=A9dez =C3=A0 <st=
rong data-start=3D"5195" data-end=3D"5220">Windows Server Backup</strong>, =
puis cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"5239" data-end=3D"5252">Restaurer</s=
trong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5257" data-end=3D"5386" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5259" data-end=3D"5386" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez la sa=
uvegarde sp=C3=A9cifique que vous souhaitez restaurer et suivez les =C3=A9t=
apes pour r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rer la configuration r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5388" data-end=3D"5467" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5392" data-end=3D"5467">b. Restauration de la Configuration R=C3=A9seau =C3=
=A0 Partir des Sauvegardes DNS</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5469" data-end=3D"5642" class=3D"">Si vous avez configur=
